ariously forgetful Dory, the laid-back sea turtle Crush, and the supportive Tank Gang, father and son must discover the hero within themselves as they navigate the deep to find one another.\n\nBubbling with laughs, toe-tapping songs, and beautiful larger-than-life puppets, Finding Nemo is a joyful musical journey to celebrate the season together.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":"Music Theatre International","image":"9Meg9fUkr4hj-hkhVmAA2g","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/"},{"id":"06677008-81f3-4dd7-b5f2-86a432e60512","name":"'Tis the Season Children's Art Exhibition","dates":[1795014000000,1795100400000,1795186800000,1795273200000,1795446000000,1795532400000,1795618800000,1795705200000,1795791600000,1795878000000,1796050800000,1796137200000,1796223600000,1796310000000,1796396400000,1796482800000,1796655600000,1796742000000,1796828400000,1796914800000,1797001200000,1797087600000,1797260400000,1797346800000,1797433200000],"start":"2026-11-18T10:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-16T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Assembly Hall Gallery","address":"1 Colonel Samuel Smith Park Dr, Etobicoke, ON, M8V 4B6","lat":43.59766044,"lng":-79.515824559},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Created by students from local schools, the works in this exhibition speak to the seasonal changes from autumn to winter, like snowfalls and long periods of darkness, and the cultural traditions they help shape.\n\nCelebrate the exhibition during the Community Open House with friends, family and neighbours. Enjoy live entertainment, activities, crafts and cultural displays. Vote for your favourite artwork in the 'Tis the Season People's Choice Awards. ","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Artisan","Family/Children"],"presenter":null,"image":"0Vu5Uuz38dT4t30GYNeZ2A","website":"https://assembly.