e depicts various forms of body modification to demonstrate how physical changes can have a sacred, transformative, spiritual effect that exceeds the body’s limitation. Udeh creates technically skilled, conceptually grounded drawings that balance realism with imagination; quiet yet powerful visual meditations explore what it means to watch and be watched.\n\nReception: August 15, 2–4 p.m.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"aT6_lLHg3nQFe3YvB7TNHQ","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/etobicoke-civic-centre-art-gallery/","tickets":null},{"id":"12d968be-7db1-4e4c-a28d-2a7c9fe06091","name":"Sketch Party","dates":[1769904000000,1771718400000,1774738800000,1777158000000,1779577200000,1781996400000,1784415600000,1786834800000,1789254000000,1792278000000,1795305600000,1797724800000],"start":"2026-01-31T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-19T19:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Comedy Bar","address":"945 Bloor Street W, Toronto, ON, M6H 1L5","lat":43.66148,"lng":-79.428242},"free":false,"low":23,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each month we're partying HARD and bringing the best sketch comedy this city has to offer, from the hottest up and coming troupes to long time fan favourite troupes and solo acts.\n\nGet ready for a wild night of expecting the unexpected and, of course, sketch comedy. Bring your best party trick and enjoy the vibes. There ain't no party like a S-KETCH PARTY!\n\nYou won’t want to miss this monthly shindig, come party-hardy with us!","categories":["Comedy"],"presenter":null,"image":"IoEFS6qmP2peTL7SwyQW_w","website":"https://comedybar.ca/shows/sketch-party","tickets":null},{"id":"f731ff51-53fc-440c-a97b-c5d4c2526f83","name":"Sketch Party","dates":[1769904000000,1771718400000,1774738800000,1777158000000,1779577200000,1781996400000,1784415600000,1786834800000,1789254000000,1792278000000,1795305600000,1797724800000],"start":"2026-01-31T19:0