an intimate and elegant concert setting.\n\nFrom jazz’s greatest hits and Brazilian bossa nova to the timeless music of George Gershwin, festive holiday swing, and Italian classics reimagined, this series invites audiences to discover the music they love, performed with artistry, imagination, and style.\n\nWhether you’re a devoted jazz fan or a curious first‑time listener, this series offers a welcoming and richly rewarding journey through the sound, history, and spirit of jazz.","categories":["Live Performances","Music"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://www.villacharities.com/culture-heritage/cultural-programming/new-cultural-events/#Jazz-at-the-Columbus-Centre","tickets":"https://www.villacharities.com/culture-heritage/cultural-programming/new-cultural-events/#Jazz-at-the-Columbus-Centre"},{"id":"d6a329f5-00a7-4635-b743-f14d767818e0","name":"Ritual / Still Without Shelter","dates":[1786017600000,1786104000000,1786197600000,1786363200000,1786449600000,1786536000000,1786622400000,1786708800000,1786802400000,1786968000000,1787054400000,1787140800000,1787227200000,1787313600000,1787407200000,1787572800000,1787659200000,1787745600000,1787832000000,1787918400000,1788012000000,1788177600000,1788264000000,1788350400000,1788436800000,1788523200000,1788616800000,1788782400000,1788868800000,1788955200000,1789041600000,1789128000000,1789221600000,1789387200000,1789473600000,1789560000000,1789646400000,1789732800000,1789826400000,1789992000000,1790078400000,1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790431200000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791036000000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791640800000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792245600000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000,1792670400000,1792756800000,1792850400000,1793016000000,1793102400000,1793188800000,1793275200000],"start":"2026-08-06T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-29T08:00:00-0