07 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5T 2W6","lat":43.651713739404556,"lng":-79.40508261942017},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Market 707 is a stretch of sidewalk near Dundas and Bathurst lined with upcycled shipping containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"25e873d2-d544-49a2-b16e-86f5ba5f9a97","name":"Underpass Park Farmers' Market","dates":[1778788800000,1779393600000,1779998400000,1780603200000,1781208000000,1781812800000,1782417600000,1783022400000,1783627200000,1784232000000,1784836800000,1785441600000,1786046400000,1786651200000,1787256000000,1787860800000,1788465600000,1789070400000,1789675200000,1790280000000,1790884800000,1791489600000,1792094400000],"start":"2026-05-14T16:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-15T16:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Underpass Park","address":"29 Lower River Street, Toronto, ON M5A 1M6","lat":43.65585,"lng":-79.354586},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the magic of Underpass Park Farmers' Market—a vibrant gem in Toronto's Corktown and one of the city's most unique farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"c425a8bc-0918-4f3b-8c29-df5feaf87ae4","name":"Underpass Park Farmers' Market","dates":[1778788800000,1779393600000,1779998400000,1780603200000,1781208000000,1781812800000,1782417600000,1783022400000,1783627200000,1784232000000,1784836800000,1785441600000,1786046400000,1786651200000,1787256000000,1787860800000,1788465600000,1789070400000,1789675200000,1790280000000,1790884800000,1791489600000,1792094400000],"start":"2026-05-14T16:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-15T16:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Underpass Park","address":"29 Lower River Street, Toronto, ON M5A 1M6","lat":43.65585,"lng":-79.354586},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the magic of Underpass Park Farmers' Market—a vibrant gem in Toronto's Corktown and one of the city's most unique farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"b065f4be-2f29-4abb-9a48-47285e954f01","name":"Junction Farmers' Market","dates":[1778936400000,1779541200000,1780146000000,1780750800000,1781355600000,1781960400000,1782565200000,1783170000000,1783774800000,1784379600000,1784984400000,1785589200000,1786194000000,1786798800000,1787403600000,1788008400000,1788613200000,1789218000000,1789822800000,1790427600000,1791032400000,1791637200000,1792242000000,1792846800000,1793451600000],"start":"2026-05-16T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Baird Park","address":"275 Keele St, Toronto, ON M6P 2K5, Canada","lat":43.663023721805715,"lng":-79.46217817047676},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Step into the lively Junction Farmers Market, where every visit is a celebration of fresh, local, and sustainably produced food! Join a vibrant community supporting passionate growers and producers while discovering delicious finds around every corner.\n\nExperience the joy of healthy, accessible food for everyone in and around the Junction—your next great food adventure starts here!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"1QtxyeTQD-ylYXlIjttO-g","website":"https://junctionmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"89a9b166-6ac7-4d0b-ac47-bda8a0e81959","name":"Junction Farmers' Market","dates":[1778936400000,1779541200000,1780146000000,1780750800000,1781355600000,1781960400000,1782565200000,1783170000000,1783774800000,1784379600000,1784984400000,1785589200000,1786194000000,1786798800000,1787403600000,1788008400000,1788613200000,1789218000000,1789822800000,1790427600000,1791032400000,1791637200000,1792242000000,1792846800000,1793451600000],"start":"2026-05-16T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Baird Park","address":"275 Keele St, Toronto, ON M6P 2K5, Canada","lat":43.663023721805715,"lng":-79.46217817047676},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Step into the lively Junction Farmers Market, where every visit is a celebration of fresh, local, and sustainably produced food! Join a vibrant community supporting passionate growers and producers while discovering delicious finds around every corner.\n\nExperience the joy of healthy, accessible food for everyone in and around the Junction—your next great food adventure starts here!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"1QtxyeTQD-ylYXlIjttO-g","website":"https://junctionmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"39c809d3-bfb5-4df2-924d-36b46e9b021d","name":"The Stop Farmers' Market @ Wychwood Barns Park","dates":[1779537600000,1780142400000,1780747200000,1781352000000,1781956800000,1782561600000,1783166400000,1783771200000,1784376000000,1784980800000,1785585600000,1786190400000,1786795200000,1787400000000,1788004800000,1788609600000,1789214400000,1789819200000,1790424000000,1791028800000,1791633600000,1792238400000,1792843200000,1793448000000,1794056400000,1794661200000,1795266000000,1795870800000,1796475600000,1797080400000,1797685200000],"start":"2026-05-23T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-19T08:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Wychwood Barns Park","address":"601 Christie St, Toronto, ON, M6G 4C7","lat":43.679958839,"lng":-79.424094918},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Featuring 35+ weekly vendors, the market brings together local farmers, food producers, and neighbours to increase access to healthy food in ways that build community. A program of The Stop Community Food Centre, the market supports both emerging and established small-scale producers while strengthening a resilient local food economy through responsibly grown and produced food. The market is committed to affordability, supporting racialized vendors, and creating welcoming, community-driven public spaces. Reflecting the diverse cultures of the neighbourhood and the broader GTA, the market celebrates the many food traditions that make Toronto vibrant.\n\nCome visit and support our year-round community market operating every Saturday in the Bathurst–St. Clair neighbourhood.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WHwqoysoRgdbIoHAZWiAw","website":"https://www.thestop.org/farmersmarket/","tickets":null},{"id":"ed095308-f830-41bb-89fb-762ac48cbe25","name":"North York Farmers' Market","dates":[1779969600000,1780574400000,1781179200000,1781784000000,1782388800000,1782993600000,1783598400000,1784203200000,1784808000000,1785412800000,1786017600000,1786622400000,1787227200000,1787832000000,1788436800000,1789041600000,1789646400000,1790251200000,1790856000000,1791460800000],"start":"2026-05-28T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-08T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Mel Lastman Square","address":"5100 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 5V7","lat":43.768067488538286,"lng":-79.41329517024496},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"From Farm to Table. We make it, WE bake it, and grow it for you! The perfect place to shop for fresh fruits, vegetables, honey, maple syrup and flowers. In addition we offer a fine selections of delicious breads, pastries, cheeses and cured meats.\n\nHeld from Mya to October every Thursday,, come and meet our local farmers and vendors who display their best fresh produce and variety of products. Such as rhubarb, strawberries, and asparagus in the early summer to squash and pumpkins in the fall. Most importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"e77824fc-7de2-4b12-9a30-185aa03416d0","name":"North York Farmers' Market","dates":[1779969600000,1780574400000,1781179200000,1781784000000,1782388800000,1782993600000,1783598400000,1784203200000,1784808000000,1785412800000,1786017600000,1786622400000,1787227200000,1787832000000,1788436800000,1789041600000,1789646400000,1790251200000,1790856000000,1791460800000],"start":"2026-05-28T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-08T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Mel Lastman Square","address":"5100 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 5V7","lat":43.768067488538286,"lng":-79.41329517024496},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"From Farm to Table. We make it, WE bake it, and grow it for you! The perfect place to shop for fresh fruits, vegetables, honey, maple syrup and flowers. In addition we offer a fine selections of delicious breads, pastries, cheeses and cured meats.\n\nHeld from Mya to October every Thursday,, come and meet our local farmers and vendors who display their best fresh produce and variety of products. Such as rhubarb, strawberries, and asparagus in the early summer to squash and pumpkins in the fall. Most importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"392d791f-ec49-41b5-8f5b-a287956bcf2b","name":"Thorncliffe Park Women Community Bazaar","dates":[1778869800000,1779474600000,1780079400000,1780684200000,1781289000000,1781893800000,1782498600000,1783103400000,1783708200000,1784313000000,1784917800000,1785522600000,1786127400000,1786732200000,1787337000000,1787941800000,1788546600000,1789151400000,1789756200000,1790361000000,1790965800000,1791570600000],"start":"2026-05-15T14:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-09T14:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Burguess Park","address":"46 Thorncliffe Park Dr, East York, ON M4H 1K8","lat":43.703975361240246,"lng":-79.34348238869404},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"A grassroots women led organization dedicated to creating and implementing public space enhancement projects in the community of Thorncliffe Park. The community bazaar happens every Friday during from June to October. As vendors at our weekly markets, women from the neighbourhood are able to advance the skills and knowledge they already possess, and are provided with opportunities to gain new ones that can translate into better employment opportunities.\n\n","categories":["Cultural","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"fO6IaSWH7zDJNLIydPtWHA","website":"https://tpwomenscomm.org/our-community-market/","tickets":null},{"id":"31506ff1-dfa0-4697-8b92-db8db692f804","name":"Junction Farmers' Market","dates":[1778936400000,1779541200000,1780146000000,1780750800000,1781355600000,1781960400000,1782565200000,1783170000000,1783774800000,1784379600000,1784984400000,1785589200000,1786194000000,1786798800000,1787403600000,1788008400000,1788613200000,1789218000000,1789822800000,1790427600000,1791032400000,1791637200000,1792242000000,1792846800000,1793451600000],"start":"2026-05-16T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Baird Park","address":"275 Keele St, Toronto, ON M6P 2K5, Canada","lat":43.663023721805715,"lng":-79.46217817047676},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Step into the lively Junction Farmers Market, where every visit is a celebration of fresh, local, and sustainably produced food! Join a vibrant community supporting passionate growers and producers while discovering delicious finds around every corner.\n\nExperience the joy of healthy, accessible food for everyone in and around the Junction—your next great food adventure starts here!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"1QtxyeTQD-ylYXlIjttO-g","website":"https://junctionmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"a9b82da1-741e-408b-b2b9-1937ac7906c7","name":"Sorauren Farmers' Market","dates":[1777921200000,1778526000000,1779130800000,1779735600000,1780340400000,1780945200000,1781550000000,1782154800000,1782759600000,1783364400000,1783969200000,1784574000000,1785178800000,1785783600000,1786388400000,1786993200000,1787598000000,1788202800000,1788807600000,1789412400000,1790017200000,1790622000000,1791226800000,1791831600000,1792436400000,1793041200000],"start":"2026-05-04T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-26T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Sorauren Park","address":"50 Wabash Ave, Toronto, ON M6R 1N2, Canada","lat":43.648147722995105,"lng":-79.44310115767041},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"This year round farmers' Market operates during the outdoor season, we operate in Sorauren Park which is a beautiful greenspace managed by the City of Toronto and animated by community group, Friends of Sorauren Park. Along with the Farmers’ Market, you’ll find an ice skating rink, dog walking park, community pizza oven, children’s soccer and baseball programmes and even movie nights and an annual pumpkin parade!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"pratsPJvmGxDUcIhkbTofA","website":"https://www.soraurenmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"ff1bc9e9-7576-4274-82d9-114332e44f1b","name":"Junction Farmers' Market","dates":[1778936400000,1779541200000,1780146000000,1780750800000,1781355600000,1781960400000,1782565200000,1783170000000,1783774800000,1784379600000,1784984400000,1785589200000,1786194000000,1786798800000,1787403600000,1788008400000,1788613200000,1789218000000,1789822800000,1790427600000,1791032400000,1791637200000,1792242000000,1792846800000,1793451600000],"start":"2026-05-16T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Baird Park","address":"275 Keele St, Toronto, ON M6P 2K5, Canada","lat":43.663023721805715,"lng":-79.46217817047676},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Step into the lively Junction Farmers Market, where every visit is a celebration of fresh, local, and sustainably produced food! Join a vibrant community supporting passionate growers and producers while discovering delicious finds around every corner.\n\nExperience the joy of healthy, accessible food for everyone in and around the Junction—your next great food adventure starts here!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"1QtxyeTQD-ylYXlIjttO-g","website":"https://junctionmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"7b3dbecc-27b5-4cf1-8bfc-c1cbdcb5d87b","name":"East York Farmers' Market","dates":[1778587200000,1779192000000,1779796800000,1780401600000,1781006400000,1781611200000,1782216000000,1782820800000,1783425600000,1784030400000,1784635200000,1785240000000,1785844800000,1786449600000,1787054400000,1787659200000,1788264000000,1788868800000,1789473600000,1790078400000,1790683200000,1791288000000,1791892800000,1792497600000,1793102400000],"start":"2026-05-12T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"East York Civic Centre","address":"850 Coxwell Ave, East York, ON M4C 5R1","lat":43.69130125251015,"lng":-79.3283791194498},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Thank you all for a wonderful opening day! It was so lovely to see everyone again after a very long winter. \nHere’s to a fantastic 2026 market season full of delicious, local produce and so much more!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"WxjChgoUOpqklJ1chm1hgQ","website":"https://juliekinnear.com/blogs/east-york-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"ecf3f933-9555-41e0-bd5a-a6c744548044","name":"East York Farmers' Market","dates":[1778587200000,1779192000000,1779796800000,1780401600000,1781006400000,1781611200000,1782216000000,1782820800000,1783425600000,1784030400000,1784635200000,1785240000000,1785844800000,1786449600000,1787054400000,1787659200000,1788264000000,1788868800000,1789473600000,1790078400000,1790683200000,1791288000000,1791892800000,1792497600000,1793102400000],"start":"2026-05-12T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"East York Civic Centre","address":"850 Coxwell Ave, East York, ON M4C 5R1","lat":43.69130125251015,"lng":-79.3283791194498},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Thank you all for a wonderful opening day! It was so lovely to see everyone again after a very long winter. \nHere’s to a fantastic 2026 market season full of delicious, local produce and so much more!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"WxjChgoUOpqklJ1chm1hgQ","website":"https://juliekinnear.com/blogs/east-york-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"35c8814c-4084-41c7-ae58-f18447145207","name":"East York Farmers' Market","dates":[1778587200000,1779192000000,1779796800000,1780401600000,1781006400000,1781611200000,1782216000000,1782820800000,1783425600000,1784030400000,1784635200000,1785240000000,1785844800000,1786449600000,1787054400000,1787659200000,1788264000000,1788868800000,1789473600000,1790078400000,1790683200000,1791288000000,1791892800000,1792497600000,1793102400000],"start":"2026-05-12T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"East York Civic Centre","address":"850 Coxwell Ave, East York, ON M4C 5R1","lat":43.69130125251015,"lng":-79.3283791194498},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Thank you all for a wonderful opening day! It was so lovely to see everyone again after a very long winter. \nHere’s to a fantastic 2026 market season full of delicious, local produce and so much more!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"WxjChgoUOpqklJ1chm1hgQ","website":"https://juliekinnear.com/blogs/east-york-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"6e16debc-8d4f-4a67-8239-cb7921c1415e","name":"East York Farmers' Market","dates":[1778587200000,1779192000000,1779796800000,1780401600000,1781006400000,1781611200000,1782216000000,1782820800000,1783425600000,1784030400000,1784635200000,1785240000000,1785844800000,1786449600000,1787054400000,1787659200000,1788264000000,1788868800000,1789473600000,1790078400000,1790683200000,1791288000000,1791892800000,1792497600000,1793102400000],"start":"2026-05-12T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"East York Civic Centre","address":"850 Coxwell Ave, East York, ON M4C 5R1","lat":43.69130125251015,"lng":-79.3283791194498},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Thank you all for a wonderful opening day! It was so lovely to see everyone again after a very long winter. \nHere’s to a fantastic 2026 market season full of delicious, local produce and so much more!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"WxjChgoUOpqklJ1chm1hgQ","website":"https://juliekinnear.com/blogs/east-york-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"f6cee41c-7f60-4022-9175-297e0515c56c","name":"Scarborough Farmers' Market","dates":[1780428600000,1781033400000,1781638200000,1782243000000,1782847800000,1783452600000,1784057400000,1784662200000,1785267000000,1785871800000,1786476600000,1787081400000,1787686200000,1788291000000,1788895800000,1789500600000,1790105400000,1790710200000,1791315000000],"start":"2026-06-02T15:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-06T15:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Cynthia Lai - Rosebank Park","address":"1051 Progress Ave, Scarborough, ON M1B 5M2","lat":43.79259399732396,"lng":-79.23363880409994},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Our mission then, as it is now, is to bring nutrient-dense, fairly priced, culturally appropriate, fresh fruits, vegetables, and lifestyle products to the people of Scarborough.\n \nOur vendor team consists of family-owned farms, women-led enterprises, and ethno-cultural businesses that represent the true diversity and richness of Toronto, the most multicultural city in the world.\n \nIn keeping with the Toronto Food Strategy, the Scarborough Farmers' Market aims to make fresh local food, and nutrition information accessible to all. \nWe partner with Feeding the City Laboratory at the University of Toronto Scarborough to inform researchers how alternative food distribution is practiced by and for Scarborough community members.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":" Red Onion Events & Vision Quest Event Management","image":"opMdrjjDdedtZ9TK-_ML4Q","website":"https://www.scarboroughfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"ab3cd61a-d62d-4dbc-95be-f4d5459b2792","name":"Scarborough Farmers' Market","dates":[1780428600000,1781033400000,1781638200000,1782243000000,1782847800000,1783452600000,1784057400000,1784662200000,1785267000000,1785871800000,1786476600000,1787081400000,1787686200000,1788291000000,1788895800000,1789500600000,1790105400000,1790710200000,1791315000000],"start":"2026-06-02T15:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-06T15:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Cynthia Lai - Rosebank Park","address":"1051 Progress Ave, Scarborough, ON M1B 5M2","lat":43.79259399732396,"lng":-79.23363880409994},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Our mission then, as it is now, is to bring nutrient-dense, fairly priced, culturally appropriate, fresh fruits, vegetables, and lifestyle products to the people of Scarborough.\n \nOur vendor team consists of family-owned farms, women-led enterprises, and ethno-cultural businesses that represent the true diversity and richness of Toronto, the most multicultural city in the world.\n \nIn keeping with the Toronto Food Strategy, the Scarborough Farmers' Market aims to make fresh local food, and nutrition information accessible to all. \nWe partner with Feeding the City Laboratory at the University of Toronto Scarborough to inform researchers how alternative food distribution is practiced by and for Scarborough community members.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":" Red Onion Events & Vision Quest Event Management","image":"opMdrjjDdedtZ9TK-_ML4Q","website":"https://www.scarboroughfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"68354a50-e23c-44ba-a7ef-aabab7ef393b","name":"The Leslieville Farmers' Market","dates":[1778418000000,1779022800000,1779627600000,1780232400000,1780837200000,1781442000000,1782046800000,1782651600000,1783256400000,1783861200000,1784466000000,1785070800000,1785675600000,1786280400000,1786885200000,1787490000000,1788094800000,1788699600000,1789304400000,1789909200000,1790514000000,1791118800000,1791723600000,1792328400000,1792933200000],"start":"2026-05-10T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Greenwood Park","address":"150 Greenwood Ave, Toronto","lat":43.669638096,"lng":-79.328165388},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each week, the Market brings together local farmers, food producers, artisans, small businesses, live music, and community programming for a lively Sunday gathering in the park.\n\nCome eat, dance, picnic and spend the day in beautiful Greenwood Park while supporting local food systems, small businesses, and community connection in Toronto’s east end! \n\nThe Leslieville Farmers’ Market is a non-profit outdoor farmers’ market held every Sunday in Greenwood Park from May to October. From November to May, the Market moves indoors to the East End Food Hub, with a short winter break in January and February.\n\nSee you Sunday!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"CzJE0RU9YcS__qOfyUvUWA","website":"https://www.leslievillemarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"3f283f9f-0b26-42cf-8a8d-88916493f03a","name":"Downsview Park Merchants Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000,1798297200000,1798383600000,1798902000000,1798988400000,1799506800000,1799593200000,1800111600000,1800198000000,1800716400000,1800802800000,1801321200000,1801407600000,1801926000000,1802012400000,1802530800000,1802617200000,1803135600000,1803222000000,1803740400000,1803826800000,1804345200000,1804431600000,1804950000000,1805032800000,1805551200000,1805637600000,1806156000000,1806242400000,1806760800000,1806847200000,1807365600000,1807452000000,1807970400000,1808056800000,1808575200000,1808661600000,1809180000000,1809266400000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-02T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"40 Carl Hall Rd","address":"40 Carl Hall Rd, North York, ON, M3K 2C1","lat":43.7483766822,"lng":-79.4791132214},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Downsview Park Merchants Market is one of Toronto’s vibrant weekend destinations, offering a dynamic indoor marketplace experience for shoppers of all ages. Located in North York, the market features a diverse mix of local vendors offering clothing, accessories, home goods, beauty products, electronics, toys, collectibles, gifts, fresh produce, specialty items, and incredible deals. Visitors can also explore the farmers market section featuring fresh fruits, vegetables, and locally sourced goods, alongside an international food court offering a variety of delicious global cuisines and authentic flavours. With a lively, family-friendly atmosphere, the market is a perfect destination for bargain hunters, families, food lovers, and those looking to support local and small businesses. Open every Saturday and Sunday from 10 AM to 5 PM, Downsview Park Merchants Market combines shopping, food, culture, and community into one exciting weekend experience in Toronto.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"HsINX9unS5aRBvcRR5D6QA","website":"https://www.dpmarket.com","tickets":null},{"id":"43aa3f14-0770-4cda-a2f5-3678b784cc29","name":"Allan Gardens Saturday Farmers' Market","dates":[1777730400000,1778335200000,1778940000000,1779544800000,1780149600000,1780754400000,1781359200000,1781964000000,1782568800000,1783173600000,1783778400000,1784383200000,1784988000000,1785592800000,1786197600000,1786802400000,1787407200000,1788012000000,1788616800000,1789221600000,1789826400000,1790431200000,1791036000000,1791640800000,1792245600000,1792850400000,1793455200000,1794063600000,1794668400000,1795273200000,1795878000000,1796482800000,1797087600000,1797692400000,1798297200000,1798902000000,1799506800000,1800111600000,1800716400000,1801321200000,1801926000000,1802530800000,1803135600000,1803740400000,1804345200000,1804950000000,1805551200000,1806156000000,1806760800000,1807365600000,1807970400000,1808575200000,1809180000000],"start":"2026-05-02T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-01T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Children's Conservatory","address":"19 Horticultural Ave, Toronto, ON, M5A 2P2","lat":43.661418998,"lng":-79.37480223},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Celebrate local food, community, and sustainable agriculture. Discover fresh produce, artisanal products, and small-scale producers - all while connecting with the people who grow and create them.We invite you to come meet the vendors, discover new favourites, and taste the heart of your community!\n\nThe Allan Gardens Farmers’ Market facilitates a direct exchange between local farmers, food producers, artisan makers, and consumers. Everything sold at the market (50%+1) must be grown, sourced, made, and/or prepared in Toronto and the surrounding  area—ensuring that every purchase supports your neighbourhood economy.\n\nJoin us year- round every Saturday from 10am-2pm, in the beautiful Allan Gardens Children’s Conservatory & Teaching Garden. ","categories":["Farmers' Market"],"presenter":null,"image":"1_2B-asoDqdvJSyiKMPiaQ","website":"https://www.friendsofallangardens.ca/saturday-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"4eca65ac-8050-47d1-82c6-16bc1b2ee420","name":"Saturday Farmers' Market","dates":[1779526800000,1780131600000,1780736400000,1781341200000,1781946000000,1782550800000,1783155600000,1783760400000,1784365200000,1784970000000,1785574800000,1786179600000,1786784400000,1787389200000,1787994000000,1788598800000,1789203600000,1789808400000,1790413200000,1791018000000,1791622800000,1792227600000,1792832400000,1793437200000,1794045600000,1794650400000,1795255200000,1795860000000,1796464800000,1797069600000,1797674400000,1798279200000,1798884000000],"start":"2026-05-23T05:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-01-02T05:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence North Market","address":"92 Front St E, Toronto","lat":43.649145,"lng":-79.371526},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Visit the Saturday Farmers' Market in the newly redeveloped St. Lawrence Market North building. Discover seasonal produce, baked goods, meats, cheeses, flowers and pantry staples from local vendors all under one roof.","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"a0PsB9WOlmzpz_7ENsYW_A","website":"https://www.stlawrencemarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"2407aa41-f9af-4b79-899a-3d61cbec2692","name":"Saturday Farmers' Market","dates":[1779526800000,1780131600000,1780736400000,1781341200000,1781946000000,1782550800000,1783155600000,1783760400000,1784365200000,1784970000000,1785574800000,1786179600000,1786784400000,1787389200000,1787994000000,1788598800000,1789203600000,1789808400000,1790413200000,1791018000000,1791622800000,1792227600000,1792832400000,1793437200000,1794045600000,1794650400000,1795255200000,1795860000000,17964