f Sorauren Park. Along with the Farmers’ Market, you’ll find an ice skating rink, dog walking park, community pizza oven, children’s soccer and baseball programmes and even movie nights and an annual pumpkin parade!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"pratsPJvmGxDUcIhkbTofA","website":"https://www.soraurenmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"c244b150-0a93-420d-b2ed-da685a25ee3b","name":"Dufferin Grove Farmers' Market","dates":[1779390000000,1779994800000,1780599600000,1781204400000,1781809200000,1782414000000,1783018800000,1783623600000,1784228400000,1784833200000,1785438000000,1786042800000,1786647600000,1787252400000,1787857200000,1788462000000,1789066800000,1789671600000,1790276400000,1790881200000,1791486000000,1792090800000,1792695600000,1793300400000],"start":"2026-05-21T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-29T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Dufferin Grove Park","address":"875 Dufferin St, Toronto","lat":43.657042,"lng":-79.433601},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Experience one of Toronto’s oldest and most vibrant year-round farmers’ markets! The Dufferin Grove Market is bursting with fresh food, passionate local farmers, and a lively sense of community. Shoppers can connect, explore, and savor the beautiful ecosystem—right in the heart of Dufferin Grove Park.\n\nEvery visit brings something new—enjoy live music, free workshops, clothing swaps, creative children’s activities, and even the occasional surprise appearance by the park’s famous squirrels. Don’t miss out on the fun!","categories":["Farmers' Market"],"presenter":null,"image":"rvUZNU7wbq8BeE2wpx1azQ","website":"https://www.dufferingrovemarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"02577d32-e27d-4e20-900a-094c4e0cac0a","name":"Dufferin Grove Farmers' Market","dates":[1779390000000,1779994800000,1780599600000,1781204400000,1781809200000,1782414000000,1783018800000,1783623600000,1784228400000,1784833200000,1