ng containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"540f84bc-6b9b-43aa-a7ca-6e42b37dbff1","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence Market (Big White Tent)","address":"125 The Esplanade, Toronto","lat":43.647946,"lng":-79.371229},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"Great finds to be discovered at all price points! Come shop the largest weekly vintage market in Toronto.","description":"Get ready for the ultimate weekend treasure hunt! The Sunday Variety Market is now open every Saturday and Sunday, bringing the city’s biggest and most exciting market experience to life each week. Discover over 75 incredible vendors—dive into vintage fashion from every era, luxury finds, one-of-a-kind handmade goods, unique gifts, antiques, collectibles, sparkling jewelry, and local gems you won’t find anywhere else. Shop vintage like a true Toronto insider under the iconic big white tent and experience the city’s most vibrant small business community in the heart of downtown! \n\nIf you’re looking for weekend plans in Toronto, don't miss this free event St. Lawrence Market - Toronto's most historic cultural destination.","categories":["Artisan","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"YqzGtnbNKm7C1gKMGjRdVA","website":"https://sundayvariety.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"09b5f916-e3f6-4632-85d0-f2db079f64c4","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence Market (Big White Tent)","address":"125 The Esplanade, Toronto","lat":43.647946,"lng":-79.371229},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"Great finds to be discovered at all price points! Come shop the largest weekly vintage market in Toronto.","description":"Get ready for the ultimate weekend treasure hunt! The Sunday Variety Market is now open every Saturday and Sunday, bringing the city’s biggest and most exciting market experience to life each week. Discover over 75 incredible vendors—dive into vintage fashion from every era, luxury finds, one-of-a-kind handmade goods, unique gifts, antiques, collectibles, sparkling jewelry, and local gems you won’t find anywhere else. Shop vintage like a true Toronto insider under the iconic big white tent and experience the city’s most vibrant small business community in the heart of downtown! \n\nIf you’re looking for weekend plans in Toronto, don't miss this free event St. Lawrence Market - Toronto's most historic cultural destination.","categories":["Artisan","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"YqzGtnbNKm7C1gKMGjRdVA","website":"https://sundayvariety.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"034e226e-b706-42a8-926d-c9161b6f2ead","name":"Market 707","dates":[1779462000000,1779548400000,1779807600000,1779894000000,1779980400000,1780066800000,1780153200000,1780412400000,1780498800000,1780585200000,1780671600000,1780758000000,1781017200000,1781103600000,1781190000000,1781276400000,1781362800000,1781622000000,1781708400000,1781794800000,1781881200000,1781967600000,1782226800000,1782313200000,1782399600000,1782486000000,1782572400000,1782831600000,1782918000000,1783004400000,1783090800000,1783177200000,1783436400000,1783522800000,1783609200000,1783695600000,1783782000000,1784041200000,1784127600000,1784214000000,1784300400000,1784386800000,1784646000000,1784732400000,1784818800000,1784905200000,1784991600000,1785250800000,1785337200000,1785423600000,1785510000000,1785596400000,1785855600000,1785942000000,1786028400000,1786114800000,1786201200000,1786460400000,1786546800000,1786633200000,1786719600000,1786806000000,1787065200000,1787151600000,1787238000000,1787324400000,1787410800000,1787670000000,1787756400000,1787842800000,1787929200000,1788015600000,1788274800000,1788361200000,1788447600000,1788534000000,1788620400000,1788879600000,1788966000000,1789052400000,1789138800000,1789225200000,1789484400000,1789570800000,1789657200000,1789743600000,1789830000000,1790089200000,1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790694000000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000],"start":"2026-05-22T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-03T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Scadding Court Community Centre","address":"707 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5T 2W6","lat":43.651713739404556,"lng":-79.40508261942017},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Market 707 is a stretch of sidewalk near Dundas and Bathurst lined with upcycled shipping containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"d8ac1639-9bd5-419d-9bdf-0feb4d492f84","name":"Underpass Park Farmers' Market","dates":[1778788800000,1779393600000,1779998400000,1780603200000,1781208000000,1781812800000,1782417600000,1783022400000,1783627200000,1784232000000,1784836800000,1785441600000,1786046400000,1786651200000,1787256000000,1787860800000,1788465600000,1789070400000,1789675200000,1790280000000,1790884800000,1791489600000,1792094400000],"start":"2026-05-14T16:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-15T16:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Underpass Park","address":"29 Lower River Street, Toronto, ON M5A 1M6","lat":43.65585,"lng":-79.354586},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the magic of Underpass Park Farmers' Market—a vibrant gem in Toronto's Corktown and one of the city's most unique farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"f9ae2a07-573c-4ea0-beea-4085938ddd17","name":"Underpass Park Farmers' Market","dates":[1778788800000,1779393600000,1779998400000,1780603200000,1781208000000,1781812800000,1782417600000,1783022400000,1783627200000,1784232000000,1784836800000,1785441600000,1786046400000,1786651200000,1787256000000,1787860800000,1788465600000,1789070400000,1789675200000,1790280000000,1790884800000,1791489600000,1792094400000],"start":"2026-05-14T16:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-15T16:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Underpass Park","address":"29 Lower River Street, Toronto, ON M5A 1M6","lat":43.65585,"lng":-79.354586},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the magic of Underpass Park Farmers' Market—a vibrant gem in Toronto's Corktown and one of the city's most unique farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"691a5885-b86b-4f3c-ab20-80f5283f2e52","name":"Junction Farmers' Market","dates":[1778936400000,1779541200000,1780146000000,1780750800000,1781355600000,1781960400000,1782565200000,1783170000000,1783774800000,1784379600000,1784984400000,1785589200000,1786194000000,1786798800000,1787403600000,1788008400000,1788613200000,1789218000000,1789822800000,1790427600000,1791032400000,1791637200000,1792242000000,1792846800000,1793451600000],"start":"2026-05-16T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Baird Park","address":"275 Keele St, Toronto, ON M6P 2K5, Canada","lat":43.663023721805715,"lng":-79.46217817047676},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Step into the lively Junction Farmers Market, where every visit is a celebration of fresh, local, and sustainably produced food! Join a vibrant community supporting passionate growers and producers while discovering delicious finds around every corner.\n\nExperience the joy of healthy, accessible food for everyone in and around the Junction—your next great food adventure starts here!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"1QtxyeTQD-ylYXlIjttO-g","website":"https://junctionmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"0c5e7d06-7eef-4a61-8b9d-69cfbcb12db0","name":"Sorauren Farmers' Market","dates":[1777921200000,1778526000000,1779130800000,1779735600000,1780340400000,1780945200000,1781550000000,1782154800000,1782759600000,1783364400000,1783969200000,1784574000000,1785178800000,1785783600000,1786388400000,1786993200000,1787598000000,1788202800000,1788807600000,1789412400000,1790017200000,1790622000000,1791226800000,1791831600000,1792436400000,1793041200000],"start":"2026-05-04T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-26T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Sorauren Park","address":"50 Wabash Ave, Toronto, ON M6R 1N2, Canada","lat":43.648147722995105,"lng":-79.44310115767041},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"This year round farmers' Market operates during the outdoor season, we operate in Sorauren Park which is a beautiful greenspace managed by the City of Toronto and animated by community group, Friends of Sorauren Park. Along with the Farmers’ Market, you’ll find an ice skating rink, dog walking park, community pizza oven, children’s soccer and baseball programmes and even movie nights and an annual pumpkin parade!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"pratsPJvmGxDUcIhkbTofA","website":"https://www.soraurenmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"c1167bab-8672-4608-82c1-d117dac06637","name":"Sorauren Farmers' Market","dates":[1777921200000,1778526000000,1779130800000,1779735600000,1780340400000,1780945200000,1781550000000,1782154800000,1782759600000,1783364400000,1783969200000,1784574000000,1785178800000,1785783600000,1786388400000,1786993200000,1787598000000,1788202800000,1788807600000,1789412400000,1790017200000,1790622000000,1791226800000,1791831600000,1792436400000,1793041200000],"start":"2026-05-04T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-26T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Sorauren Park","address":"50 Wabash Ave, Toronto, ON M6R 1N2, Canada","lat":43.648147722995105,"lng":-79.44310115767041},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"This year round farmers' Market operates during the outdoor season, we operate in Sorauren Park which is a beautiful greenspace managed by the City of Toronto and animated by community group, Friends of Sorauren Park. Along with the Farmers’ Market, you’ll find an ice skating rink, dog walking park, community pizza oven, children’s soccer and baseball programmes and even movie nights and an annual pumpkin parade!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"pratsPJvmGxDUcIhkbTofA","website":"https://www.soraurenmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"a03c44ca-5f1f-48f5-9a8e-3c4ae06f8259","name":"Toronto Sunday Market","dates":[1779634800000,1780239600000,1780844400000,1781449200000,1782054000000,1782658800000,1783263600000,1783868400000,1784473200000,1785078000000,1785682800000,1786287600000,1786892400000,1787497200000,1788102000000,1788706800000,1789311600000,1789916400000,1790521200000,1791126000000,1791730800000,1792335600000,1792940400000,1793548800000,1794153600000,1794758400000,1795363200000,1795968000000,1796572800000,1797177600000,1797782400000],"start":"2026-05-24T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Parkdale Hall","address":"1605 Queen St W, Toronto, ON, M6R 1A9","lat":43.638869,"lng":-79.444081},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"A vibrant weekly market celebrating local creators, delicious food & community\nHandmade Goods • Antiques • Vintage • Family-friendly\n\nSupport local. Shop small. Eat fresh.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"BomI95CaiWtmNfhqDjDNLg","website":"https://theparkdalehall.com/new/toronto-sunday-market/","tickets":null},{"id":"9ef3d9a4-c663-414b-b797-91afb0f74d3b","name":"The Cabbagetown Farmers Market","dates":[1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000],"start":"2026-05-12T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-20T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Cabbagetown Farmers Market ","address":"191 Winchester St, Toronto","lat":43.666948,"lng":-79.362713},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Nestled in the heart of Riverdale Park West – just outside the gates of Riverdale Farm – we’re proud to be Toronto’s first park market. Every Tuesday, we bring together over 30 incredible vendors from across southern Ontario—from Brant County to Prince Edward County—offering farm-fresh produce, artisanal goods, and street food that reflects the vibrant diversity of our city.\n\nThis isn’t just a market—it’s a weekly celebration. Whether you're here for the just-picked produce, a bottle of Niagara wine, or a delicious meal in the park, you’ll find something to love. Stay for the live music, meet your neighbors, and soak in the community vibes. No pretense, no pressure—just fresh flavors, friendly faces, and a little something unexpected every week.\n\nCabbagetown Farmers Market is where Toronto gathers to eat well, shop local, and connect. Come for the food, stay for the community.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"VP43HPFTUlgkeT6FmKC9Fg","website":"https://www.cabbagetownmarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"6ac0fa6f-9b68-45f1-a7c5-f65de867c8a5","name":"The Cabbagetown Farmers Market","dates":[1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000],"start":"2026-05-12T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-20T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Cabbagetown Farmers Market ","address":"191 Winchester St, Toronto","lat":43.666948,"lng":-79.362713},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Nestled in the heart of Riverdale Park West – just outside the gates of Riverdale Farm – we’re proud to be Toronto’s first park market. Every Tuesday, we bring together over 30 incredible vendors from across southern Ontario—from Brant County to Prince Edward County—offering farm-fresh produce, artisanal goods, and street food that reflects the vibrant diversity of our city.\n\nThis isn’t just a market—it’s a weekly celebration. Whether you're here for the just-picked produce, a bottle of Niagara wine, or a delicious meal in the park, you’ll find something to love. Stay for the live music, meet your neighbors, and soak in the community vibes. No pretense, no pressure—just fresh flavors, friendly faces, and a little something unexpected every week.\n\nCabbagetown Farmers Market is where Toronto gathers to eat well, shop local, and connect. Come for the food, stay for the community.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"VP43HPFTUlgkeT6FmKC9Fg","website":"https://www.cabbagetownmarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"4b5a116c-a327-476b-9b4d-a5b54574e33f","name":"The Cabbagetown Farmers Market","dates":[1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000],"start":"2026-05-12T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-20T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Cabbagetown Farmers Market ","address":"191 Winchester St, Toronto","lat":43.666948,"lng":-79.362713},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Nestled in the heart of Riverdale Park West – just outside the gates of Riverdale Farm – we’re proud to be Toronto’s first park market. Every Tuesday, we bring together over 30 incredible vendors from across southern Ontario—from Brant County to Prince Edward County—offering farm-fresh produce, artisanal goods, and street food that reflects the vibrant diversity of our city.\n\nThis isn’t just a market—it’s a weekly celebration. Whether you're here for the just-picked produce, a bottle of Niagara wine, or a delicious meal in the park, you’ll find something to love. Stay for the live music, meet your neighbors, and soak in the community vibes. No pretense, no pressure—just fresh flavors, friendly faces, and a little something unexpected every week.\n\nCabbagetown Farmers Market is where Toronto gathers to eat well, shop local, and connect. Come for the food, stay for the community.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"VP43HPFTUlgkeT6FmKC9Fg","website":"https://www.cabbagetownmarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"5452c032-1bb8-4bbe-bd13-089c7a36a839","name":"Allan Gardens Saturday Farmers' Market","dates":[1777730400000,1778335200000,1778940000000,1779544800000,1780149600000,1780754400000,1781359200000,1781964000000,1782568800000,1783173600000,1783778400000,1784383200000,1784988000000,1785592800000,1786197600000,1786802400000,1787407200000,1788012000000,1788616800000,1789221600000,1789826400000,1790431200000,1791036000000,1791640800000,1792245600000,1792850400000,1793455200000,1794063600000,1794668400000,1795273200000,1795878000000,1796482800000,1797087600000,1797692400000,1798297200000,1798902000000,1799506800000,1800111600000,1800716400000,1801321200000,1801926000000,1802530800000,1803135600000,1803740400000,1804345200000,1804950000000,1805551200000,1806156000000,1806760800000,1807365600000,1807970400000,1808575200000,1809180000000],"start":"2026-05-02T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-01T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Children's Conservatory","address":"19 Horticultural Ave, Toronto, ON, M5A 2P2","lat":43.661418998,"lng":-79.37480223},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Celebrate local food, community, and sustainable agriculture. Discover fresh produce, artisanal products, and small-scale producers - all while connecting with the people who grow and create them.We invite you to come meet the vendors, discover new favourites, and taste the heart of your community!\n\nThe Allan Gardens Farmers’ Market facilitates a direct exchange between local farmers, food producers, artisan makers, and consumers. Everything sold at the market (50%+1) must be grown, sourced, made, and/or prepared in Toronto and the surrounding  area—ensuring that every purchase supports your neighbourhood economy.\n\nJoin us year- round every Saturday from 10am-2pm, in the beautiful Allan Gardens Children’s Conservatory & Teaching Garden. ","categories":["Farmers' Market"],"presenter":null,"image":"1_2B-asoDqdvJSyiKMPiaQ","website":"https://www.friendsofallangardens.ca/saturday-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"9aad0636-d82b-401b-a3ff-e7dc95b07407","name":"East York Farmers' Market","dates":[1778587200000,1779192000000,1779796800000,1780401600000,1781006400000,1781611200000,1782216000000,1782820800000,1783425600000,1784030400000,1784635200000,1785240000000,1785844800000,1786449600000,1787054400000,1787659200000,1788264000000,1788868800000,1789473600000,1790078400000,1790683200000,1791288000000,1791892800000,1792497600000,1793102400000],"start":"2026-05-12T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"East York Civic Centre","address":"850 Coxwell Ave, East York, ON M4C 5R1","lat":43.69130125251015,"lng":-79.3283791194498},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Thank you all for a wonderful opening day! It was so lovely to see everyone again after a very long winter. \nHere’s to a fantastic 2026 market season full of delicious, local produce and so much more!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"WxjChgoUOpqklJ1chm1hgQ","website":"https://juliekinnear.com/blogs/east-york-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"87ddcaf9-724b-4eec-9bf6-874b789e0a58","name":"The Stop Farmers' Market @ Wychwood Barns Park","dates":[1779537600000,1780142400000,1780747200000,1781352000000,1781956800000,1782561600000,1783166400000,1783771200000,1784376000000,1784980800000,1785585600000,1786190400000,1786795200000,1787400000000,1788004800000,1788609600000,1789214400000,1789819200000,1790424000000,1791028800000,1791633600000,1792238400000,1792843200000,1793448000000,1794056400000,1794661200000,1795266000000,1795870800000,1796475600000,1797080400000,1797685200000],"start":"2026-05-23T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-19T08:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Wychwood Barns Park","address":"601 Christie St, Toronto, ON, M6G 4C7","lat":43.679958839,"lng":-79.424094918},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Featuring 35+ weekly vendors, the market brings together local farmers, food producers, and neighbours to increase access to healthy food in ways that build community. A program of The Stop Community Food Centre, the market supports both emerging and established small-scale producers while strengthening a resilient local food economy through responsibly grown and produced food. The market is committed to affordability, supporting racialized vendors, and creating welcoming, community-driven public spaces. Reflecting the diverse cultures of the neighbourhood and the broader GTA, the market celebrates the many food traditions that make Toronto vibrant.\n\nCome visit and support our year-round community market operating every Saturday in the Bathurst–St. Clair neighbourhood.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WHwqoysoRgdbIoHAZWiAw","website":"https://www.thestop.org/farmersmarket/","tickets":null},{"id":"013cfa65-7949-4090-b117-43e2a8fcdb6c","name":"East York Farmers' Market","dates":[1778587200000,1779192000000,1779796800000,1780401600000,1781006400000,1781611200000,1782216000000,1782820800000,1783425600000,1784030400000,1784635200000,1785240000000,1785844800000,1786449600000,1787054400000,1787659200000,1788264000000,1788868800000,1789473600000,1790078400000,1790683200000,1791288000000,1791892800000,1792497600000,1793102400000],"start":"2026-05-12T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"East York Civic Centre","address":"850 Coxwell Ave, East York, ON M4C 5R1","lat":43.69130125251015,"lng":-79.3283791194498},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Thank you all for a wonderful opening day! It was so lovely to see everyone again after a very long winter. \nHere’s to a fantastic 2026 market season full of delicious, local produce and so much more!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"WxjChgoUOpqklJ1chm1hgQ","website":"https://juliekinnear.com/blogs/east-york-farmers-market","tickets":null},{"id":"09dd3dbc-f85f-4947-adee-6141351ac152","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence Market (Big White Tent)","address":"125 The Esplanade, Toronto","lat":43.647946,"lng":-79.371229},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"Great finds to be discovered at all price points! Come shop the largest weekly vintage market in Toronto.","description":"Get ready for the ultimate weekend treasure hunt! The Sunday Variety Market is now open every Saturday and Sunday, bringing the city’s biggest and most exciting market experience to life each week. Discover over 75 incredible vendors—dive into vintage fashion from every era, luxury finds, one-of-a-kind handmade goods, unique gifts, antiques, collectibles, sparkling jewelry, and local gems you won’t find anywhere else. Shop vintage like a true Toronto insider under the iconic big white tent and experience the city’s most vibrant small business community in the heart of downtown! \n\nIf you’re looking for weekend plans in Toronto, don't miss this free event St. Lawrence Market - Toronto's most historic cultural destination.","categories":["Artisan","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"YqzGtnbNKm7C1gKMGjRdVA","website":"https://sundayvariety.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"979d03d5-099b-4f3c-a263-7beabd44ede3","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence Market (Big White Tent)","address":"125 The Esplanade, Toronto","lat":43.647946,"lng":-79.371229},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"Great finds to be discovered at all price points! Come shop the largest weekly vi