ebrates our third season in the community🍎  \n\nThank you!  Continued blessings!  \nOne💖!\n","categories":["Food/Culinary","Live Performances","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"KhfKbq6xgZXAO1Cqc_Z-Og","website":"https://courtyardfarmersmkt.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"95e1f801-79f2-44e9-a673-196eeee4eaab","name":"Courtyard Farmers' Market","dates":[1780515000000,1781119800000,1781724600000,1782329400000,1782934200000,1783539000000,1784143800000,1784748600000,1785353400000,1785958200000,1786563000000,1787167800000,1787772600000,1788377400000,1788982200000,1789587000000,1790191800000,1790796600000,1791401400000],"start":"2026-06-03T15:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-07T15:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Robertson Parkette- 1549 Danforth Avenue at Coxwell Avenue ","address":"Robertson Parkette- 1549 Danforth Avenue at Coxwell Avenue ","lat":43.683008,"lng":-79.324328},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Enjoy local, farm-fresh Ontario produce, freshly baked loaves, pastries, Grab and Go treats and so much more at the Robertson Parkette\nThe Courtyard Farmers' Markets celebrates our third season in the community🍎  \n\nThank you!  Continued blessings!  \nOne💖!\n","categories":["Food/Culinary","Live Performances","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"KhfKbq6xgZXAO1Cqc_Z-Og","website":"https://courtyardfarmersmkt.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"682ca3ae-ffab-4d0e-9ce6-d81288f8fac2","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence Market (Big White Tent)","address":"125 The Esplanade, Toronto","lat":43.647946,"lng":-79.371229},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"Great finds to be discovered at all price points! Come shop the largest weekly vintage market in Toronto.","description":"Get ready for the ultimate weekend treasure hunt! The Sunday Variety Market is now open every Saturday and Sunday, bringing the city’s biggest and most exciting market experience to life each week. Discover over 75 incredible vendors—dive into vintage fashion from every era, luxury finds, one-of-a-kind handmade goods, unique gifts, antiques, collectibles, sparkling jewelry, and local gems you won’t find anywhere else. Shop vintage like a true Toronto insider under the iconic big white tent and experience the city’s most vibrant small business community in the heart of downtown! \n\nIf you’re looking for weekend plans in Toronto, don't miss this free event St. Lawrence Market - Toronto's most historic cultural destination.","categories":["Artisan","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"YqzGtnbNKm7C1gKMGjRdVA","website":"https://sundayvariety.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"2d551336-794c-4e7f-bc76-1c0580b9100e","name":"Toronto Sunday Market","dates":[1779634800000,1780239600000,1780844400000,1781449200000,1782054000000,1782658800000,1783263600000,1783868400000,1784473200000,1785078000000,1785682800000,1786287600000,1786892400000,1787497200000,1788102000000,1788706800000,1789311600000,1789916400000,1790521200000,1791126000000,1791730