' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"uR4r0FHNt-y4Xe6-SE_U-g","website":"https://www.theeglintonway.com/farmersmarket","tickets":null},{"id":"98a90180-865d-4765-a954-22c77f5d42ff","name":"Eglinton Way BIA Farmers' Market","dates":[1780833600000,1781438400000,1782043200000,1782648000000,1783252800000,1783857600000,1784462400000,1785067200000,1785672000000,1786276800000,1786881600000,1787486400000,1788091200000,1788696000000,1789300800000,1789905600000,1790510400000,1791115200000,1791720000000,1792324800000,1792929600000],"start":"2026-06-07T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Green P Parking Lot #47","address":"125 Burnaby Blvd, Toronto","lat":43.70439991,"lng":-79.412600977},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Now in its 9th year, The Eglinton Way BIA Farmers' Market has become a staple Sunday event in Midtown Toronto dedicated to strengthening and promoting the connections between our community and Ontario farms, local artisans and small businesses. With 40+ vendors this season, find everything from fresh meat, eggs and produce, to baked goods, food & drink, household goods, arts, crafts and more! Our market features live music, free kids' activities, and special activations that are perfect for all ages. Follow us on Instagram at @EglintonWay for more information and updates!","categories":["Artisan","Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"uR4r0FHNt-y4Xe6-SE_U-g","website":"https://www.theeglintonway.com/farmersmarket","tickets":null},{"id":"747f6aa6-7f4f-4337-ae0d-202bcc07c9c7","name":"North York Farmers' Market","dates":[1779969600000,1780574400000,1781179200000,1781784000000,1782388800000,1782993600000,1783598400000,1784203200000,1784808000000,1785412800000,1786017600000,1786622400000,1787227200000,1787832000000,1788436800000,1789041600000,1789646400000,1790251200000,1790856000000,1791460800000],"start":"2026-05-28T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-08T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Mel Lastman Square","address":"5100 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 5V7","lat":43.768067488538286,"lng":-79.41329517024496},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"From Farm to Table. We make it, WE bake it, and grow it for you! The perfect place to shop for fresh fruits, vegetables, honey, maple syrup and flowers. In addition we offer a fine selections of delicious breads, pastries, cheeses and cured meats.\n\nHeld from Mya to October every Thursday,, come and meet our local farmers and vendors who display their best fresh produce and variety of products. Such as rhubarb, strawberries, and asparagus in the early summer to squash and pumpkins in the fall. Most importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"ee0ef0a4-8b67-45d1-b2b0-40b92493bd5c","name":"North York Farmers' Market","dates":[1779969600000,1780574400000,1781179200000,1781784000000,1782388800000,1782993600000,1783598400000,1784203200000,1784808000000,1785412800000,1786017600000,1786622400000,1787227200000,1787832000000,1788436800000,1789041600000,1789646400000,1790251200000,1790856000000,1791460800000],"start":"2026-05-28T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-08T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Mel Lastman Square","address":"5100 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 5V7","lat":43.768067488538286,"lng":-79.41329517024496},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"From Farm to Table. We make it, WE bake it, and grow it for you! The perfect place to shop for fresh fruits, vegetables, honey, maple syrup and flowers. In addition we offer a fine selections of delicious breads, pastries, cheeses and cured meats.\n\nHeld from Mya to October every Thursday,, come and meet our local farmers and vendors who display their best fresh produce and variety of products. Such as rhubarb, strawberries, and asparagus in the early summer to squash and pumpkins in the fall. Most importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"6d8b4339-8668-4ba0-b4d3-5de4c0995dda","name":"Courtyard Farmers' Market","dates":[1780515000000,1781119800000,1781724600000,1782329400000,1782934200000,1783539000000,1784143800000,1784748600000,1785353400000,1785958200000,1786563000000,1787167800000,1787772600000,1788377400000,1788982200000,1789587000000,1790191800000,1790796600000,1791401400000],"start":"2026-06-03T15:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-07T15:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Robertson Parkette- 1549 Danforth Avenue at Coxwell Avenue ","address":"Robertson Parkette- 1549 Danforth Avenue at Coxwell Avenue ","lat":43.683008,"lng":-79.324328},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Enjoy local, farm-fresh Ontario produce, freshly baked loaves, pastries, Grab and Go treats and so much more at the Robertson Parkette\nThe Courtyard Farmers' Markets celebrates our third season in the community🍎  \n\nThank you!  Continued blessings!  \nOne💖!\n","categories":["Food/Culinary","Live Performances","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"KhfKbq6xgZXAO1Cqc_Z-Og","website":"https://courtyardfarmersmkt.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"f60b0040-c274-496d-97ba-6e893aa14d6a","name":"Courtyard Farmers' Market","dates":[1780515000000,1781119800000,1781724600000,1782329400000,1782934200000,1783539000000,1784143800000,1784748600000,1785353400000,1785958200000,1786563000000,1787167800000,1787772600000,1788377400000,1788982200000,1789587000000,1790191800