t importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"70b07115-2313-40f6-86db-7502476e29ce","name":"North York Farmers' Market","dates":[1779969600000,1780574400000,1781179200000,1781784000000,1782388800000,1782993600000,1783598400000,1784203200000,1784808000000,1785412800000,1786017600000,1786622400000,1787227200000,1787832000000,1788436800000,1789041600000,1789646400000,1790251200000,1790856000000,1791460800000],"start":"2026-05-28T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-08T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Mel Lastman Square","address":"5100 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 5V7","lat":43.768067488538286,"lng":-79.41329517024496},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"From Farm to Table. We make it, WE bake it, and grow it for you! The perfect place to shop for fresh fruits, vegetables, honey, maple syrup and flowers. In addition we offer a fine selections of delicious breads, pastries, cheeses and cured meats.\n\nHeld from Mya to October every Thursday,, come and meet our local farmers and vendors who display their best fresh produce and variety of products. Such as rhubarb, strawberries, and asparagus in the early summer to squash and pumpkins in the fall. Most importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"d0693479-472a-4507-b0d4-701c7a664258","name":"Saturday Farmers' Market at Evergreen Brick Works","dates":[1777723200000,1778328000000,1778932800000,1779537600000,1780142400000,1780747200000,1781352000000,1781956800000,1782561600000,1783166400000,1783771200000,1784376000000,1784980800000,1785585600000,1786190400000,1786795200000,1787400000000,1788004800000,1788609600000,1789214400000,1789819200000,1790424000000,1791028800000,1791633600000,1792238400000,1792843200000,1793448000000],"start":"2026-05-02T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Evergreen Brick Works","address":"550 Bayview Ave, East York, ON, M4W 3X8","lat":43.683783,"lng":-79.365628},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover Toronto’s largest year-round farmers' market. Shop fresh, seasonal produce, artisanal goods and locally prepared foods from Ontario farmers and small businesses.\n\nGrab a coffee, wander through a vibrant market bursting with peak-season flavours and one-of-a-kind finds, and then enjoy a delicious brunch. Held in an open-air pavilion, the market runs rain or shine. Stick around to enjoy a free guided tour of the historic brick factory, take a stroll around the ponds and nearby nature trails or explore the Children's Garden. Getting there is easy with the free shuttle bus picking up next to Broadview Station or take the TTC's 28 bus from Davisville Station.\n\nThe farmers' market is operated by Evergreen, a national non-profit transforming public spaces in our cities to build a healthier future for people and our planet.","categories":["Environmental","Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"g_7hN7bS9geSUWTPQPVycA","website":"https://www.evergreen.ca/evergreen-brick-work/activities/saturday-farmers-market/","tickets":null},{"id":"17de307d-e370-4113-86eb-ecfa6bedf54f","name":"Saturday Farmers' Market at Evergreen Brick Works","dates":[1777723200000,1778328000000,1778932800000,1779537600000,1780142400000,1780747200000,1781352000000,1781956800000,1782561600000,1783166400000,1783771200000,1784376000000,1784980800000,1785585600000,1786190400000,1786795200000,1787400000000,1788004800000,17