08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Evergreen Brick Works","address":"550 Bayview Ave, East York, ON, M4W 3X8","lat":43.683783,"lng":-79.365628},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover Toronto’s largest year-round farmers' market. Shop fresh, seasonal produce, artisanal goods and locally prepared foods from Ontario farmers and small businesses.\n\nGrab a coffee, wander through a vibrant market bursting with peak-season flavours and one-of-a-kind finds, and then enjoy a delicious brunch. Held in an open-air pavilion, the market runs rain or shine. Stick around to enjoy a free guided tour of the historic brick factory, take a stroll around the ponds and nearby nature trails or explore the Children's Garden. Getting there is easy with the free shuttle bus picking up next to Broadview Station or take the TTC's 28 bus from Davisville Station.\n\nThe farmers' market is operated by Evergreen, a national non-profit transforming public spaces in our cities to build a healthier future for people and our planet.","categories":["Environmental","Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"g_7hN7bS9geSUWTPQPVycA","website":"https://www.evergreen.ca/evergreen-brick-work/activities/saturday-farmers-market/","tickets":null},{"id":"75690b82-b68a-4bf5-99a6-cddb2363148f","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence Market (Big White Tent)","address":"125 The Esplanade, Toronto","lat":43.647946,"lng":-79.371229},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"Great finds to be discovered at all price points! Come shop the largest weekly vintage market in Toronto.","description":"Get ready for the ultimate weekend treasure hunt! The Sunday Variety Market is now open every Saturday and Sunday, bringing the city’s biggest and most exciting market experience to life each week. Discover over 75 incredible vendors—dive into vintage fashion from every era, luxury finds, one-of-a-kind handmade goods, unique gifts, antiques, collectibles, sparkling jewelry, and local gems you won’t find anywhere else. Shop vintage like a true Toronto insider under the iconic big white tent and experience the city’s most vibrant small business community in the heart of downtown! \n\nIf you’re looking for weekend plans in Toronto, don't miss this free event St. Lawrence Market - Toronto's most historic cultural destination.","categories":["Artisan","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"YqzGtnbNKm7C1gKMGjRdVA","website":"https://sundayvariety.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"67d48519-db8d-407b-b30f-287d3d7894f3","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400