tures of the neighbourhood and the broader GTA, the market celebrates the many food traditions that make Toronto vibrant.\n\nCome visit and support our year-round community market operating every Saturday in the Bathurst–St. Clair neighbourhood.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WHwqoysoRgdbIoHAZWiAw","website":"https://www.thestop.org/farmersmarket/","tickets":null},{"id":"cee7cd30-59c7-4350-bb3e-3edb58f1a02f","name":"The Stop Farmers' Market @ Wychwood Barns Park","dates":[1779537600000,1780142400000,1780747200000,1781352000000,1781956800000,1782561600000,1783166400000,1783771200000,1784376000000,1784980800000,1785585600000,1786190400000,1786795200000,1787400000000,1788004800000,1788609600000,1789214400000,1789819200000,1790424000000,1791028800000,1791633600000,1792238400000,1792843200000,1793448000000,1794056400000,1794661200000,1795266000000,1795870800000,1796475600000,1797080400000,1797685200000],"start":"2026-05-23T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-19T08:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Wychwood Barns Park","address":"601 Christie St, Toronto, ON, M6G 4C7","lat":43.679958839,"lng":-79.424094918},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Featuring 35+ weekly vendors, the market brings together local farmers, food producers, and neighbours to increase access to healthy food in ways that build community. A program of The Stop Community Food Centre, the market supports both emerging and established small-scale producers while strengthening a resilient local food economy through responsibly grown and produced food. The market is committed to affordability, supporting racialized vendors, and creating welcoming, community-driven public spaces. Reflecting the diverse cultures of the neighbourhood and the broader GTA, the market celebrates the many food traditions that make Toronto vibrant.\n\nCome visit and support our year-round community market operating every Saturday in the Bathurst–St. Clair neighbourhood.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WHwqoysoRgdbIoHAZWiAw","website":"https://www.thestop.org/farmersmarket/","tickets":null},{"id":"94632d8c-06cd-4fa6-9933-ac59af6a4597","name":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market","dates":[1778007600000,1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000,1793127600000],"start":"2026-05-05T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Trinity Bellwoods Park","address":"1053 Dundas Street West","lat":43.64976901117809,"lng":-79.41732226545297},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market is of modest size and nestled in the north-west corner of the largest green space park in the downtown core. 2026 celebrates it’s 20 years of bringing to the neighbourhood fresh, local, sustainably grown agriculture and food artisans that prioritize local ingredients. It is farmer-focused, favours slow food not fast food and eating at the hearth and home. Human food only. Visit website for more info.  The market is operated by the generosity of part-time seasonal community volunteers. ","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"I3mtanYM-El4GRbb-TAO2A","website":"https://www.tbfm.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"6a79d060-09da-4cdc-890b-6e95790dafc9","name":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market","dates":[1778007600000,1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000,1793127600000],"start":"2026-05-05T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Trinity Bellwoods Park","address":"1053 Dundas Street West","lat":43.64976901117809,"lng":-79.41732226545297},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market is of modest size and nestled in the north-west corner of the largest green space park in the downtown core. 2026 celebrates it’s 20 years of bringing to the neighbourhood fresh, local, sustainably grown agriculture and food artisans that prioritize local ingredients. It is farmer-focused, favours slow food not fast food and eating at the hearth and home. Human food only. Visit website for more info.  The market is operated by the generosity of part-time seasonal community volunteers. ","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"I3mtanYM-El4GRbb-TAO2A","website":"https://www.tbfm.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"9fcb74bb-b530-49eb-ab4f-41de953ee7b3","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"St. Lawrence Market (Big White Tent)","address":"125 The Esplanade, Toronto","lat":43.647946,"lng":-79.371229},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"Great finds to be discovered at all price points! Come shop the largest weekly vintage market in Toronto.","description":"Get ready for the ultimate weekend treasure hunt! The Sunday Variety Market is now open every Saturday and Sunday, bringing the city’s biggest and most exciting market experience to life each week. Discover over 75 incredible vendors—dive into vintage fashion from every era, luxury finds, one-of-a-kind handmade goods, unique gifts, antiques, collectibles, sparkling jewelry, and local gems you won’t find anywhere else. Shop vintage like a true Toronto insider under the iconic big white tent and experience the city’s most vibrant small business community in the heart of downtown! \n\nIf you’re looking for weekend plans in Toronto, don't miss this free event St. Lawrence Market - Toronto's most historic cultural destination.","categories":["Artisan","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"YqzGtnbNKm7C1gKMGjRdVA","website":"https://sundayvariety.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"79769f55-c416-4773-ba71-83d66e0b29b4","name":"Sunday Variety Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,17934552