e farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"fc3934e0-0188-44d5-9017-c57cde8f4788","name":"Toronto Sunday Market","dates":[1779634800000,1780239600000,1780844400000,1781449200000,1782054000000,1782658800000,1783263600000,1783868400000,1784473200000,1785078000000,1785682800000,1786287600000,1786892400000,1787497200000,1788102000000,1788706800000,1789311600000,1789916400000,1790521200000,1791126000000,1791730800000,1792335600000,1792940400000,1793548800000,1794153600000,1794758400000,1795363200000,1795968000000,1796572800000,1797177600000,1797782400000],"start":"2026-05-24T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Parkdale Hall","address":"1605 Queen St W, Toronto, ON, M6R 1A9","lat":43.638869,"lng":-79.444081},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"A vibrant weekly market celebrating local creators, delicious food & community\nHandmade Goods • Antiques • Vintage • Family-friendly\n\nSupport local. Shop small. Eat fresh.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"BomI95CaiWtmNfhqDjDNLg","website":"https://theparkdalehall.com/new/toronto-sunday-market/","tickets":null},{"id":"cb972c53-124d-403e-8181-c2f3b430f8db","name":"Toronto Sunday Market","dates":[1779634800000,1780239600000,1780844400000,1781449200000,1782054000000,1782658800000,1783263600000,1783868400000,1784473200000,1785078000000,1785682