ood that reflects the vibrant diversity of our city.\n\nThis isn’t just a market—it’s a weekly celebration. Whether you're here for the just-picked produce, a bottle of Niagara wine, or a delicious meal in the park, you’ll find something to love. Stay for the live music, meet your neighbors, and soak in the community vibes. No pretense, no pressure—just fresh flavors, friendly faces, and a little something unexpected every week.\n\nCabbagetown Farmers Market is where Toronto gathers to eat well, shop local, and connect. Come for the food, stay for the community.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"VP43HPFTUlgkeT6FmKC9Fg","website":"https://www.cabbagetownmarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"a7ee53fe-2de0-49ce-ac39-4ff722fe44a0","name":"The Leslieville Farmers' Market","dates":[1778418000000,1779022800000,1779627600000,1780232400000,1780837200000,1781442000000,1782046800000,1782651600000,1783256400000,1783861200000,1784466000000,1785070800000,1785675600000,1786280400000,1786885200000,1787490000000,1788094800000,1788699600000,1789304400000,1789909200000,1790514000000,1791118800000,1791723600000,1792328400000,1792933200000],"start":"2026-05-10T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Greenwood Park","address":"150 Greenwood Ave, Toronto","lat":43.669638096,"lng":-79.328165388},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each week, the Market brings together local farmers, food producers, artisans, small businesses, live music, and community programming for a lively Sunday gathering in the park.\n\nCome eat, dance, picnic and spend the day in beautiful Greenwood Park while supporting local food systems, small businesses, and community connection in Toronto’s east end! \n\nThe Leslieville Farmers’ Market is a non-profit outdoor farmers’ market held every Sunday in Greenwood Park from May to October. From November to May, the Market moves indoors to the East End Food Hub, with a short winter break in January and February.\n\nSee you Sunday!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"CzJE0RU9YcS__qOfyUvUWA","website":"https://www.leslievillemarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"d0f9601c-01ba-4197-b9ff-376947b2901b","name":"Downsview Park Merchants Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000,1798297200000,1798383600000,1798902000000,1798988400000,1799506800000,1799593200000,1800111600000,1800198000000,1800716400000,1800802800000,1801321200000,1801407600000,1801926000000,1802012400000,1802530800000,1802617200000,1803135600000,1803222000000,1803740400000,1803826800000,1804345200000,1804431600000,1804950000000,1805032800000,1805551200000,1805637600000,1806156000000,1806242400000,1806760800000,1806847200000,1807365600000,1807452000000,1807970400000,1808056800000,1808575200000,1808661600000,1809180000000,1809266400000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-02T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"40 Carl Hall Rd","address":"40 Carl Hall Rd, North York, ON, M3K 2C1","lat":43.7483766822,"lng":-79.4791132214},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Downsview Park Merchants Market is one of Toronto’s vibrant weekend destinations, offering a dynamic indoor marketplace experience for shoppers of all ages. Located in North York, the market features a diverse mix of local vendors offering clothing, accessories, home goods, beauty products, electronics, toys, collectibles, gifts, fresh produce, specialty items, and incredible deals. Visitors can also explore the farmers market section featuring fresh fruits, vegetables, and locally sourced goods, alongside an international food court offering a variety of delicious global cuisines and authentic flavours. With a lively, family-friendly atmosphere, the market is a perfect destination for bargain hunters, families, food lovers, and those looking to support local and small businesses. Open every Saturday and Sunday from 10 AM to 5 PM, Downsview Park Merchants Market combines shopping, food, culture, and community into one exciting weekend experience in Toronto.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"HsINX9unS5aRBvcRR5D6QA","website":"https://www.dpmarket.com","tickets":null},{"id":"9188f6b0-5296-4db6-9a49-f64cffa12f0e","name":"Downsview Park Merchants Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,