r best fresh produce and variety of products. Such as rhubarb, strawberries, and asparagus in the early summer to squash and pumpkins in the fall. Most importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"7dc1fbae-281e-4a73-b18e-b91eca0a9fe9","name":"North York Farmers' Market","dates":[1779969600000,1780574400000,1781179200000,1781784000000,1782388800000,1782993600000,1783598400000,1784203200000,1784808000000,1785412800000,1786017600000,1786622400000,1787227200000,1787832000000,1788436800000,1789041600000,1789646400000,1790251200000,1790856000000,1791460800000],"start":"2026-05-28T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-08T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Mel Lastman Square","address":"5100 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 5V7","lat":43.768067488538286,"lng":-79.41329517024496},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"From Farm to Table. We make it, WE bake it, and grow it for you! The perfect place to shop for fresh fruits, vegetables, honey, maple syrup and flowers. In addition we offer a fine selections of delicious breads, pastries, cheeses and cured meats.\n\nHeld from Mya to October every Thursday,, come and meet our local farmers and vendors who display their best fresh produce and variety of products. Such as rhubarb, strawberries, and asparagus in the early summer to squash and pumpkins in the fall. Most importantly safety measures are in place for a safe shopping experience.\n\nWe look forward to your visit at North York Farmers’ Market.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NJ5eiPqlbTCdw8AkXO9R-Q","website":"https://www.northyorkfarmersmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"66e6ee7e-dacf-4199-9454-de322e7de80f","name":"North York Farmers'