2600977},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Now in its 9th year, The Eglinton Way BIA Farmers' Market has become a staple Sunday event in Midtown Toronto dedicated to strengthening and promoting the connections between our community and Ontario farms, local artisans and small businesses. With 40+ vendors this season, find everything from fresh meat, eggs and produce, to baked goods, food & drink, household goods, arts, crafts and more! Our market features live music, free kids' activities, and special activations that are perfect for all ages. Follow us on Instagram at @EglintonWay for more information and updates!","categories":["Artisan","Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"uR4r0FHNt-y4Xe6-SE_U-g","website":"https://www.theeglintonway.com/farmersmarket","tickets":null},{"id":"5c824a20-9863-4197-98ea-5b2db2c6712a","name":"Eglinton Way BIA Farmers' Market","dates":[1780833600000,1781438400000,1782043200000,1782648000000,1783252800000,1783857600000,1784462400000,1785067200000,1785672000000,1786276800000,1786881600000,1787486400000,1788091200000,1788696000000,1789300800000,1789905600000,1790510400000,1791115200000,1791720000000,1792324800000,1792929600000],"start":"2026-06-07T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Green P Parking Lot #47","address":"125 Burnaby Blvd, Toronto","lat":43.70439991,"lng":-79.412600977},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Now in its 9th year, The Eglinton Way BIA Farmers' Market has become a staple Sunday event in Midtown Toronto dedicated to strengthening and promoting the connections between our community and Ontario farms, local artisans and small businesses. With 40+ vendors this season, find everything from fresh meat, eggs and produce, to baked goods, food & drink, household goods, arts, crafts and more! Our market features live music, free kids' activities, and special activations tha