azaar happens every Friday during from June to October. As vendors at our weekly markets, women from the neighbourhood are able to advance the skills and knowledge they already possess, and are provided with opportunities to gain new ones that can translate into better employment opportunities.\n\n","categories":["Cultural","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"fO6IaSWH7zDJNLIydPtWHA","website":"https://tpwomenscomm.org/our-community-market/","tickets":null},{"id":"37546a24-3a81-46eb-b696-0ad64d76f128","name":"Downsview Park Merchants Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000,1798297200000,1798383600000,1798902000000,1798988400000,1799506800000,1799593200000,1800111600000,1800198000000,1800716400000,1800802800000,1801321200000,1801407600000,1801926000000,1802012400000,1802530800000,1802617200000,1803135600000,1803222000000,1803740400000,1803826800000,1804345200000,1804431600000,1804950000000,1805032800000,1805551200000,1805637600000,1806156000000,1806242400000,1806760800000,1806847200000,1807365600000,1807452000000,1807970400000,1808056800000,1808575200000,1808661600000,1809180000000,1809266400000],"start":"2026-05-23T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-02T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"40 Carl Hall Rd","address":"40 Carl Hall Rd, North York, ON, M3K 2C1","lat":43.7483766822,"lng":-79.4791132214},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Downsview Park Merchants Market is one of Toronto’s vibrant weekend destinations, offering a dynamic indoor marketplace experience for shoppers of all ages. Located in North York, the market features a diverse mix of local vendors offering clothing, accessories, home goods, beauty products, electronics, toys, collectibles, gifts, fresh produce, specialty items, and incredible deals. Visitors can also explore the farmers market section featuring fresh fruits, vegetables, and locally sourced goods, alongside an international food court offering a variety of delicious global cuisines and authentic flavours. With a lively, family-friendly atmosphere, the market is a perfect destination for bargain hunters, families, food lovers, and those looking to support local and small businesses. Open every Saturday and Sunday from 10 AM to 5 PM, Downsview Park Merchants Market combines shopping, food, culture, and community into one exciting weekend experience in Toronto.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"HsINX9unS5aRBvcRR5D6QA","website":"https://www.dpmarket.com","tickets":null},{"id":"d7c44ae2-f571-493e-a3ed-acd8651d360b","name":"Downsview Park Merchants Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,17899128000