"Discover the magic of Underpass Park Farmers' Market—a vibrant gem in Toronto's Corktown and one of the city's most unique farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"43e25d04-1b87-4951-bd15-6bc50d653b1a","name":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market","dates":[1778007600000,1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000,1793127600000],"start":"2026-05-05T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Trinity Bellwoods Park","address":"1053 Dundas Street West","lat":43.64976901117809,"lng":-79.41732226545297},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market is of modest size and nestled in the north-west corner of the largest green space park in the downtown core. 2026 celebrates it’s 20 years of bringing to the neighbourhood fresh, local, sustainably grown agriculture and food artisans that prioritize local ingredients. It is farmer-focused, favours slow food not fast food and eating at the hearth and home. Human food only. Visit website for more info.  The market is operated by the generosity of part-time seasonal community volunteers. ","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"I3mtanYM-El4GRbb-TAO2A","website":"https://www.tbfm.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"a1675c3c-a5d9-4e75-81df-3696b7b2ae32","name":"Sorauren Farmers' Market","dates":[1777921200000,1778526000000,1779130800000,1779735600000,1780340400000,1780945200000,1781550000000,1782154800000,1782759600000,1783364400000,1783969200000,1784574000000,1785178800000,1785783600000,1786388400000,1786993200000,1787598000000,1788202800000,1788807600000,1789412400000,1790017200000,1790622000000,1791226800000,1791831600000,1792436400000,1793041200000],"start":"2026-05-04T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-26T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Sorauren Park","address":"50 Wabash Ave, Toronto, ON M6R 1N2, Canada","lat":43.648147722995105,"lng":-79.44310115767041},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"This year round farmers' Market operates during the outdoor season, we operate in Sorauren Park which is a beautiful greenspace managed by the City of Toronto and animated by community group, Friends of Sorauren Park. Along with the Farmers’ Market, you’ll find an ice skating rink, dog walking park, community pizza oven, children’s soccer and baseball programmes and even movie nights and an annual pumpkin parade!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"pratsPJvmGxDUcIhkbTofA","website":"https://www.soraurenmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"4709d3c7-d499-41a1-b98a-f45aea7408ee","name":"Sorauren Farmers' Market","dates":[1777921200000,1778526000000,1779130800000,1779735600000,1780340400000,1780945200000,1781550000000,1782154800000,1782759600000,1783364400000,1783969200000,1784574000000,1785178800000,1785783600000,1786388400000,1786993200000,1787598000000,1788202800000,1788807600000,1789412400000,1790017200000,1790622000000,1791226800000,1791831600000,1792436400000,1793041200000],"start":"2026-05-04T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-26T15:00:00-