parade!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"pratsPJvmGxDUcIhkbTofA","website":"https://www.soraurenmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"ba2f6324-0d3a-44f8-bb08-9c77dd2a608a","name":"Sorauren Farmers' Market","dates":[1777921200000,1778526000000,1779130800000,1779735600000,1780340400000,1780945200000,1781550000000,1782154800000,1782759600000,1783364400000,1783969200000,1784574000000,1785178800000,1785783600000,1786388400000,1786993200000,1787598000000,1788202800000,1788807600000,1789412400000,1790017200000,1790622000000,1791226800000,1791831600000,1792436400000,1793041200000],"start":"2026-05-04T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-26T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Sorauren Park","address":"50 Wabash Ave, Toronto, ON M6R 1N2, Canada","lat":43.648147722995105,"lng":-79.44310115767041},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"This year round farmers' Market operates during the outdoor season, we operate in Sorauren Park which is a beautiful greenspace managed by the City of Toronto and animated by community group, Friends of Sorauren Park. Along with the Farmers’ Market, you’ll find an ice skating rink, dog walking park, community pizza oven, children’s soccer and baseball programmes and even movie nights and an annual pumpkin parade!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"pratsPJvmGxDUcIhkbTofA","website":"https://www.soraurenmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"c9eba910-dd5f-431c-b004-c9f3adb7c7ae","name":"Dufferin Grove Farmers' Market","dates":[1779390000000,1779994800000,1780599600000,1781204400000,1781809200000,1782414000000,1783018800000,1783623600000,1784228400000,1784833200000,1785438000000,1786042800000,1786647600000,1787252400000,1787857200000,1788462000000,1789066800000,1789671600000,1790276400000,1790881200000,1791486000000,1792090800000,1792695600000,1793300400000],"start":"2026-05-21T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-29T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Dufferin Grove Park","address":"875 Dufferin St, Toronto","lat":43.657042,"lng":-79.433601},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Experience one of Toronto’s oldest and most vibrant year-round farmers’ markets! The Dufferin Grove Market is bursting with fresh food, passionate local farmers, and a lively sense of community. Shoppers can connect, explore, and savor the beautiful ecosystem—right in the heart of Dufferin Grove Park.\n\nEvery visit brings something new—enjoy live music, free workshops, clothing swaps, creative children’s activities, and even the occasional surprise appearance by the park’s famous squirrels. Don’t miss out on the fun!","categories":["Farmers' Market"],"presenter":null,"image":"rvUZNU7wbq8BeE2wpx1azQ","website":"https://www.dufferingrovemarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"4b86d1b4-e85c-4c70-b225-3aa9a01db2ed","name":"Dufferin Grove Farmers' Market","dates":[1779390000000,1779994800000,1780599600000,1781204400000,1781809200000,1782414000000,1783018800000,1783623600000,1784228400000,1784833200000,1785438000000,1786042800000,1786647600000,1787252400000,1787857200000,1788462000000,1789066800000,1789671600000,1790276400000,1790881200000,1791486000000,1792090800000,1792695600000,1793300400000],"start":"2026-05-21T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-29T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Dufferin Grove Park","address":"875 Dufferin St, Toronto","lat":43.657042,"lng":-79.433601},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Experience one of Toronto’s oldest and most vibrant year-round farmers’ markets! The Dufferin Grove Market is bursting with fresh food, passionate local farmers, and a lively sense of community. Shoppers can connect, explore, and savor the beautiful ecosystem—right in the heart of Dufferin Grove Park.\n\nEvery visit brings something new—enjoy live music, free workshops, clothing swaps, creative children’s activities, and even the occasional surprise appearance by the park’s famous squirrels. Don’t miss out on the fun!","categories":["Farmers' Market"],"presenter":null,"image":"rvUZNU7wbq8BeE2wpx1azQ","website":"https://www.dufferingrovemarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"2f43640c-1fc6-41e8-a3f5-3e6c8524e489","name":"Dufferin Grove Farmers' Market","dates":[1779390000000,1779994800000,1780599600000,1781204400000,1781809200000,1782414000000,1783018800000,1783623600000,1784228400000,1784833200000,1785438000000,1786042800000,1786647600000,1787252400000,1787857200000,1788462000000,1789066800000,1789671600000,1790276400000,1790881200000,1791486000000,1792090800000,1792695600000,1793300400000],"start":"2026-05-21T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-29T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Dufferin Grove Park","address":"875 Dufferin St, Toronto","lat":43.657042,"lng":-79.433601},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Experience one of Toronto’s oldest and most vibrant year-round farmers’ markets! The Dufferin Grove Market is bursting with fresh food, passionate local farmers, and a lively sense of community. Shoppers can connect, explore, and savor the beautiful ecosystem—right in the heart of Dufferin Grove Park.\n\nEvery visit brings something new—enjoy live music, free workshops, clothing swaps, creative children’s activities, and even the occasional surprise appearance by the park’s famous squirrels. Don’t miss out on the fun!","categories":["Farmers' Market"],"presenter":null,"image":"rvUZNU7wbq8BeE2wpx1azQ","website":"https://www.dufferingrovemarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"05489b55-791f-408f-a8ec-8e5896f4bb74","name":"The Leslieville Farmers' Market","dates":[1778418000000,1779022800000,1779627600000,1780232400000,1780837200000,1781442000000,1782046800000,1782651600000,1783256400000,1783861200000,1784466000000,1785070800000,1785675600000,1786280400000,1786885200000,1787490000000,1788094800000,1788699600000,1789304400000,1789909200000,1790514000000,1791118800000,1791723600000,1792328400000,1792933200000],"start":"2026-05-10T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Greenwood Park","address":"150 Greenwood Ave, Toronto","lat":43.669638096,"lng":-79.328165388},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each week, the Market brings together local farmers, food producers, artisans, small businesses, live music, and community programming for a lively Sunday gathering in the park.\n\nCome eat, dance, picnic and spend the day in beautiful Greenwood Park while supporting local food systems, small businesses, and community connection in Toronto’s east end! \n\nThe Leslieville Farmers’ Market is a non-profit outdoor farmers’ market held every Sunday in Greenwood Park from May to October. From November to May, the Market moves indoors to the East End Food Hub, with a short winter break in January and February.\n\nSee you Sunday!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"CzJE0RU9YcS__qOfyUvUWA","website":"https://www.leslievillemarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"3c5e43ea-42ab-4807-8835-d26036c8bbaf","name":"The Leslieville Farmers' Market","dates":[1778418000000,1779022800000,1779627600000,1780232400000,1780837200000,1781442000000,1782046800000,1782651600000,1783256400000,1783861200000,1784466000000,1785070800000,1785675600000,1786280400000,1786885200000,1787490000000,1788094800000,1788699600000,1789304400000,1789909200000,1790514000000,1791118800000,1791723600000,1792328400000,1792933200000],"start":"2026-05-10T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Greenwood Park","address":"150 Greenwood Ave, Toronto","lat":43.669638096,"lng":-79.328165388},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each week, the Market brings together local farmers, food producers, artisans, small businesse