4800000,1790694000000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000],"start":"2026-05-22T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-03T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Scadding Court Community Centre","address":"707 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5T 2W6","lat":43.651713739404556,"lng":-79.40508261942017},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Market 707 is a stretch of sidewalk near Dundas and Bathurst lined with upcycled shipping containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"be46986b-c52f-4b31-bd22-08b8fa70bcdc","name":"Underpass Park Farmers' Market","dates":[1778788800000,1779393600000,1779998400000,1780603200000,1781208000000,1781812800000,1782417600000,1783022400000,1783627200000,1784232000000,1784836800000,1785441600000,1786046400000,1786651200000,1787256000000,1787860800000,1788465600000,1789070400000,1789675200000,1790280000000,1790884800000,1791489600000,1792094400000],"start":"2026-05-14T16:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-15T16:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Underpass Park","address":"29 Lower River Street, Toronto, ON M5A 1M6","lat":43.65585,"lng":-79.354586},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the magic of Underpass Park Farmers' Market—a vibrant gem in Toronto's Corktown and one of the city's most unique farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"92c5f0f0-a0f0-4689-aed8-ba0811af69bd","name":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market","dates":[1778007600000,1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000,1793127600000],"start":"2026-05-05T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-27T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Trinity Bellwoods Park","address":"1053 Dundas Street West","lat":43.64976901117809,"lng":-79.41732226545297},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Trinity Bellwoods Farmers' Market is of modest size and nestled in the north-west corner of the largest green space park in the downtown core. 2026 celebrates it’s 20 years of bringing to the neighbourhood fresh, local, sustainably grown agriculture and food artisans that prioritize local ingredients. It is farmer-focused, favours slow food not fast food and eating at the hearth and home. Human food only. Visit website for more info.  The market is operated by the generosity of part-time seasonal community volunteers. ","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"I3mtanYM-El4GRbb-TAO2A","website":"https://www.tbfm.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"2fa87217-f093-4ec9-9af2-0348af62bf81","name":"Black Creek Farm Stand & Market","dates":[1781805600000,1782410400000,1783015200000,1783620000000,1784224800000,1784829600000,1785434400000,1786039200000,1786644000000,1787248800000,1787853600000,1788458400000,1789063200000,1789668000000,1790272800000,1790877600000,1791482400000,1792087200000,1792692000000,1793296800000],"start":"2026-06-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-29T14:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Black Creek Community Farm","address":"4929 Jane St, North York, ON M3N 2K8","lat":43.774639106068285,"lng":-79.52128184272664},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each week during the growing season, we stock our on-site farm stand with freshly harvested produce from our fields. We ensure a weekly selection that highlights peak seasonal crops. Purchasing from our farm stand is a great way to support BCCF and enjoy delicious Toronto-grown produce.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NRVKLaN_ro4wSC8_vXcsRA","website":"https://blackcreekfarm.ca/en/programs-and-activities/farm-stand-markets","tickets":null},{"id":"5c4d2ab3-2186-4b09-882d-270f7be61400","name":"Black Creek Farm Stand & Market","dates":[1781805600000,1782410400000,1783015200000,1783620000000,1784224800000,1784829600000,1785434400000,1786039200000,1786644000000,1787248800000,1787853600000,1788458400000,1789063200000,1789668000000,1790272800000,1790877600000,1791482400000,1792087200000,1792692000000,1793296800000],"start":"2026-06-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-29T14:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Black Creek Community Farm","address":"4929 Jane St, North York, ON M3N 2K8","lat":43.774639106068285,"lng":-79.52128184272664},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each week during the growing season, we stock our on-site farm stand with freshly harvested produce from our fields. We ensure a weekly selection that highlights peak seasonal crops. Purchasing from our farm stand is a great way to support BCCF and enjoy delicious Toronto-grown produce.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"NRVKLaN_ro4wSC8_vXcsRA","website":"https://blackcreekfarm.ca/en/progra