t offering a variety of delicious global cuisines and authentic flavours. With a lively, family-friendly atmosphere, the market is a perfect destination for bargain hunters, families, food lovers, and those looking to support local and small businesses. Open every Saturday and Sunday from 10 AM to 5 PM, Downsview Park Merchants Market combines shopping, food, culture, and community into one exciting weekend experience in Toronto.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Food/Culinary","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"HsINX9unS5aRBvcRR5D6QA","website":"https://www.dpmarket.com","tickets":null},{"id":"980668b6-077c-4be1-834c-14c90f0cb4a8","name":"Downsview Park Merchants Market","dates":[1779544800000,1779631200000,1780149600000,1780236000000,1780754400000,1780840800000,1781359200000,1781445600000,1781964000000,1782050400000,1782568800000,1782655200000,1783173600000,1783260000000,1783778400000,1783864800000,1784383200000,1784469600000,1784988000000,1785074400000,1785592800000,1785679200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793455200000,1793545200000,1794063600000,1794150000000,1794668400000,1794754800000,1795273200000,1795359600000,1795878000000,1795964400000,1796482800000,1796569200000,1797087600000,1797174000000,1797692400000,1797778800000,1798297200000,1798383600000,1798902000000,1798988400000,1799506800000,1799593200000,1800111600000,1800198000000,1800716400000,1800802800000,1801321200000,1801407600000,1801926000000,1802012400000,1802530800000,1802617200000,1803135600000,1803222000000,1803740400000,1803826800000,1804345200000,1804431600000,1804950000000,1805032800000,1805551200000,1805637600000,1806156000000,1806242400000,1806760800000,1806847200000,1807365600000,18074520