for the just-picked produce, a bottle of Niagara wine, or a delicious meal in the park, you’ll find something to love. Stay for the live music, meet your neighbors, and soak in the community vibes. No pretense, no pressure—just fresh flavors, friendly faces, and a little something unexpected every week.\n\nCabbagetown Farmers Market is where Toronto gathers to eat well, shop local, and connect. Come for the food, stay for the community.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"VP43HPFTUlgkeT6FmKC9Fg","website":"https://www.cabbagetownmarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"f948a166-431d-4fe1-8e66-52e319ae78f1","name":"The Cabbagetown Farmers Market","dates":[1778612400000,1779217200000,1779822000000,1780426800000,1781031600000,1781636400000,1782241200000,1782846000000,1783450800000,1784055600000,1784660400000,1785265200000,1785870000000,1786474800000,1787079600000,1787684400000,1788289200000,1788894000000,1789498800000,1790103600000,1790708400000,1791313200000,1791918000000,1792522800000],"start":"2026-05-12T15:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-20T15:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Cabbagetown Farmers Market ","address":"191 Winchester St, Toronto","lat":43.666948,"lng":-79.362713},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Nestled in the heart of Riverdale Park West – just outside the gates of Riverdale Farm – we’re proud to be Toronto’s first park market. Every Tuesday, we bring together over 30 incredible vendors from across southern Ontario—from Brant County to Prince Edward County—offering farm-fresh produce, artisanal goods, and street food that reflects the vibrant diversity of our city.\n\nThis isn’t just a market—it’s a weekly celebration. Whether you're here for the just-picked produce, a bottle of Niagara wine, or a delicious meal in the park, you’ll find something to love. Stay for the live music, meet your neighbors, and soak in the community vibes. No pretense, no pressure—just fresh flavors, friendly faces, and a little something unexpected every week.\n\nCabbagetown Farmers Market is where Toronto gathers to eat well, shop local, and connect. Come for the food, stay for the community.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"VP43HPFTUlgkeT6FmKC9Fg","website":"https://www.cabbagetownmarket.ca","tickets":null},{"id":"834445bb-2848-40b8-8915-e00b50173520","name":"Market 707","dates":[1779462000000,1779548400000,1779807600000,1779894000000,1779980400000,1780066800000,1780153200000,1780412400000,1780498800000,1780585200000,1780671600000,1780758000000,1781017200000,1781103600000,1781190000000,1781276400000,1781362800000,1781622000000,1781708400000,1781794800000,1781881200000,1781967600000,1782226800000,1782313200000,1782399600000,1782486000000,1782572400000,1782831600000,1782918000000,1783004400000,1783090800000,1783177200000,1783436400000,1783522800000,1783609200000,1783695600000,1783782000000,1784041200000,1784127600000,1784214000000,1784300400000,1784386800000,1784646000000,1784732400000,1784818800000,1784905200000,1784991600000,1785250800000,1785337200000,1785423600000,1785510000000,1785596400000,1785855600000,1785942000000,1786028400000,1786114800000,1786201200000,1786460400000,1786546800000,1786633200000,1786719600000,1786806000000,1787065200000,1787151600000,1787238000000,1787324400000,1787410800000,1787670000000,1787756400000,1787842800000,1787929200000,1788015600000,1788274800000,1788361200000,1788447600000,1788534000000,1788620400000,1788879600000,1788966000000,1789052400000,1789138800000,1789225200000,1789484400000,1789570800000,1789657200000,1789743600000,1789830000000,1790089200000,1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790694000000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000],"start":"2026-05-22T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-03T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Scadding Court Community Centre","address":"707 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5T 2W6","lat":43.651713739404556,"lng":-79.40508261942017},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Market 707 is a stretch of sidewalk near Dundas and Bathurst lined with upcycled shipping containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"eb111b6f-be2b-4c01-b637-aefd2ff646ca","name":"Market 707","dates":[1779462000000,1779548400000,1779807600000,1779894000000,1779980400000,1780066800000,1780153200000,1780412400000,1780498800000,1780585200000,1780671600000,1780758000000,1781017200000,1781103600000,1781190000000,1781276400000,1781362800000,1781622000000,1781708400000,1781794800000,1781881200000,1781967600000,1782226800000,1782313200000,1782399600000,1782486000000,1782572400000,1782831600000,1782918000000,1783004400000,1783090800000,1783177200000,1783436400000,1783522800000,1783609200000,1783695600000,1783782000000,1784041200000,1784127600000,1784214000000,1784300400000,1784386800000,1784646000000,1784732400000,1784818800000,1784905200000,1784991600000,1785250800000,1785337200000,1785423600000,1785510000000,1785596400000,1785855600000,1785942000000,1786028400000,1786114800000,1786201200000,1786460400000,1786546800000,1786633200000,1786719600000,1786806000000,1787065200000,1787151600000,1787238000000,1787324400000,1787410800000,1787670000000,1787756400000,1787842800000,1787929200000,1788015600000,1788274800000,1788361200000,1788447600000,1788534000000,1788620400000,1788879600000,1788966000000,1789052400000,1789138800000,1789225200000,1789484400000,1789570800000,1789657200000,1789743600000,1789830000000,1790089200000,1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790694000000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,