9138800000,1789225200000,1789484400000,1789570800000,1789657200000,1789743600000,1789830000000,1790089200000,1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790694000000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000],"start":"2026-05-22T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-03T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Scadding Court Community Centre","address":"707 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5T 2W6","lat":43.651713739404556,"lng":-79.40508261942017},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Market 707 is a stretch of sidewalk near Dundas and Bathurst lined with upcycled shipping containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"9bf40b2d-6b46-4f8c-bc51-b5df1f30a3d0","name":"Underpass Park Farmers' Market","dates":[1778788800000,1779393600000,1779998400000,1780603200000,1781208000000,1781812800000,1782417600000,1783022400000,1783627200000,1784232000000,1784836800000,1785441600000,1786046400000,1786651200000,1787256000000,1787860800000,1788465600000,1789070400000,1789675200000,1790280000000,1790884800000,1791489600000,1792094400000],"start":"2026-05-14T16:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-15T16:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Underpass Park","address":"29 Lower River Street, Toronto, ON M5A 1M6","lat":43.65585,"lng":-79.354586},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the magic of Underpass Park Farmers' Market—a vibrant gem in Toronto's Corktown and one of the city's most unique farmers market destinations! Surrounded by colorful murals from local artists, this lively outdoor market bursts with farm-fresh fruits and vegetables, mouthwatering baked goods, homemade preserves, and a tempting selection of artisanal treats.\n\nFrom May to October—rain or shine—this pet-friendly hotspot invites you to soak up live music, browse the stalls, and mingle with adorable pups for a truly unforgettable market experience.","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"w3Jiy9MEVv3kfA1fQck79w","website":"https://underpassparkmarket.com/","tickets":null},{"id":"e16d7d72-9ff6-4239-b45e-81c06e142ed8","name":"Junction Farmers' Market","dates":[1778936400000,1779541200000,1780146000000,1780750800000,1781355600000,1781960400000,1782565200000,1783170000000,1783774800000,1784379600000,1784984400000,1785589200000,1786194000000,1786798800000,1787403600000,1788008400000,1788613200000,1789218000000,1789822800000,1790427600000,1791032400000,1791637200000,1792242000000,1792846800000,1793451600000],"start":"2026-05-16T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Baird Park","address":"275 Keele St, Toronto, ON M6P 2K5, Canada","lat":43.663023721805715,"lng":-79.46217817047676},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Step into the lively Junction Farmers Market, where every visit is a celebration of fresh, local, and sustainably produced food! Join a vibrant community supporting passionate growers and producers while discovering delicious finds around every corner.\n\nExperience the joy of healthy, accessible food for everyone in and around the Junction—your next great food adventure starts here!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"1QtxyeTQD-ylYXlIjttO-g","website":"https://junctionmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"7f457c00-6c43-49e3-b456-e762f19483e0","name":"Immersion Festival","dates":[1794153600000,1794263400000,1794439800000,1794526200000,1794702600000,1794769200000,1794958200000,1795131000000,1795221000000,1795287600000,1795307400000,1795374000000,1795379400000],"start":"2026-11-08T11:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-11-22T15:30:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Betty Oliphant Theatre","address":"404 Jarvis St, Toronto, ON M4Y 2G6","lat":43.6643,"lng":-79.3777},"free":false,"low":0,"high":150,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for a celebration of Canadian cultural life for audiences and a sought-after performance and networking opportunity for renowned and aspiring artists, with three distinct stage performances, twelve workshops, a dance education roundtable, and community gatherings. Performances and workshops are open to all!\n\nEnjoy The Vanguard Presentation includes commissioned works by Katlyn Addison and Tanya Charles, Travis Knights and Divine Brown, and Nubian Néné. The National Presentation features Ebnflōh Dance Company, Lua Shayenne Dance Company, and N.A.P.P.Y. Dance, while the Next Gen showcase highlights emerging Black youth artists.\n\nOur workshops for youth, beginners, and professionals are led by Kwasi Obeng-Adjei, Reequal Smith, Natasha Powell, and Isaac Gasangwa, exploring diverse Black and diasporic movement practices. \n\nThree gathering events bring together presenters, artists, and academics to connect, exchange ideas, and celebrate Black dance across Canada.","categories":["Dance","Live Performances","Seminars/Workshops"],"presenter":"dance Immersion","image":"sERkkQuapznV_lRLtFWEKw","website":"https://danceimmersion.ca/immersionfestival/","tickets":"https://danceimmersion.ca/immersionfestival/#full-festival-info"},{"id":"541400de-f8d0-4b6e-9717-edf88ce170c5","name":"Market 707","dates":[1779462000000,1779548400000,1779807600000,1779894000000,1779980400000,1780066800000,1780153200000,1780412400000,1780498800000,1780585200000,1780671600000,1780758000000,1781017200000,1781103600000,1781190000000,1781276400000,1781362800000,1781622000000,1781708400000,1781794800000,1781881200000,1781967600000,1782226800000,1782313200000,1782399600000,1782486000000,1782572400000,1782831600000,1782918000000,1783004400000,1783090800000,1783177200000,1783436400000,1783522800000,1783609200000,1783695600000,1783782000000,1784041200000,1784127600000,1784214000000,1784300400000,1784386800000,1784646000000,1784732400000,1784818800000,1784905200000,1784991600000,1785250800000,1785337200000,1785423600000,1785510000000,1785596400000,1785855600000,1785942000000,1786028400000,1786114800000,1786201200000,1786460400000,1786546800000,1786633200000,1786719600000,1786806000000,1787065200000,1787151600000,1787238000000,1787324400000,1787410800000,1787670000000,1787756400000,1787842800000,1787929200000,1788015600000,1788274800000,1788361200000,1788447600000,1788534000000,1788620400000,1788879600000,1788966000000,1789052400000,1789138800000,1789225200000,1789484400000,1789570800000,1789657200000,1789743600000,1789830000000,1790089200000,1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790694000000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000],"start":"2026-05-22T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-03T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Scadding Court Community Centre","address":"707 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5T 2W6","lat":43.651713739404556,"lng":-79.40508261942017},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Market 707 is a stretch of sidewalk near Dundas and Bathurst lined with upcycled shipping containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"377bd874-2747-4c41-bfe0-0513c79be85e","name":"Withrow Park Farmers' Market","dates":[1780146000000,1780750800000,1781355600000,1781960400000,1782565200000,1783170000000,1783774800000,1784379600000,1784984400000,1785589200000,1786194000000,1786798800000,1787403600000,1788008400000,1788613200000,1789218000000,1789822800000,1790427600000,1791032400000,1791637200000,1792242000000,1792846800000],"start":"2026-05-30T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-24T09:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Withrow Park ","address":"725 Logan Ave, Toronto, ON M4K 3B9","lat":43.67657084103454,"lng":-79.34742988876354},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Just steps from Danforth Avenue in vibrant Greektown, Withrow Park Farmers’ Market bursts to life every season! Since 2006, it’s been the go-to destination for fresh food, lively music, local art, and a joyful sense of community—celebrating the best of Toronto while championing local farmers, producers, and artisans.\n\nFrom June to October, the park transforms into a buzzing hub of delicious discoveries and vibrant connection. We’re passionate about creating an inclusive, sustainable, and community-powered market where every visit is an adventure—and everyone’s welcome!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"L8DDBTjIOMKrxChhtduF6Q","website":"https://withrowmarket.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"93478fc0-fa44-4719-b244-a5aa1604cb1f","name":"Market 707","dates":[1779462000000,1779548400000,1779807600000,1779894000000,1779980400000,1780066800000,1780153200000,1780412400000,1780498800000,1780585200000,1780671600000,1780758000000,1781017200000,1781103600000,1781190000000,1781276400000,1781362800000,1781622000000,1781708400000,1781794800000,1781881200000,1781967600000,1782226800000,1782313200000,1782399600000,1782486000000,1782572400000,1782831600000,1782918000000,1783004400000,1783090800000,1783177200000,1783436400000,1783522800000,1783609200000,1783695600000,1783782000000,1784041200000,1784127600000,1784214000000,1784300400000,1784386800000,1784646000000,1784732400000,1784818800000,1784905200000,1784991600000,1785250800000,1785337200000,1785423600000,1785510000000,1785596400000,1785855600000,1785942000000,17860