","address":"707 Dundas St W, Toronto, ON M5T 2W6","lat":43.651713739404556,"lng":-79.40508261942017},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Market 707 is a stretch of sidewalk near Dundas and Bathurst lined with upcycled shipping containers that offer sweet and savoury foods, services, and everything in between. \n\nPresided over by the Scadding Court Community Centre, this impromptu open-air pedestrian mall has one of the most eclectic collection of startup businesses in the city.","categories":["Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"oa2xxPdB_5ibesOE3pMKmA","website":"https://mkt707.ca/","tickets":null},{"id":"6d8c0541-68dd-4501-98a8-71e3d3df87ca","name":"The Toronto Flea Market","dates":[1780844400000,1783263600000,1788706800000,1791126000000],"start":"2026-06-07T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-04T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Ashbridge Estate","address":"1444 Queen St E, Toronto, ON, M4L 1E1","lat":43.665266265,"lng":-79.322771049},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Let us show you how we spend our Sunday’s … we like it slow. we invite you to come and be offline with us, relax outdoors in nature and spend time with some of the best handmade artists + vintage curators around.\n\nInvite your friend and meet us here for coffee + a stroll, come for a solo date to fall back in love with the city, bring a parent for some quality time, or pack up the whole crew and little ones and enjoy our fenced open playground. we promise good time with live music and special treats.\n\nOur vendors are truly something special - some travel as far as thunder bay and Cobourg or Niagara and Hamilton just to vend here. We consider ourselves so lucky to get to bring the east end community (and all who come support) such incredible one-of-a-kind finds.\n\nWe operate seasonally outdoors exclusively, be sure to check out our Instagram for any and all updates. We can't wait to see you.\n","categories":["Artisan","Live Performances","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"Q7s9d-8N45DaAEv8PBzrAg","website":"https://www.torontoflea.com","tickets":null},{"id":"39dc4bc9-85be-4790-a9c4-102602e49b14","name":"Dancing Blossoms Installation","dates":[1787922000000,1788008400000,1788094800000,1788181200000,1788267600000,1788354000000,1788440400000,1788526800000,1788613200000,1788699600000,1788786000000,1788872400000,1788958800000,1789045200000,1789131600000,1789218000000,1789304400000,1789390800000,1789477200000,1789563600000,1789650000000,1789736400000,1789822800000,1789909200000,1789995600000,1790082000000,1790168400000,1790254800000,1790341200000,1790427600000,1790514000000,1790600400000,1790686800000,1790773200000,1790859600000,1790946000000,1791032400000,1791118800000,1791205200000,1791291600000,1791378000000,1791464400000,1791550800000,1791637200000,1791723600000,1791810000000,1791896400000,1791982800000,1792069200000,1792155600000,1792242000000,1792328400000,1792414800000,1792501200000,1792587600000,1792674000000,1792760400000,1792846800000,1792933200000,1793019600000,1793106000000,1793192400000,1793278800000,1793365200000,1793451600000,1793541600000,1793628000000,1793714400000,1793800800000,1793887200000,1793973600000,1794060000000,1794146400000,1794232800000,1794319200000,1794405600000,1794492000000],"start":"2026-08-28T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-11-12T09:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Clark Centre for the Arts","address":"191 Guildwood Pkwy, Scarborough, ON, M1E 1P5","lat":43.746893127,"lng":-79.193688812},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Delight in Paula Hartmann's Dancing Blossoms, a kinetic installation composed of dozens of delicate paper mobiles suspended in air, evoking the quiet poetry of spring trees swaying in the wind. Crafted from featherlight paper and fine wire, each mobile captures a fleeting moment of bloom, movement, and renewal.\n\nAbout the Artist\nPaula Hartmann is a Canadian visual artist whose joyful, kinetic sculptures transform humble materials into poetic, suspended worlds. Based in Toronto and originally from Germany, she draws on cultural traditions, folk aesthetics, and contemporary design to create works that explore impermanence, transformation, and belonging. Often incorporating paper, wire, and natural elements, her mobiles and installations invite viewers into moments of play, presence, and quiet wonder. Her installations have been featured in major public art events, including Toronto’s Nuit\nBlanche, the Burlington Waterfront Sculpture Trail, and City of Craft Toronto.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural"],"presenter":null,"image":"6w2zOg_MReBeep-DtTCBng","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/clark-centre-for-the-arts/","tickets":null},{"id":"07a50a5f-4cb8-4f24-95c2-eb3cb9ebff19","name":"Dancing Blossoms Installation","dates":[1787922000000,1788008400000,1788094800000,1788181200000,1788267600000,1788354000000,1788440400000,1788526800000,1788613200000,1788699600000,1788786000000,1788872400000,1788958800000,1789045200000,1789131600000,1789218000000,1789304400000,1789390800000,1789477200000,1789563600000,1789650000000,1789736400000,1789822800000,1789909200000,1789995600000,1790082000000,1790168400000,1790254800000,1790341200000,1790427600000,1790514000000,1790600400000,1790686800000,1790773200000,1790859600000,1790946000000,1791032400000,1791118800000,1791205200000,1791291600000,1791378000000,1791464400000,1791550800000,1791637200000,1791723600000,1791810000000,1791896400000,1791982800000,1792069200000,1792155600000,1792242000000,1792328400000,1792414800000,1792501200000,1792587600000,1792674000000,1792760400000,1792846800000,1792933200000,1793019600000,1793106000000,1793192400000,1793278800000,1793365200000,1793451600000,1793541600000,1793628000000,1793714400000,1793800800000,1793887200000,1793973600000,1794060000000,1794146400000,1794232800000,17943192000