ll of the goodies made my local food vendors and artisans!","categories":["Farmers' Market","Other"],"presenter":null,"image":"9jnwSXvObOP1RoFH_D_0rA","website":"https://www.appletreemarkets.ca/markets","tickets":null},{"id":"2027abf0-1fc7-43f9-b411-0a63fb5a4424","name":"Disney and Pixar's Finding Nemo","dates":[1795737600000,1795888800000,1795968000000,1795978800000,1796493600000,1796504400000,1796536800000,1797098400000,1797109200000,1797177600000,1797188400000,1797703200000,1797714000000,1797789600000,1797800400000,1797876000000,1797886800000,1797962400000,1797973200000,1798048800000,1798059600000],"start":"2026-11-26T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-23T16:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":17,"high":67,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Make your holidays merry with an enchanting family adventure! This splashy musical adaptation of the beloved Pixar film celebrates the love between parents and children in a vivid underwater world.\n\nWhen Nemo, a spirited clownfish with a “lucky fin\" is captured by a diver, his cautious father, Marlin, embarks on an epic rescue mission across the ocean. Guided by the hilariously forgetful Dory, the laid-back sea turtle Crush, and the supportive Tank Gang, father and son must discover the hero within themselves as they navigate the deep to find one another.\n\nBubbling with laughs, toe-tapping songs, and beautiful larger-than-life puppets, Finding Nemo is a joyful musical journey to celebrate the season together.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":"Music Theatre International","image":"9Meg9fUkr4hj-hkhVmAA2g","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/"},{"id":"428fe438-88c6-4eef-a875-88a1e221e8be","name":"Disney and Pixar's Finding Nemo