 tour counts as lunch!\n\nAlong the way, you’ll hear the stories that shaped Kensington, from its roots as a Jewish market to today’s vibrant, multicultural neighbourhood. Led by locals who know the market inside and out, you’ll get insider access to the hidden corners and stories of Kensington that make the market special. Join us and discover the side of Kensington that most people miss!","categories":["Food/Culinary","Tour"],"presenter":"Tasty Tours","image":"gNfv28kzKSSRZcLRdmTy-w","website":"https://tastytourstoronto.com/toronto-food-tours/kensington-market-taste-the-world-food-tour/","tickets":"https://tastytourstoronto.com/toronto-food-tours/kensington-market-taste-the-world-food-tour/"},{"id":"75e3d26f-fafb-4551-9b43-6ed56b6dfb65","name":"Kensington Market ‘Taste the World’ Food Tour Fall 2026","dates":[1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790521200000,1790607600000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000,1791126000000,1791212400000,1791385200000,1791471600000,1791558000000,1791644400000,1791730800000,1791817200000,1791990000000,1792076400000,1792162800000,1792249200000,1792335600000,1792422000000,1792594800000,1792681200000,1792767600000,1792854000000,1792940400000,1793026800000,1793199600000,1793286000000,1793372400000,1793458800000,1793548800000,1793635200000,1793808000000,1793894400000,1793980800000,1794067200000,1794153600000,1794240000000,1794412800000,1794499200000,1794585600000,1794672000000,1794758400000,1794844800000,1795017600000,1795104000000,1795190400000,1795276800000,1795363200000,1795449600000,1795622400000,1795708800000,1795795200000,1795881600000,1795968000000,1796054400000,1796227200000,1796313600000,1796400000000,1796486400000,1796572800000,1796659200000,1796832000000,1796918400000,1797004800000,1797091200000,1797177600000,1797264000000,1797436800000,1797523200000,1797609600000,1797696000000,1797782400000,1797868800000],"start":"2026-09-23T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-21T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day 