 City Toronto: Mainstage Comedy 92nd Revue","dates":[1787097600000,1787184000000,1787270400000,1787356800000,1787443200000,1787529600000,1787616000000,1787702400000,1787788800000,1787875200000,1787961600000,1788048000000,1788134400000,1788220800000,1788307200000,1788393600000,1788480000000,1788566400000,1788652800000,1788739200000,1788825600000,1788912000000,1788998400000,1789084800000,1789171200000,1789257600000,1789344000000,1789430400000,1789516800000,1789603200000,1789689600000,1789776000000,1789862400000,1789948800000,1790035200000,1790121600000,1790208000000,1790294400000,1790380800000,1790467200000,1790553600000,1790640000000,1790726400000,1790812800000,1790899200000,1790985600000,1791072000000,1791158400000],"start":"2026-08-18T20:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-04T20:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Second City Toronto","address":"110 Harbour St, Toronto, ON, M5J 0B7","lat":43.641557456,"lng":-79.379778422},"free":false,"low":39,"high":55,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"For over 65 years, Second City has delighted audiences around the world with brilliant songs, hilarious sketches, and iconic characters. \n\nIn our time-honoured tradition, you are invited to become part of our creative process…audiences have the chance to influence brand new material being developed in real time. Come be part of the laughter!","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Comedy","Live Performances"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://www.secondcity.com/shows/toronto/the-second-city-mainstage-92nd-revue-tor","tickets":"https://www.secondcity.com/shows/toronto/the-second-city-mainstage-92nd-revue-tor"},{"id":"b9ce8bc1-b907-4e1f-8131-9d444ed5a934","name":"Yesterday. Today. Forever.","dates":[1785758400000,1785844800000,1785931200000,1786017600000,1786104000000,1786190400000,1786276800000,1786363200000,1786449600000,1786536000000,1786622400000,1786708800000,1786795200000,1786881600000,1786968000000,1787054400000,1787140800000,1787227200000,1787313600000,1787400000000,1787486400000,1787572800000,1787659200000,1787745600000,1787832000000,1787918400000,1788004800000,1788091200000,1788177600000,1788264000000,1788350400000,1788436800000,1788523200000,1788609600000,1788696000000,1788782400000,1788868800000,1788955200000,1789041600000,1789128000000,1789214400000,1789300800000,1789387200000,1789473600000,1789560000000,1789646400000,1789732800000,1789819200000,1789905600000,1789992000000,1790078400000,1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790424000000,1790510400000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791028800000,1791115200000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791633600000,1791720000000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792238400000,1792324800000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000,1792670400000,1792756800000,1792843200000,1792929600000,1793016000000,1793102400000,1793188800000,1793275200000,1793361600000,1793448000000,1793538000000,1793624400000,1793710800000,1793797200000,1793883600000,1793970000000,1794056400000,1794142800000,1794229200000],"start":"2026-08-03T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-11-09T08:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Mount Pleasant Cemetery","address":"375 Mount Pleasant Road","lat":43.712625,"lng":-79.357673},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Walk through a series of artistic and interpretive installations across ten cemetery sites and several funeral centres.\n\nAcross the participating sites, visitors will encounter a constellation of experiences, including interpretive panels, meditative spaces, soundscapes, experimental film, symbolic thresholds, and opportunities to leave a message of their own.\n\nCemeteries bring generations into conversation. They hold names, trees, monuments, rituals, and traces of lives that still shape the world around us. The project invites visitors to reflect on how grief, memory, nature, desig