r their own inner sparkle while celebrating the joy of Christmas. Fun for all ages!\n\nPlease note this show requires everyone regardless of age to purchase a ticket. Please be aware the reseller tickets will not be accepted.","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances","Theatre","Winter Holidays"],"presenter":null,"image":"_-MeSvVzIfRfpr3QdMYeww","website":"https://tickets.ticketwise.com/event/a-very-merry-magic-show-2026","tickets":"https://tickets.ticketwise.com/event/a-very-merry-magic-show-2026"},{"id":"3ea32279-fe67-41c5-b3b3-c65486f4072d","name":"Ten Years of Community: A Week of Expert Masterclasses","dates":[1790694000000,1790780400000,1790866800000],"start":"2026-09-29T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-01T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Global Startups","address":"325 Front St West","lat":43.6512,"lng":-79.379504},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Global Startups celebrates 10 years with a week of expert-led masterclasses during Toronto Tech Week, September 29 to October 1 at 325 Front St W. Sessions cover AI and business automation, Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM, compliance and audit readiness, SR&ED tax credits in the age of AI, foreign exchange risk management, multicultural marketing, cross-cultural leadership, property management finance, employee benefits and insurtech, brand strategy for founders, and climate tech education investment. Each session is delivered by a vetted community member to a curated audience of founders, operators, and business leaders. Attendance is free and registration is by approval. The week closes with a community gathering for all alumni and members.","categories":["Seminars/Workshops"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://luma.com/globalstartups","tickets":"https://luma.com/globalstartups"},{"id":"2867a943-c3cd-45c4-bc88-a9960fa060d5","name":"Toronto Sunday Market","dates":[1770566400000,1771171200000,1771776000000,1772380800000,1772982000000