acclaimed performances have previously been presented at renowned venues, including the Sydney Opera House in Australia.\n\n\n\n","categories":["Celebrations","Cultural","Live Performances"],"presenter":"Tai Ji Men","image":"jIAQxt42lkiMXOnflFa6fQ","website":"https://www.taijimen.ca/","tickets":"https://tickets.taijimen.ca/"},{"id":"cf6b4be1-1a8d-4fc4-bbc0-1498949bb89d","name":"A Christmas Carol","dates":[1794528000000,1794616200000,1794702600000,1794789000000,1794961800000,1795048200000,1795134600000,1795221000000,1795307400000,1795393800000,1795566600000,1795653000000,1795739400000,1795825800000,1795912200000,1795998600000,1796171400000,1796257800000,1796344200000,1796430600000,1796517000000,1796603400000,1796776200000,1796862600000,1796949000000,1797035400000,1797121800000,1797208200000,1797381000000,1797467400000,1797553800000,1797640200000,1797726600000,1797813000000,1797985800000,1798072200000],"start":"2026-11-12T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-23T19:30:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"The Fleck at Harbourfront Centre Theatre","address":"231 Queens Quay W, Toronto, ON, M5J 2G8","lat":43.63867054,"lng":-79.382157854},"free":false,"low":50,"high":140,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Dickens’s timeless holiday story of transformation, kindness and human connection.\n\nThis fresh adaptation by Tim Carroll brings Charles Dickens’s world to life through inventive puppetry, towering ghosts that fill the stage, traditional carols and audience participation with spirited sing-alongs. Interactive performers mingle throughout the theatre, while beautifully detailed period costumes and sets create an atmospheric Victorian Christmas.\n\nMore than 175 years after Dickens first published A Christmas Carol, audiences still recognize themselves in Ebenezer Scrooge: someone who discovers that it’s never too late in life to choose kindness and human connection. For centuries, this iconic story has endured because its themes are still relevant today: W