 highlight the power of connection across cultures and communities.\n \nThe exhibition features documentaries on Deskaheh, Herb Carnegie, and the St. Christopher House Lacrosse Organization; contemporary art by Marina Dempster, Maria Hupfield, Safoura Zahedi, Ben Spears, Pedro Zepeda, Milo Osceola, Daniel Henhawk, and David Barnett; as well as new acquisitions alongside historic items from the City of Toronto Art and Artifact Collection.\n","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Museum"],"presenter":"TD Bank Group","image":"-m6p-aI3Br63z-qiiUz5dg","website":"http://toronto.ca/marketgallery","tickets":null},{"id":"32b4451a-caa1-41e9-9a1e-596e5fa76420","name":"GATHER in Toronto Exhibition","dates":[1784818800000,1784905200000,1784991600000,1785078000000,1785337200000,1785423600000,1785510000000,1785596400000,1785682800000,1785942000000,1786028400000,1786114800000,1786201200000,1786287600000,1786546800000,1786633200000,1786719600000,1786806000000,1786892400000,1787151600000,1787238000000,1787324400000,1787410800000,1787497200000,1787756400000,1787842800000,1787929200000,1788015600000,1788102000000,1788361200000,1788447600000,1788534000000,1788620400000,1788706800000,1788966000000,1789052400000,1789138800000,1789225200000,1789311600000,1789570800000,1789657200000,1789743600000,1789830000000,1789916400000,1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790521200000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000,1791126000000,1791385200000,1791471600000,1791558000000,1791644400000,1791730800000,1791990000000,1792076400000,1792162800000,1792249200000,1792335600000,1792594800000,1792681200000,1792767600000,1792854000000,1792940400000,1793199600000,1793286000000,1793372400000,1793458800000,1793548800000],"start":"2026-07-23T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-11-01T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Market Gallery","address":"95 Front Street East, 2nd floor","lat":43.649129,"lng":-79.371765},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null