f connection across cultures and communities.\n \nThe exhibition features documentaries on Deskaheh, Herb Carnegie, and the St. Christopher House Lacrosse Organization; contemporary art by Marina Dempster, Maria Hupfield, Safoura Zahedi, Ben Spears, Pedro Zepeda, Milo Osceola, Daniel Henhawk, and David Barnett; as well as new acquisitions alongside historic items from the City of Toronto Art and Artifact Collection.\n","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Museum"],"presenter":"TD Bank Group","image":"-m6p-aI3Br63z-qiiUz5dg","website":"http://toronto.ca/marketgallery","tickets":null},{"id":"389a0475-f214-4880-a590-57010e2232a9","name":"Intro to Bread: Challah","dates":[1784397600000,1785088800000,1788717600000,1790272800000,1794078000000,1796497200000],"start":"2026-07-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":149,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for our Challah Class!\n\nThis class is great for absolute beginners! And you will achieve all this in just ONE day! \n\nSpend two hours with our talented chef to learn the art of making Challah. Using pre-measured ingredients, you'll mix your own dough from scratch while learning the techniques and skills that will give you the confidence to tackle bread recipes at home.\n\nYou will walk away with not 1, but 2 loaves of this heavenly bread, one classic braided Challah and one filled loaf.\n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"5bzVBuUJFKM5P0TAKLTn7g","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640"},{"id":"4c10f32a-8c50-47a1-b96a-c71d5165c8b1","name":"Intro to Bread: Challah","dates":[1784397600000,1785088800000,1788717600000,1790272800000,1794078000000,1796497200000],"start":"2026-07-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":149,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for our Challah Class!\n\nThis class is great for absolute beginners! And you will achieve all this in just ONE day! \n\nSpend two hours with our talented chef to learn the art of making Challah. Using pre-measured ingredients, you'll mix your own dough from scratch while learning the techniques and skills that will give you the confidence to tackle bread recipes at home.\n\nYou will walk away with not 1, but 2 loaves of this heavenly bread, one classic braided Challah and one filled loaf.\n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"5bzVBuUJFKM5P0TAKLTn7g","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640"},{"id":"6aee10ec-d3d1-43fc-8a1b-739d5d2198ca","name":"Intro to Bread: Challah","dates":[1784397600000,1785088800000,1788717600000,1790272800000,1794078000000,1796497200000],"start":"2026-07-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":149,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for our Challah Class!\n\nThis class is great for absolute beginners! And you will achieve all this in just ONE day! \n\nSpend two hours with our talented chef to learn the art of making Challah. Using pre-measured ingredients, you'll mix your own dough from scratch while learning the techniques and skills that will give you the confidence to tackle bread recipes at home.\n\nYou will walk away with not 1, but 2 loaves of this heavenly bread, one classic braided Challah and one filled loaf.\n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"5bzVBuUJFKM5P0TAKLTn7g","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640"},{"id":"96fbb3fc-8ced-409f-8ddd-eb0d838999e3","name":"Champagne and Macarons New Years Eve!","dates":[1798750800000],"start":"2026-12-31T16:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-31T16:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":139,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Get ready for New Year's Eve with our class! \n\nJoin us for a delightful afternoon of crafting these elegant French treats while sipping on champagne.\n\nNot only will you learn the art of macaron making, but you'll also have a box of your own creations to bring to your NYE party!  It's the perfect way to impress your guests and start the celebrations early.","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"vjTpfwZef-AGqUdDaiRx_g","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/macarons-perfect-parisian-macarons-copy?start=2026-12-01T00:00&select=2026-12-31T16:00","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/macarons-perfect-parisian-macarons-copy?start=2026-12-01T00:00&select=2026-12-31T16:00"},{"id":"e29e7e8b-16a4-4f19-85d9-da9e4dcce3a5","name":"Monarch Movie Night in the Hub","dates":[1790895600000],"start":"2026-10-01T19:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-01T19:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Downsview Park","address":"70 Canuck Ave, North York, ON, M3K 2C5","lat":43.744269913,"lng":-79.48436452},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for a screening of Nick de Pencier's Four Wings and Prayer!\n\nThis documentary follows the incredible journey of the monarch butterfly, exploring its remarkable migration from Canada to Mexico and the mystery of how it travels thousands of kilometres each year to survive.\n\nEnjoy popcorn and join the discussion afterward on how we can all help support safe migration and thriving summer habitats for monarchs and other butterflies.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"sOGrdaWEQYD_NelHEmLZeQ","website":"https://downsviewpark.ca/events/monarch-movie-night-hub","tickets":"https://downsviewpark.ca/events/monarch-movie-night-hub"},{"id":"36e58dab-79a1-4b49-8ac9-410223f8eaaf","name":"New Years Eve Celebration Cake Class","dates":[1798736400000],"start":"2026-12-31T12:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-31T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":139,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us in decorating your own New Years' Eve cake. This is two hour class is perfect for beginners! \n\nWe will bake the cakes for you and make buttercream in advance, so you can get to the super fun decorating part.","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/crazy-new-years-eve-celebration-cake?start=2026-12-01T00:00&select=2026-12-31T12:00","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/crazy-new-years-eve-celebration-cake?start=2026-12-01T00:00&select=2026-12-31T12:00"},{"id":"53e45aa1-ef68-4005-aab0-c158dbcb4220","name":"GATHER in Toronto Exhibition","dates":[1784818800000,1784905200000,1784991600000,1785078000000,1785337200000,1785423600000,17