es!\n\nPacked with laughter, wonder, and plenty of audience participation, this high-energy show blends dazzling illusions, hilarious comedy, and heartwarming holiday spirit.\n\nKids and parents alike will be part of the magic as the show inspires families to discover their own inner sparkle while celebrating the joy of Christmas. Fun for all ages!\n\nPlease note this show requires everyone regardless of age to purchase a ticket. Please be aware the reseller tickets will not be accepted.","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances","Theatre","Winter Holidays"],"presenter":null,"image":"_-MeSvVzIfRfpr3QdMYeww","website":"https://tickets.ticketwise.com/event/a-very-merry-magic-show-2026","tickets":"https://tickets.ticketwise.com/event/a-very-merry-magic-show-2026"},{"id":"644ff5e8-7269-438d-99ab-ae0504662cdb","name":"Intro to Bread: Challah","dates":[1784397600000,1785088800000,1788717600000,1790272800000,1794078000000,1796497200000],"start":"2026-07-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":149,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for our Challah Class!\n\nThis class is great for absolute beginners! And you will achieve all this in just ONE day! \n\nSpend two hours with our talented chef to learn the art of making Challah. Using pre-measured ingredients, you'll mix your own dough from scratch while learning the techniques and skills that will give you the confidence to tackle bread recipes at home.\n\nYou will walk away with not 1, but 2 loaves of this heavenly bread, one classic braided Challah and one filled loaf.\n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"5bzVBuUJFKM5P0TAKLTn7g","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640"},{"id":"7425c15a-856d-44c0-acf9-bcc43b6de7e8","name":"Pumpkin Pie Class","dates":[1789927200000,1791136800000,1791655200000],"start":"2026-09-20T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-10T14:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":139,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for a cozy baking class where you'll master the art of making the perfect pumpkin pie from scratch.\n\nLearn how to prepare a flaky, buttery crust and create a rich, spiced pumpkin filling that brings comfort and tradition to the holiday table. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned baker, this hands-on class will leave you with the skills and recipe to impress your family and friends this fall. \n\nCome for the pie, stay for the warm autumn vibes! At the end of class you will have a beautifully decorated pie, just in time for Thanksgiving!","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"qV2CylWTk126RNadYGTdQg","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/pies-pumpkin-pie-class?_pos=1&_psq=Pumpkin+Pie+Class&_psid=0cf28c33d&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=50587778744536","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/pies-pumpkin-pie-class?_pos=1&_psq=Pumpkin+Pie+Class&_psid=0cf28c33d&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=50587778744536"},{"id":"77052b1d-bb08-487d-a513-866ddc3658f3","name":"Ho, Ho, Holiday Cookie Baking","dates":[1796583600000,1797102000000,1797706800000],"start":"2026-12-06T14:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-19T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":149,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for our Holiday Cookie Baking Class!\n\nIn this three-hour, hands-on class, you'll learn how to make three festive holiday cookies: Linzer Cookies, Thumbprint Cookies, and Chocolate Crinkle Cookies. Our talented chefs will guide you through each recipe, sharing tips and techniques along the way.\n\nThe best part? You'll take home the yummy cookies that you will have made!\n","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/ho-ho-holiday-cookie-baking?start=2026-12-01T00:00&select=2026-12-12T14:00","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/ho-ho-holiday-cookie-baking?start=2026-12-01T00:00&select=2026-12-12T14:00"},{"id":"6194e8e8-1cc4-403d-aae7-6914cb83f05a","name":"Toronto Sunday Market","dates":[1770566400000,1771171200000,1771776000000,1772380800000,1772982000000,1773586800000,1774191600000,1774796400000,1775401200000,1776006000000,1776610800000,1777215600000,1777820400000,1778425200000,1779030000000,1779634800000,1780239600000,1780844400000,1781449200000,1782054000000,1782658800000,1783263600000,1783868400000,1784473200000,1785078000000,1785682800000,1786287600000,1786892400000,1787497200000,1788102000000,1788706800000,1789311600000,1789916400000,1790521200000,1791126000000,1791730800000,1792335600000,1792940400000,1793548800000,1794153600000,1794758400000,1795363200000,1795968000000,1796572800000,1797177600000,1797782400000],"start":"2026-02-08T11:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-20T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Parkdale Hall","address":"1605 Queen St W, Toronto, ON, M6R 1A9","lat":43.638869,"lng":-79.444081},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Celebrating local food, antiques, handmade goods and community.\n\n\n","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Artisan","Consumer Show/Convention"],"presenter":null,"image":"ozk451_PfWrf5ssZGWAwoQ","website":"https://theparkdalehall.com/new/toronto-sunday-market/","tickets":"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/toronto-sunday-market-at-parkdale-hall-tick