ty’s best award-winning bartenders, brand ambassadors and chefs to serve up serious fun and incredible flavours. From industry insiders to casual cocktail lovers, everyone is invited to sip, sample and celebrate Toronto’s world-class cocktail scene.  \n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary","Nightlife"],"presenter":"The Alchemist Magazine","image":"QRMsVbNgsVYLqN2SLnEgdA","website":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/","tickets":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/"},{"id":"f2a6438b-dcb3-4e65-8df0-032cd10e36aa","name":"Disney and Pixar's Finding Nemo","dates":[1795737600000,1795888800000,1795968000000,1795978800000,1796493600000,1796504400000,1796536800000,1797098400000,1797109200000,1797177600000,1797188400000,1797703200000,1797714000000,1797789600000,1797800400000,1797876000000,1797886800000,1797962400000,1797973200000,1798048800000,1798059600000],"start":"2026-11-26T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-23T16:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":17,"high":67,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Make your holidays merry with an enchanting family adventure! This splashy musical adaptation of the beloved Pixar film celebrates the love between parents and children in a vivid underwater world.\n\nWhen Nemo, a spirited clownfish with a “lucky fin\" is captured by a diver, his cautious father, Marlin, embarks on an epic rescue mission across the ocean. Guided by the hilariously forgetful Dory, the laid-back sea turtle Crush, and the supportive Tank Gang, father and son must discover the hero within themselves as they navigate the deep to find one another.\n\nBubbling with laughs, toe-tapping songs, and beautiful larger-than-life puppets, Finding Nemo is a joyful musical journey to celebrate the season together.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":"Music Theatre International","image":"9Me