0000,1787238000000,1787324400000,1787410800000,1787497200000,1787756400000,1787842800000,1787929200000,1788015600000,1788102000000,1788361200000,1788447600000,1788534000000,1788620400000,1788706800000,1788966000000,1789052400000,1789138800000,1789225200000,1789311600000,1789570800000,1789657200000,1789743600000,1789830000000,1789916400000,1790175600000,1790262000000,1790348400000,1790434800000,1790521200000,1790780400000,1790866800000,1790953200000,1791039600000,1791126000000,1791385200000,1791471600000,1791558000000,1791644400000,1791730800000,1791990000000,1792076400000,1792162800000,1792249200000,1792335600000,1792594800000,1792681200000,1792767600000,1792854000000,1792940400000,1793199600000,1793286000000,1793372400000,1793458800000,1793548800000],"start":"2026-07-23T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-11-01T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Market Gallery","address":"95 Front Street East, 2nd floor","lat":43.649129,"lng":-79.371765},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Come learn about ways we move through the world, honouring the land, our stories and each other, celebrating triumphs in our journeys, strengthening fibres in our connectedness. It is within this sacred act of coming together that we find common values, building a unified vision for our future.\n \nListen to local sports origin stories alongside artistic reflections on identity, resilience, and belonging through works that highlight the power of connection across cultures and communities.\n \nThe exhibition features documentaries on Deskaheh, Herb Carnegie, and the St. Christopher House Lacrosse Organization; contemporary art by Marina Dempster, Maria Hupfield, Safoura Zahedi, Ben Spears, Pedro Zepeda, Milo Osceola, Daniel Henhawk, and David Barnett; as well as new acquisitions alongside historic items from the City of Toronto Art and Artifact Collection.\n","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Museum"],"presenter":"TD Bank Group","image":"-m6p-aI3Br63z-qiiUz5dg","website":"http://toronto.ca/marketgallery","tickets":null},{"id":"687ddfac-f117-418b-b689-bf2c87dc1f5f","name":"Intro to Bread: Challah","dates":[1784397600000,1785088800000,1788717600000,1790272800000,1794078000000,1796497200000],"start":"2026-07-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":149,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for our Challah Class!\n\nThis class is great for absolute beginners! And you will achieve all this in just ONE day! \n\nSpend two hours with our talented chef to learn the art of making Challah. Using pre-measured ingredients, you'll mix your own dough from scratch while learning the techniques and skills that will give you the confidence to tackle bread recipes at home.\n\nYou will walk away with not 1, but 2 loaves of this heavenly bread, one classic braided Challah and one filled loaf.\n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"5bzVBuUJFKM5P0TAKLTn7g","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640"},{"id":"50b9ee09-1bfa-4c4c-ad2b-921c263d3d96","name":"Intro to Bread: Challah","dates":[1784397600000,1785088800000,1788717600000,1790272800000,1794078000000,1796497200000],"start":"2026-07-18T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Le Dolci Culinary School","address":"12 Sousa Mendes St, Toronto, ON, M6P 0A8","lat":43.661026575,"lng":-79.453333936},"free":false,"low":149,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for our Challah Class!\n\nThis class is great for absolute beginners! And you will achieve all this in just ONE day! \n\nSpend two hours with our talented chef to learn the art of making Challah. Using pre-measured ingredients, you'll mix your own dough from scratch while learning the techniques and skills that will give you the confidence to tackle bread recipes at home.\n\nYou will walk away with not 1, but 2 loaves of this heavenly bread, one classic braided Challah and one filled loaf.\n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary"],"presenter":null,"image":"5bzVBuUJFKM5P0TAKLTn7g","website":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640","tickets":"https://www.ledolci.com/products/intro-to-bread-challah?_pos=1&_psq=Bread+Classes&_psid=6bae820f9&_ss=e&_v=1.0&variant=49222573031640"},{"id":"1f5944ef-0294-47e0-a6c8-e4d759945e2c","name":"Toronto Cocktail Festival","dates":[1792339200000,1792425600000,1792512000000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792944000000],"start":"2026-10-18T12:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T12:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Bars across Toronto","address":"","lat":null,"lng":null},"free":false,"low":0,"high":190,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Toronto’s biggest celebration of cocktail culture is back and more delicious than ever! Celebrate the art of the cocktail.\n\nWe’ve rounded up the city’s best award-winning bartenders, brand ambassadors and chefs to serve up serious fun and incredible flavours. From industry insiders to casual cocktail lovers, everyone is invited to sip, sample and celebrate Toronto’s world-class cocktail scene.  \n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary","Nightlife"],"presenter":"The Alchemist Magazine","image":"QRMsVbNgsVYLqN2SLnEgdA","website":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/","tickets":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/"},{"id":"88765b16-96b9-402b-a0f4-a0c26f5fa226","name":"Disney and Pixar's Finding Nemo","dates":[1795737600000,1795888800000,1795968000000,1795978800000,1796493600000,1796504400000,1796536800000,1797098400000,1797109200000,1797177600000,1797188400000,1797703200000,1797714000000,1797789600000,1797800400000,1797876000000,1797886800000,1797962400000,1797973200000,1798048800000,1798059600000],"start":"2026-11-26T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-23T16:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":17,"high":67,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Make your holidays merry with an enchanting family adventure! This splashy musical adaptation of the beloved Pixar film celebrates the love between parents and children in a vivid underwater world.\n\nWhen Nemo, a spirited clownfish with a “lucky fin\" is captured by a diver, his cautious father, Marlin, embarks on an epic rescue mission across the ocean. Guided by the hilariously forgetful Dory, the laid-back sea turtle Crush, and the supportive Tank Gang, father and son must discover the hero within themselves as they navigate the deep to find one another.\n\nBubbling with laughs, toe-tapping songs, and beautiful larger-than-life puppets, Finding Nemo is a joyful musical journey to celebrate the season together.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":"Music Theatre International","image":"9Meg9fUkr4hj-hkhVmAA2g","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/"},{"id":"27ceb308-9e65-450e-b274-8ccc7e08f700","name":"Disney and Pixar's Finding Nemo","dates":[1795737600000,1795888800000,1795968000000,1795978800000,1796493600000,1796504400000,1796536800000,1797098400000,1797109200000,1797177600000,1797188400000,1797703200000,1797714000000,1797789600000,1797800400000,1797876000000,1797886800000,1797962400000,1797973200000,1798048800000,1798059600000],"start":"2026-11-26T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-23T16:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":17,"high":67,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Make your holidays merry with an enchanting family adventure! This splashy musical adaptation of the beloved Pixar film celebrates the love between parents and children in a vivid underwater world.\n\nWhen Nemo, a spirited clownfish with a “lucky fin\" is captured by a diver, his cautious father, Marlin, embarks on an epic rescue mission across the ocean. Guided by the hilariously forgetful Dory, the laid-back sea turtle Crush, and the supportive Tank Gang, father and son must discover the hero within themselves as they navigate the deep to find one another.\n\nBubbling with laughs, toe-tapping songs, and beautiful larger-than-life puppets, Finding Nemo is a joyful musical journey to celebrate the season together.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":"Music Theatre International","image":"9Meg9fUkr4hj-hkhVmAA2g","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/finding-nemo/"},{"id":"88c688f0-51d1-4517-bb10-2b764297035e","name":"Disney and Pixar's Finding Nemo","dates":[1795737600000,1795888800000,1795968000000,1795978800000,1796493600000,1796504400000,1796536800000,1797098400000,1797109200000,1797177600000,1797188400000,1797703200000,1797714000000,1797789600000,1797800400000,1797876000000,1797886800000,1797962400000,1797973200000,1798048800000,1798059600000],"start":"2026-11-26T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-23T16:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":17,"high":67,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Make your holidays merry with an enchanting family ad