r Show/Convention"],"presenter":null,"image":"ozk451_PfWrf5ssZGWAwoQ","website":"https://theparkdalehall.com/new/toronto-sunday-market/","tickets":"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/toronto-sunday-market-at-parkdale-hall-tickets-1981191495094"},{"id":"ed74af62-1f0e-48c7-9dbf-22cf691bc29d","name":"Toronto Cocktail Festival","dates":[1792339200000,1792425600000,1792512000000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792944000000],"start":"2026-10-18T12:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T12:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Bars across Toronto","address":"","lat":null,"lng":null},"free":false,"low":0,"high":190,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Toronto’s biggest celebration of cocktail culture is back and more delicious than ever! Celebrate the art of the cocktail.\n\nWe’ve rounded up the city’s best award-winning bartenders, brand ambassadors and chefs to serve up serious fun and incredible flavours. From industry insiders to casual cocktail lovers, everyone is invited to sip, sample and celebrate Toronto’s world-class cocktail scene.  \n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary","Nightlife"],"presenter":"The Alchemist Magazine","image":"QRMsVbNgsVYLqN2SLnEgdA","website":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/","tickets":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/"},{"id":"4dba2663-114f-48fd-98fb-636c35f8cfe0","name":"Jordan","dates":[1792256400000,1792267200000],"start":"2026-10-17T13:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-17T16:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":17,"high":50,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Soar across space and time with Jordan, a young Cree boy who helps Indigenous children with the support of his faithful spirit bear, Maskwa. \n\nWhile his onstage journey is magical, the play is a vibrant tribute to a very real hero: Jordan River Anderson of Norway House Cree Nation, Manitoba.\n\nThe challenges young Jordan faced during his life became the heart of a national movement that led to the creation of Jordan’s Principle — a Canadian legal commitment ensuring equal healthcare for First Nations youth.","categories":["Family/Children","Indigenous","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"kpHDMawXZMf3P_RTEITPlQ","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/jordan/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/jordan/"},{"id":"71f42aae-e156-484f-85f9-0da5ceacb109","name":"Sketch Party","dates":[1769904000000,1771718400000,1774738800000,1777158000000,1779577200000,1781996400000,1784415600000,1786834800000,1789254000000,1792278000000,1795305600000,1797724800000],"start":"2026-01-31T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-12-19T19:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Comedy Bar","address":"945 Bloor Street W, Toronto, ON, M6H 1L5","lat":43.66148,"lng":-79.428242},"free":false,"low":23,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Each month we're partying HARD and bringing the best sketch comedy this city has to offer, from the hottest up and coming troupes to long time fan favourite troupes and solo acts.\n\nGet ready for a wild night of expecting the unexpected and, of course, sketch comedy. Bring your best party trick and enjoy the vibes. There ain't no party like a S-KETCH PARTY!\n\nYou won’t want to miss this monthly shindig, come party-hardy with us!","categories":["Comedy"],"presenter":null,"image":"IoEFS6qmP2peTL7SwyQW_w","website":"https://comedybar.ca/shows/sketch-party","tickets":null},{"id":"b6d9e7fc-fc1d-495b-9954-60b6083b7539","name":"Toronto Cocktail Festival","dates":[1792339200000,1792425600000,1792512000000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792944000000],"start":"2026-10-18T12:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-25T12:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Bars across Toronto","address":"","lat":null,"lng":null},"free":false,"low":0,"high":190,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Toronto’s biggest celebration of cocktail culture is back and more delicious than ever! Celebrate the art of the cocktail.\n\nWe’ve rounded up the city’s best award-winning bartenders, brand ambassadors and chefs to serve up serious fun and incredible flavours. From industry insiders to casual cocktail lovers, everyone is invited to sip, sample and celebrate Toronto’s world-class cocktail scene.  \n\n","categories":["Food/Culinary","Nightlife"],"presenter":"The Alchemist Magazine","image":"QRMsVbNgsVYLqN2SLnEgdA","website":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/","tickets":"https://www.thealchemistmagazine.ca/tcf/"},{"id":"ba1fed52-a10c-4b72-9d3e-b35898814ade","name":"Tanya Marcuse: Portent","dates":[1788966000000,1789056000000,1789142400000,1789228800000,1789574400000,1789660800000,1789747200000,1789833600000,1790179200000,1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000],"start":"2026-09-09T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Image Centre","address":"33 Gould St, Toronto, ON, M5B 1E9","lat":43.657662387,"lng":-79.379262289},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Tanya Marcuse’s multichannel video Portent presents ominous scenes of the natural world: trees swaying in the wind, vapour rising from volcanic fumaroles, icy branches illuminated by flickering light, and other small disturbances that hint at forces beyond our understanding. \n\nThe quiet is deliberate; the frame remains fixed while the environment shifts restlessly within it, evoking a tension between stillness and motion, beauty and unease, the known and unknown.\n\nMarcuse describes her work as an exploration of the kinship between disaster and the sublime, and of the ways the world around us is continually threatened, transformed, and made strange. Portent forms part of her expansive series Book of Miracles (2020-26), inspired by the Augsburger Wunderzeichenbuch, a 16th-century illuminated manuscript depicting natural disasters, supernatural phenomena, celestial spectacles and unexplained oddities.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural","Museum"],"presenter":null,"image":"MauUIvgc_RtL3xi-f6yStQ","website":"https://theimagecentre.ca/exhibition/tanya-marcuse-portent/","tickets":null},{"id":"28620f60-45f0-4cd8-85a3-0047265a5ac9","name":"Tanya Marcuse: Portent","dates":[1788966000000,1789056000000,1789142400000,1789228800000,1789574400000,1789660800000,1789747200000,1789833600000,1790179200000,1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000],"start":"2026-09-09T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-05T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Image Centre","address":"33 Gould St, Toronto, ON, M5B 1E9","lat":43.657662387,"lng":-79.379262289},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Tanya Marcuse’s multichannel vide