ogether works from across his career, including a large collection of teapots, previously unexhibited pieces and a new body of large-scale sculptural installations, to celebrate the enduring importance of joy, experimentation and humour in his work. Guest-curated by Alysa Procida and enjoy our Special Projects Gallery.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Artisan","Cultural"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/michael-massie-now-and-then","tickets":"https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/opening-reception-returning-to-ourselves-michael-massie-now-and-then-tickets-1997059101532?aff=ebdsoporgprofile"},{"id":"2be09a2b-2d24-40ec-b32a-6087da3d5d42","name":"Exhibition: \"Returning to Ourselves and Michael Massie: now and then\"","dates":[1788987600000,1789056000000,1789142400000,1789228800000,1789574400000,1789660800000,1789747200000,1789833600000,1790179200000,1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000,1796835600000,1796922000000,1797008400000,1797094800000,1797440400000,1797526800000,1797613200000,1797699600000,1798045200000,1798131600000,1798218000000,1798304400000,1798650000000,1798736400000,1798822800000,1798909200000,1799254800000,1799341200000,1799427600000,1799514000000,1799859600000,1799946000000,1800032400000,1800118800000,1800464400000,1800550800000,1800637200000,1800723600000,1801069200000,1801155600000,1801242000000,1801328400000],"start":"2026-09-09T17:00:00-04:00","end":"2027