lat":43.66515638,"lng":-79.341549283},"free":false,"low":30,"high":95,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Shakespeare’s tale of justice vs. morality, live on air.\n\nReturning after its acclaimed limited run is House + Body’s bold reimagining of Shakespeare’s Measure for Measure, setting this urgent story of justice and morality inside a chaotic modern sound studio.\n\nWhen Isabella’s brother is sentenced to death, she embarks on a journey to save his life but is forced to confront a system where authority wavers and moral certainty erodes. Watch as five actors juggle twenty roles live on air, racing through a high-stakes broadcast as offstage antics spiral as wildly as the drama that unfolds.\n\nFast, sharp, and darkly funny, this Measure for Measure asks who holds power and who pays the price.\n\n \n\nAccolades for Measure For Measure:\n\n• Top 10 Productions of 2025 (Toronto Star)\n\n• Top 10 Productions of 2025 (NEXT Magazine)","categories":["Live Performances","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"LF03SE79WOXcy11ZNBC9IQ","website":"https://www.crowstheatre.com/shows-events/measure-for-measure-2026","tickets":"https://www.crowstheatre.com/shows-events/calendar?shows=1077"},{"id":"1a4a7a77-7a2e-4df2-8839-e87fefca49a4","name":"International Architectural Design Competition 2026-2027: Persian Garden Suite","dates":[1789444800000,1789531200000,1789617600000,1789704000000,1789790400000,1789876800000,1789963200000,1790049600000,1790136000000,1790222400000,1790308800000,1790395200000,1790481600000,1790568000000,1790654400000,1790740800000,1790827200000,1790913600000,1791000000000,1791086400000,1791172800000,1791259200000,1791345600000,1791432000000,1791518400000,1791604800000,1791691200000,1791777600000,1791864000000,1791950400000,1792036800000,1792123200000,1792209600000,1792296000000,1792382400000,1792468800000,1792555200000,1792641600000,1792728000000,1792814400000,1792900800000,1792987200000,1793073600000,1793160000000,1793246400000,1793332800000,17934192000