-a6ab-4563-abb2-2b3895b2604e","name":"Ethennonnhawahstihnen' Library Tree Tour","dates":[1791385200000],"start":"2026-10-07T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-07T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Ethennonnhawahstihnen' Library","address":"100 Ethennonnhawahstihnen' Lane, North York, ON, M2K 0G5","lat":43.768717995,"lng":-79.375804929},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"The Ethennonnhawahstihnen’ branch and its neighbourhood is home to a variety of trees. Join the City to explore the natural world on a local neighbourhood tour. Learn how to recognize different species and fun facts about their cultural and ecological importance.\n\nThis is a free program.\n\nRegistration is required and will open one month before the event.\n\nChildren under 12 must be accompanied by a parent/caregiver. ","categories":["Environmental","Run/Walk","Tour"],"presenter":null,"image":"QqhJhze2D8PB2fxUyXy8OQ","website":"https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a6cc7a274e3b8b75db66fdd","tickets":"https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a6cc7a274e3b8b75db66fdd"},{"id":"319faab1-613f-422c-b893-ba32b8c7c803","name":"A Translucent City: Collective Memories of the Future","dates":[1788789600000,1788876000000,1788962400000,1789048800000,1789135200000,1789221600000,1789394400000,1789480800000,1789567200000,1789653600000,1789740000000,1789826400000,1789999200000,1790085600000,1790172000000,1790258400000,1790344800000,1790431200000,1790604000000,1790690400000,1790776800000,1790863200000,1790949600000,1791036000000,1791208800000,1791295200000,1791381600000,1791468000000,1791554400000,1791640800000,1791813600000,1791900000000,1791986400000,1792072800000,1792159200000,1792245600000,1792418400000,1792504800000,1792591200000,1792677600000,1792764000000,1792850400000,1793023200000,1793109600000,1793196000000,1793282400000,1793368800000,1793455200000,1793631600000,1793718000000,1793804400000,1793890800000,1793977200000,1794063600000,1794236400000,