42000000,1792328400000,1792414800000,1792501200000,1792587600000,1792674000000,1792760400000,1792846800000,1792933200000,1793019600000,1793106000000,1793192400000,1793278800000,1793365200000,1793451600000,1793541600000,1793628000000,1793714400000,1793800800000,1793887200000,1793973600000,1794060000000,1794146400000,1794232800000,1794319200000,1794405600000,1794492000000],"start":"2026-08-28T09:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-11-12T09:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Clark Centre for the Arts","address":"191 Guildwood Pkwy, Scarborough, ON, M1E 1P5","lat":43.746893127,"lng":-79.193688812},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Delight in Paula Hartmann's Dancing Blossoms, a kinetic installation composed of dozens of delicate paper mobiles suspended in air, evoking the quiet poetry of spring trees swaying in the wind. Crafted from featherlight paper and fine wire, each mobile captures a fleeting moment of bloom, movement, and renewal.\n\nAbout the Artist\nPaula Hartmann is a Canadian visual artist whose joyful, kinetic sculptures transform humble materials into poetic, suspended worlds. Based in Toronto and originally from Germany, she draws on cultural traditions, folk aesthetics, and contemporary design to create works that explore impermanence, transformation, and belonging. Often incorporating paper, wire, and natural elements, her mobiles and installations invite viewers into moments of play, presence, and quiet wonder. Her installations have been featured in major public art events, including Toronto’s Nuit\nBlanche, the Burlington Waterfront Sculpture Trail, and City of Craft Toronto.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural"],"presenter":null,"image":"6w2zOg_MReBeep-DtTCBng","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/clark-centre-for-the-arts/","tickets":null},{"id":"a38abfd9-b664-4fb8-961c-e408e1b9b434","name":"Raised by Women","dates":[1806190200000,1806256800000,1806449400000,1806535800000,1806622200000,1806708600000,1806775200000,1806795000000,1806861600000,1807054200000,1807117200000,1807140600000,1807227000000,1807313400000,1807380000000,1807399800000,1807466400000],"start":"2027-03-27T19:30:00-04:00","end":"2027-04-11T14:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":120,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join Métis playwright and performer Keith Barker in an intimate, stand-up-inspired solo show that’s as funny as it is searching. With sharp wit and big heart, Keith traces his upbringing by formidable women in Northern Ontario and the complicated legacy of a father who was largely absent but never insignificant.\n\nMoving seamlessly between laughter and reflection, this deeply personal performance finds grace in the mess, proving the funniest stories are often the most true.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":"Canadian Stage ","image":"PpRZw7S1GaDYkY1vKfSEQg","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/raised-by-women","tickets":"https://my.canadianstage.com/overview/9700"},{"id":"cf7da10a-f784-4cf8-b42e-9dffe66b838a","name":"The Second City Toronto: Mainstage Comedy 92nd Revue","dates":[1787097600000,1787184000000,1787270400000,1787356800000,1787443200000,1787529600000,1787616000000,1787702400000,1787788800000,1787875200000,1787961600000,1788048000000,1788134400000,1788220800000,1788307200000,1788393600000,1788480000000,1788566400000,1788652800000,1788739200000,1788825600000,1788912000000,1788998400000,1789084800000,1789171200000,1789257600000,1789344000000,1789430400000,1789516800000,1789603200000,1789689600000,1789776000000,1789862400000,1789948800000,1790035200000,1790121600000,1790208000000,1790294400000,1790380800000,1790467200000,1790553600000,1790640000000,1790726400000,1790812800000,1790899200000,1790985600000,1791072000000,1791158400000],"start":"2026-08-18T20:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-04T20:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Second City Toronto","address":"110 Harbour St, Toronto, ON, M5J 0B7","lat":43.641557456,"lng":-79.379778422},"free":false,"low":39,"high":55,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"For over 65 years, Second City has delighted audiences around the world with brilliant songs, hilarious sketches, and iconic characters. \n\nIn our time-honoured tradition, you are invited to become part of our creative process…audiences have the chance to influence brand new material being developed in real time. Come be part of the laughter!","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Comedy","Live Performances"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://www.secondcity.com/shows/toronto/the-second-city-mainstage-92nd-revue-tor","tickets":"https://www.secondcity.com/shows/toronto/the-second-city-mainstage-92nd-revue-tor"},{"id":"41f14858-92a8-4d77-bcb8-ae76bebd191e","name":"The Second City Toronto: Mainstage Comedy 92nd Revue","dates":[1787097600000,1787184000000,1787270400000,1787356800000,1787443200000,1787529600000,1787616000000,1787702400000,1787788800000,1787875200000,1787961600000,1788048000000,1788134400000,1788220800000,1788307200000,1788393600000,1788480000000,1788566400000,1788652800000,1788739200000,1788825600000,1788912000000,1788998400000,1789084800000,1789171200000,1789257600000,1789344000000,1789430400000,1789516800000,1789603200000,1789689600000,1789776000000,1789862400000,1789948800000,1790035200000,1790121600000,1790208000000,1790294400000,1790380800000,1790467200000,1790553600000,1790640000000,1790726400000,1790812800000,1790899200000,1790985600000,1791072000000,1791158400000],"start":"2026-08-18T20:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-04T20:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Second City Toronto","address":"110 Harbour St, Toronto, ON, M5J 0B7","lat":43.641557456,"lng":-79.379778422},"free":false,"low":39,"high":55,"pwyc":null,"costN