classic story, turned on its heel.\n\nThink you’ve outgrown the panto? Think again.\n\nOur new take on Cinderella delivers all the glitter and spectacle of the beloved tradition with a clever, contemporary edge. Packed with infectious pop anthems, sly humour, and spectacular stagecraft, this is a holiday outing designed as much for grown-ups as it is for kids.\n\nWhether you’re reliving the tradition or discovering it for the first time, this is holiday theatre with wit, style, and a knowing wink.","categories":["Comedy","Family/Children","Live Performances","Winter Holidays"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WK7Gk8ZaBFodp61LlcVkA","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/cinderella","tickets":"https://my.canadianstage.com/overview/9695"},{"id":"b6338f3c-485a-4163-9999-3cc985480165","name":"Sex in the '80s","dates":[1800145800000,1800212400000,1800405000000,1800491400000,1800577800000,1800664200000,1800750600000,1800817200000,1801009800000,1801096200000,1801182600000,1801269000000,1801355400000,1801422000000,1801614600000,1801701000000,1801787400000,1801873800000,1801960200000,1802026800000],"start":"2027-01-16T19:30:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-07T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":115,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Old history. New rules.\n\nThey haven’t seen each other since the 1980s. Now two accomplished architects are reunited in a glass-walled Toronto office tower on the eve of a high-stakes competition. Both intend to keep things strictly professional. That proves harder than expected.\n\nAs a long-buried chapter of their shared history resurfaces, a polite reunion turns into a pointed, funny sparring match about memory, ambition, and how much the rules have changed. Meanwhile, their twentysomething colleagues look on and aren’t shy about weighing in.\n\nSmart, topical, and wickedly witty, this is a workplace comedy about generational change and the risky business of revisiting the past.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"Fcu46jHUFdGt1qpYFrx14A","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s","tickets":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s"},{"id":"9c345d87-072c-4756-9903-4b2e96a5c59c","name":"Sex in the '80s","dates":[1800145800000,1800212400000,1800405000000,1800491400000,1800577800000,1800664200000,1800750600000,1800817200000,1801009800000,1801096200000,1801182600000,1801269000000,1801355400000,1801422000000,1801614600000,1801701000000,1801787400000,1801873800000,1801960200000,1802026800000],"start":"2027-01-16T19:30:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-07T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":115,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Old history. New rules.\n\nThey haven’t seen each other since the 1980s. Now two accomplished architects are reunited in a glass-walled Toronto office tower on the eve of a high-stakes competition. Both intend to keep things strictly professional. That proves harder than expected.\n\nAs a long-buried chapter of their shared history resurfaces, a polite reunion turns into a pointed, funny sparring match about memory, ambition, and how much the rules have changed. Meanwhile, their twentysomething colleagues look on and aren’t shy about weighing in.\n\nSmart, topical, and wickedly witty, this is a workplace comedy about generational change and the risky business of revisiting the past.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"Fcu46jHUFdGt1qpYFrx14A","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s","tickets":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s"},{"id":"ac12f5da-12a4-4176-9bfe-c0eac90ad888","name":"