4f740","name":"50 Years of Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery Exhibition - 50th Anniversary","dates":[1788264000000,1788350400000,1788436800000,1788523200000,1788616800000,1788782400000,1788868800000,1788955200000,1789041600000,1789128000000,1789221600000,1789387200000,1789473600000,1789560000000,1789646400000,1789732800000,1789826400000,1789992000000,1790078400000,1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790431200000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791036000000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791640800000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792245600000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000,1792670400000,1792756800000,1792850400000,1793016000000,1793102400000,1793188800000,1793275200000,1793361600000,1793455200000,1793624400000,1793710800000,1793797200000,1793883600000,1793970000000,1794063600000,1794229200000,1794315600000,1794402000000,1794488400000,1794574800000,1794668400000,1794834000000,1794920400000,1795006800000,1795093200000,1795179600000,1795273200000,1795438800000,1795525200000,1795611600000,1795698000000,1795784400000,1795878000000,1796043600000,1796130000000,1796216400000,1796302800000,1796389200000,1796482800000,1796648400000,1796734800000,1796821200000,1796907600000,1796994000000,1797087600000,1797253200000,1797339600000],"start":"2026-09-01T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-15T08:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery","address":"399 The West Mall, Etobicoke, ON, M9C 2Y2","lat":43.643772026,"lng":-79.565452785},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the history of art at the Etobicoke Civic Centre with artifacts, prints, images and paintings from City of Toronto’s Fine Art, Artifact and Archival collections. Celebrate the present by witnessing a commissioned piece by early career artist Lise Round. Envision the future with new designs of the updated Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"A6-VIKDNvgJfy1_SuU-UqA","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/etobicoke-civic-centre-art-gallery/?WT.rd_id=%2Feccartgallery","tickets":null},{"id":"8c2adb3e-d1c1-448a-9aae-9b2800329826","name":"50 Years of Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery Exhibition - 50th Anniversary","dates":[1788264000000,1788350400000,1788436800000,1788523200000,1788616800000,1788782400000,1788868800000,1788955200000,1789041600000,1789128000000,1789221600000,1789387200000,1789473600000,1789560000000,1789646400000,1789732800000,1789826400000,1789992000000,1790078400000,1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790431200000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791036000000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791640800000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792245600000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000,1792670400000,1792756800000,1792850400000,1793016000000,1793102400000,1793188800000,1793275200000,1793361600000,1793455200000,1793624400000,1793710800000,1793797200000,1793883600000,1793970000000,1794063600000,1794229200000,1794315600000,1794402000000,1794488400000,1794574800000,1794668400000,1794834000000,1794920400000,1795006800000,1795093200000,1795179600000,1795273200000,1795438800000,1795525200000,1795611600000,1795698000000,1795784400000,1795878000000,1796043600000,1796130000000,1796216400000,1796302800000,1796389200000,1796482800000,1796648400000,1796734800000,1796821200000,1796907600000,1796994000000,1797087600000,1797253200000,1797339600000],"start":"2026-09-01T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-15T08:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery","address":"399 The West Mall, Etobicoke, ON, M9C 2Y2","lat":43.643772026,"lng":-79.565452785},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the history of art at the Etobicoke Civic Centre with artifacts, prints, images and paintings from City of Toronto’s Fine Art, Artifact and Archival collections. Celebrate the present by witnessing a commissioned piece by early career artist Lise Round. Envision the future with new designs of the updated Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"A6-VIKDNvgJfy1_SuU-UqA","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/etobicoke-civic-centre-art-gallery/?WT.rd_id=%2Feccartgallery","tickets":null},{"id":"b6205cda-89b5-43e5-9ee5-e5d3fef5aeb3","name":"Duende International Flamenco Festival: Flamenco and the World","dates":[1795042800000,1795136400000,1795222800000,1795309200000,1795395600000],"start":"2026-11-18T18:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-11-22T20:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Aga Khan Museum","address":"77 Wynford Dr, North York, ON M3C 1K1","lat":43.725278,"lng":-79.332045},"free":false,"low":45,"high":150,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Celebrate flamenco’s global transformation!\n\nExperience the vibrant evolution of flamenco, from its regional roots in Andalusia to a dynamic global art form shaped by cross-cultural exchange. \n\nThis year’s lineup spans both traditional flamenco from Andalusia and innovative collaborations at the crossroads of qawwali and Persian muqam, tracing the art form’s evolution from its regional roots to a global practice.","categories":["Dance","Live Performances","Museum"],"presenter":"Aga Khan Museum","image":"qp_RMmWPShlY0lOpIswCKQ","website":"https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/duende-2026/?utm_source=city+of+toronto&utm_medium=event+listing&utm_campaign=duende+26","tickets":"https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/duende-2026/?utm_source=city+of+toronto&utm_medium=event+listing&utm_campaign=duende+26"},{"id":"eab792dc-82d7-479e-9007-0e310d28f45a","name":"Leticia Moreno: Bach in the Americas","dates":[1803085200000],"start":"2027-02-19T20:00:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-19T20:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Koerner Hall","address":"273 Bloor St W, Toronto, ON, M5S 1W2","lat":43.667856304,"lng":-79.396058814},"free":false,"low":50,"high":85,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Virtuoso Spanish violinist Leticia Moreno leads an ensemble with piano, bandoneon, and bass in a program of works that explore the dialogue between Baroque tradition and the vibrant musical languages of the Americas.\n\nRecognised as a truly exciting and versatile violinist, Moreno has collaborated alongside Sol Gabetta, Bertrand Chamayou, and Kirill Gerstein and was the youngest member of the prestigious Alexander von Humboldt Stiftung. She has won international violin competitions such as the Henryk Szeryng International violin competition, Concertino Praga, Pablo Sarasate International Violin Competition, as well as being awarded with the ECHO Rising Star. She and the ensemble are making their Toronto debut.\n","categories":["Live Performances","Music"],"presenter":null,"image":"sic8UOksO4-kUaSm-mQpyw","website":"https://www.rcmusic.com/concert/leticia-moreno-bach-in-the-americas-429001","tickets":"https://www.rcmusic.com/tickets/seats/429001"},{"id":"963ea004-4327-42db-9900-a0008fcfae57","name":"Grand Soft Day","dates":[1808577000000,1808591400000,1808672400000,1808679600000,1809181800000,1809196200000,1809268200000,1809282600000],"start":"2027-04-24T10:30:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-02T14:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":27,"high":33,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Splash in puddles, wind whipping your hair and the satisfying crunch of frost underfoot. Now that sounds like a perfect day for play! \n\nThis charming production invites children to step into the wilderness and experience the joy of adapting to whatever the sky brings.\n\nThe story is mostly non-verbal, unfolding through live music, physical storytelling, and a sprinkle of English, Irish, and Italian words. Co-created by the award-winning teams of Branar (Ireland) and NIE (UK/Norway), this sensory-filled performance shows that mustering the bravery to face the unexpected is what makes every day an adventure.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":null,"image":"WMRwMsEXupzeYf4mjPBcCg","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/grand-soft-day/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/grand-soft-day/"},{"id":"be9b2bee-4cad-4931-adb2-0f4b94ba0ed5","name":"50 Years of Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery Exhibition - 50th Anniversary","dates":[1788264000000,1788350400000,1788436800000,1788523200000,1788616800000,1788782400000,1788868800000,1788955200000,1789041600000,1789128000000,1789221600000,1789387200000,1789473600000,1789560000000,1789646400000,1789732800000,1789826400000,1789992000000,1790078400000,1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790431200000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791036000000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791640800000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792245600000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000,1792670400000,1792756800000,1792850400000,1793016000000,1793102400000,1793188800000,1793275200000,1793361600000,1793455200000,1793624400000,1793710800000,1793797200000,1793883600000,1793970000000,1794063600000,1794229200000,1794315600000,1794402000000,1794488400000,1794574800000,1794668400000,1794834000000,1794920400000,1795006800000,1795093200000,1795179600000,1795273200000,1795438800000,1795525200000,1795611600000,1795698000000,1795784400000,1795878000000,1796043600000,1796130000000,1796216400000,1796302800000,1796389200000,1796482800000,1796648400000,1796734800000,1