ected by Owain Park. \n\nPraised for their imaginative programming and impeccable blend, The Gesualdo Six joined forces in 2014 for a performance of Gesualdo’s Tenebrae Responsories in Cambridge and has since gone on to perform at numerous major festivals around the world. Notable highlights include a concert in the distinguished Deutschlandradio Debut Series, performances at renowned venues including Wigmore Hall (London), Miller Theatre (New York), the Sydney Opera House, and their debut at the BBC Proms in 2023. Last season, The Gesualdo Six made their South American debut in Colombia, and appeared in Japan, China and Singapore for the first time. \n\nThis concert is preceded by a short performance by talented students of The Royal Conservatory. ","categories":["Live Performances","Music"],"presenter":null,"image":"RRlaI-epMokVNoKflz8YlA","website":"https://www.rcmusic.com/concert/the-gesualdo-six-438201","tickets":"https://www.rcmusic.com/tickets/seats/438201"},{"id":"fb8ee0f5-e80b-452b-a99d-badc13e9b893","name":"Yesterday. Today. Forever.","dates":[1785758400000,1785844800000,1785931200000,1786017600000,1786104000000,1786190400000,1786276800000,1786363200000,1786449600000,1786536000000,1786622400000,1786708800000,1786795200000,1786881600000,1786968000000,1787054400000,1787140800000,1787227200000,1787313600000,1787400000000,1787486400000,1787572800000,1787659200000,1787745600000,1787832000000,1787918400000,1788004800000,1788091200000,1788177600000,1788264000000,1788350400000,1788436800000,1788523200000,1788609600000,1788696000000,1788782400000,1788868800000,1788955200000,1789041600000,1789128000000,1789214400000,1789300800000,1789387200000,1789473600000,1789560000000,1789646400000,1789732800000,1789819200000,1789905600000,1789992000000,1790078400000,1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790424000000,1790510400000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791028800000,1791115200000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,179146