ood Ave studio 176, Toronto, ON","lat":43.680031,"lng":-79.423389},"free":false,"low":30.49,"high":35.49,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\nReseller tickets will not be accepted.\n\nPhoto-op with the cast after the show included with every purchase. ","description":"When Rainbow Fish refuses to share their vibrant, shimmering scales, the whole ocean seems to turn against the vain creature. Unhappy that no one adores them anymore, the Rainbow Fish seeks out the wise Octopus, who helps the fish learn that it's far better to be admired for being kind than for being beautiful. \n\nJoin us for this kids-friendly musical performance and immerse yourself in the ocean!\n\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://tickets.ticketwise.com/event/rainbow-fish-musical-2026","tickets":"https://tickets.ticketwise.com/event/rainbow-fish-musical-2026"},{"id":"27eaf5e7-ffee-4fd5-a818-2f9a1ed2a695","name":"The Rainbow Fish Musical","dates":[1789826400000,1789912800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1792245600000,1792332000000],"start":"2026-09-19T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-18T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Wychwood Theatre","address":"76 Wychwood Ave studio 176, Toronto, ON","lat":43.680031,"lng":-79.423389},"free":false,"low":30.49,"high":35.49,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\nReseller tickets will not be accepted.\n\nPhoto-op with the cast after the show included with every purchase. ","description":"When Rainbow Fish refuses to share their vibrant, shimmering scales, the whole ocean seems to turn against the vain creature. Unhappy that no one adores them anymore, the Rainbow Fish seeks out the wise Octopus, who helps the fish learn that it's far better to be admired for being kind than for being beautiful. \n\nJoin us for this kids-friendly musical performance and immerse yourself in the ocean!\n\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performanc