azzoleni Concert Hall","address":"273 Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M5S 1W2","lat":43.66787,"lng":-79.39619},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\n\nFree tickets available starting from 10 a.m. on Friday, December 11, 2026 and 10 a.m. on Thursday, April 22, 2027.","description":"String students from The Phil and Eli Taylor Performance Academy for Young Artists come together as the Academy Chamber Orchestra to perform a special concert.\n\n\n","categories":["Live Performances","Music"],"presenter":null,"image":"yYyYfSDaLmmxLgwu2gGx-Q","website":"https://www.rcmusic.com/concerts","tickets":"https://www.rcmusic.com/concerts"},{"id":"a094640d-7def-4367-b618-31014ba4c49a","name":"A Translucent City: Collective Memories of the Future","dates":[1788789600000,1788876000000,1788962400000,1789048800000,1789135200000,1789221600000,1789394400000,1789480800000,1789567200000,1789653600000,1789740000000,1789826400000,1789999200000,1790085600000,1790172000000,1790258400000,1790344800000,1790431200000,1790604000000,1790690400000,1790776800000,1790863200000,1790949600000,1791036000000,1791208800000,1791295200000,1791381600000,1791468000000,1791554400000,1791640800000,1791813600000,1791900000000,1791986400000,1792072800000,1792159200000,1792245600000,1792418400000,1792504800000,1792591200000,1792677600000,1792764000000,1792850400000,1793023200000,1793109600000,1793196000000,1793282400000,1793368800000,1793455200000,1793631600000,1793718000000,1793804400000,1793890800000,1793977200000,1794063600000,1794236400000,1794322800000,1794409200000,1794495600000,1794582000000,1794668400000,1794841200000,1794927600000,1795014000000,1795100400000,1795186800000,1795273200000,1795446000000,1795532400000,1795618800000,1795705200000,1795791600000,1795878000000,1796050800000,1796137200000,1796223600000,1796310000000,1796396400000,1796482800000,1796655600000,1796742000000,1796828400000,1796914800000,1797001200000,1797087600000,1797260400000,1797346800000,1797433200000,1797519600000,1797606000000,1797692400000,1797865200000,1797951600000,1798038000000,1798124400000,1798210800000,1798297200000,1798470000000,1798556400000,1798642800000,1798729200000],"start":"2026-09-07T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-31T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Urbanspace Gallery","address":"401 Richmond St W, Toronto, ON, M5V 3A8","lat":43.647755,"lng":-79.394748},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"What do cities remember? How do our stories, relationships and experiences shape the places we call home?\n\nDrawing on community conversations, storytelling, a Sharing Circle and arts-based research, this evolving exhibition, featuring illuminated textile maps, documentary film and opportunities for public participation, explores how people connect to place and imagine urban futures. \n\nVisitors are invited to return throughout the exhibition, contribute to a growing textile installation and experience how the work changes over time.\n","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural","Film"],"presenter":null,"image":"NgegXWP7YyX5G3PIBLwp2g","website":"https://www.urbanspacegallery.ca/event/a-translucent-city-collective-memories-of-the-future/","tickets":null},{"id":"2ae9269b-cb14-4d6e-a6a8-b4453663f702","name":"Cinderella","dates":[1796515200000,1796576400000,1796774400000,1796860800000,1796947200000,1797033600000,1797112800000,1797181200000,1797379200000,1797465600000,1797552000000,1797638400000,1797717600000,1797786000000,1797984000000,1798070400000,1798156800000,1798243200000,1798322400000,1798390800000,1798588800000,1798675200000,1798761600000,1798848000000,1798927200000,1798995600000],"start":"2026-12-05T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2027-01-03T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Winter Garden Theatre","address":"189 Yonge St, Toronto, ON, M5B 1M4","lat":43.653065074,"lng":-79.3792038148},"free":false,"low":49,"high":169,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"The classic story, turned on its heel.\n\nThink you’ve outgrown the panto? Think again.\n\nOur new take on Cinderella delivers all the glitter and spectacle of the beloved tradition with a clever, contemporary edge. Packed with infectious pop anthems, sly humour, and spectacular stagecraft, this is a holiday outing designed as much for grown-ups as it is for kids.\n\nWhether you’re reliving the tradition or discovering it for the first time, this is holiday theatre with wit, style, and a knowing wink.","categories":["Comedy","Family/Children","Live Performances","Winter Holidays"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WK7Gk8ZaBFodp61LlcVkA","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/cinderella","tickets":"https://my.canadianstage.com/overview/9695"},{"id":"13d07353-14bd-4ae6-8af2-358d911c6d90","name":"Cinderella","dates":[1796515200000,1796576400000,1796774400000,1796860800000,1796947200000,1797033600000,1797112800000,1797181200000,1797379200000,1797465600000,1797552000000,1797638400000,1797717600000,1797786000000,1797984000000,1798070400000,1798156800000,1798243200000,1798322400000,1798390800000,1798588800000,1798675200000,1798761600000,1798848000000,1798927200000,1798995600000],"start":"2026-12-05T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2027-01-03T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"The Winter Garden Theatre","address":"189 Yonge St, Toronto, ON, M5B 1M4","lat":43.653065074,"lng":-79.3792038148},"free":false,"low":49,"high":169,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"The classic story, turned on its heel.\n\nThink you’ve outgrown the panto? Think again.\n\nOur new take on Cinderella delivers all the glitter and spectacle of the beloved tradition with a clever, contemporary edge. Packed with infectious pop anthems, sly humour, and spectacular stagecraft, this is a holiday outing designed as much for grown-ups as it is for kids.\n\nWhether you’re reliving the tradition or discovering it for the first time, this is holiday theatre with wit, style, and a knowing wink.","categories":["Comedy","Family/Children","Live Performances","Winter Holidays"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WK7Gk8ZaBFodp61LlcVkA","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/cinderella","tickets":"https://my.canadianstage.com/overview/9695"},{"id":"fa9fec39-a7a5-4fa7-af90-53acd5ad73ff","name":"Battles","dates":[1809190800000],"start":"2027-05-01T13:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-01T13:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":17,"high":50,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\nTo book the French-language performance on Monday, May 3 at 10:15 a.m. and 1 p.m., please visit the Théâtre français de Toronto website or call at 416-534-6604, or 416-534-7303 ext.32.  ","description":"One couch. Five people. Who gets to sit and who gets pushed to the floor?\n\nBattles leaps onto the stage in an acrobatic adventure that explores the tug-of-war between needing to belong and fighting to get ahead. Watch performers flip, tumble, and balance as they navigate the comedy and compromise of shared space.\n\nFrom Montreal’s renowned DynamO Théâtre, this energetic production reveals the quiet heroism required when making room for others and that staying on top might matter less than holding each other up.\n","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Dance","Family/Children"],"presenter":"Young People's Theatre","image":"zWFCVxx91P8Zfmtch1CdXw","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/battles/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/battles/"},{"id":"5d31d5e5-361c-4781-a665-a41f4c69578c","name":"Exhibition: \"Returning to Ourselves and Michael Massie: now and then\"","dates":[1788987600000,1789056000000,1789142400000,1789228800000,1789574400000,1789660800000,1789747200000,1789833600000,1790179200000,1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000,1796835600000,1796922000000,1797008400000,1797094800000,1797440400000,1797526800000,1797613200000,1797699600000,1798045200000,1798131600000,1798218000000,1798304400000,1798650000000,1798736400000,1798822800000,1798909200000,1799254800000,1799341200000,1799427600000,1799514000000,1799859600000,1799946000000,1800032400000,1800118800000,1800464400000,1800550800000,1800637200000,1800723600000,1801069200000,1801155600000,1801242000000,1801328400000],"start":"2026-09-09T17:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-01-30T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Onsite Gallery","address":"199 Richmond St W, Toronto, ON, M5V 0H4","lat":43.649477,"lng":-79.388341},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Please join us at the 'Returning to Ourselves - Rebecca Baird and Kenny Alvin Baird: A Retrospective of Art and Design by Cree Métis Siblings'. Curated by Lisa Deanne Smith.\n\nThis exhibit presents over 40 years of transformative work by Rebecca Baird and Kenny Alvin Baird. The exhibition spans sculpture, painting and traditional material practices, alongside interior design and more.\n\n'Michael Massie: now and then' brings together works from across his career, including a large collection of teapots, previously unexhibited pieces and a new body of large-scale sculptural installations, to celebrate the enduring importance of joy, experimentation and humour in his work. Guest-curated by Alysa Procida and enjoy our Special Projects Gallery.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Artisan","Cultural"],"presenter":null,"image":null,"website":"https://www.ocadu.ca/events-and-exhibitions/michael-massie-now-and-then","tickets":"https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/opening-reception-returning-to-ourselves-michael-massie-now-and-then-tickets-1997059101532?aff=ebdsoporgprofile"},{"id":"b6cc9dd8-39c2-49f3-9c32-00bf24b846c2","name":"Exhibition: \"Returning to Ourselves and Michael Massie: now and then\"","dates":[1788987600000,1789056000000,1789142400000,1789228800000,1789574400000,1789660800000,1789747200000,1789833600000,1790179200000,1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000,1796835600000,1796922000000,1797008400000,1797094800000,1797440400000,1797526800000,1797613200000,1797699600000,1798045200000,1798131600000,1798218000000,1798304400000,1798650000000,1798736400000,1798822800000,1798909200000,1799254800000,1799341200000,1799427600000,1799514000000,1799859600000,1799946000000,1800032400000,1800118800000,1800464400000,1800550800000,1800637200000,1800723600000,1801069200000,1801155600000,1801242000000,1801328400000],"start":"2026-09-09T17:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-01-30T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Onsite Gallery","address":"199 Richmond St W, Toronto, ON, M5V 0H4","lat":43.649477,"lng":-79.388341},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Please join us at the 'Returning to Ourselves - Rebecca Baird and Kenny Alvin Baird: A Retrospective of Art and Design by C