on with a clever, contemporary edge. Packed with infectious pop anthems, sly humour, and spectacular stagecraft, this is a holiday outing designed as much for grown-ups as it is for kids.\n\nWhether you’re reliving the tradition or discovering it for the first time, this is holiday theatre with wit, style, and a knowing wink.","categories":["Comedy","Family/Children","Live Performances","Winter Holidays"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WK7Gk8ZaBFodp61LlcVkA","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/cinderella","tickets":"https://my.canadianstage.com/overview/9695"},{"id":"ac27aee0-37ef-4a7c-8a43-dd5c3c467612","name":"Cinderella","dates":[1796515200000,1796576400000,1796774400000,1796860800000,1796947200000,1797033600000,1797112800000,1797181200000,1797379200000,1797465600000,1797552000000,1797638400000,1797717600000,1797786000000,1797984000000,1798070400000,1798156800000,1798243200000,1798322400000,1798390800000,1798588800000,1798675200000,1798761600000,1798848000000,1798927200000,1798995600000],"start":"2026-12-05T19:00:00-05:00","end":"2027-01-03T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"The Winter Garden Theatre","address":"189 Yonge St, Toronto, ON, M5B 1M4","lat":43.653065074,"lng":-79.3792038148},"free":false,"low":49,"high":169,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"The classic story, turned on its heel.\n\nThink you’ve outgrown the panto? Think again.\n\nOur new take on Cinderella delivers all the glitter and spectacle of the beloved tradition with a clever, contemporary edge. Packed with infectious pop anthems, sly humour, and spectacular stagecraft, this is a holiday outing designed as much for grown-ups as it is for kids.\n\nWhether you’re reliving the tradition or discovering it for the first time, this is holiday theatre with wit, style, and a knowing wink.","categories":["Comedy","Family/Children","Live Performances","Winter Holidays"],"presenter":null,"image":"7WK7Gk8ZaBFodp61LlcVkA","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/cinderella","tickets":"https://my.canadianstage.com/overview/9695"},{"id":"f316efb3-a65d-414b-983f-723ff3e5baf9","name":"Sex in the '80s","dates":[1800145800000,1800212400000,1800405000000,1800491400000,1800577800000,1800664200000,1800750600000,1800817200000,1801009800000,1801096200000,1801182600000,1801269000000,1801355400000,1801422000000,1801614600000,1801701000000,1801787400000,1801873800000,1801960200000,1802026800000],"start":"2027-01-16T19:30:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-07T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":115,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Old history. New rules.\n\nThey haven’t seen each other since the 1980s. Now two accomplished architects are reunited in a glass-walled Toronto office tower on the eve of a high-stakes competition. Both intend to keep things strictly professional. That proves harder than expected.\n\nAs a long-buried chapter of their shared history resurfaces, a polite reunion turns into a pointed, funny sparring match about memory, ambition, and how much the rules have changed. Meanwhile, their twentysomething colleagues look on and aren’t shy about weighing in.\n\nSmart, topical, and wickedly witty, this is a workplace comedy about generational change and the risky business of revisiting the past.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"Fcu46jHUFdGt1qpYFrx14A","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s","tickets":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s"},{"id":"21798e2f-350a-4c7c-a9be-43ec5277dfc2","name":"Sex in the '80s","dates":[1800145800000,1800212400000,1800405000000,1800491400000,1800577800000,1800664200000,1800750600000,1800817200000,1801009800000,1801096200000,1801182600000,1801269000000,1801355400000,1801422000000,1801614600000,1801701000000,1801787400000,1801873800000,1801960200000,1802026800000],"start":"2027-01-16T19:30:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-07T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":115,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Old history. New rules.\n\nThey haven’t seen each other since the 1980s. Now two accomplished architects are reunited in a glass-walled Toronto office tower on the eve of a high-stakes competition. Both intend to keep things strictly professional. That proves harder than expected.\n\nAs a long-buried chapter of their shared history resurfaces, a polite reunion turns into a pointed, funny sparring match about memory, ambition, and how much the rules have changed. Meanwhile, their twentysomething colleagues look on and aren’t shy about weighing in.\n\nSmart, topical, and wickedly witty, this is a workplace comedy about generational change and the risky business of revisiting the past.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"Fcu46jHUFdGt1qpYFrx14A","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s","tickets":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s"},{"id":"b44b965d-0cbf-4350-98fd-72f7f1792a7b","name":"Sex in the '80s","dates":[1800145800000,1800212400000,1800405000000,1800491400000,1800577800000,1800664200000,1800750600000,1800817200000,1801009800000,1801096200000,1801182600000,1801269000000,1801355400000,1801422000000,1801614600000,1801701000000,1801787400000,1801873800000,1801960200000,1802026800000],"start":"2027-01-16T19:30:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-07T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":115,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Old history. New rules.\n\nThey haven’t seen each other since the 1980s. Now two accomplished architects are reunited in a glass-walled Toronto office tower on the eve of a high-stakes competition. Both intend to keep things strictly professional. That proves harder than expected.\n\nAs a long-buried chapter of their shared history resurfaces, a polite reunion turns into a pointed, funny sparring match about memory, ambition, and how much the rules have changed. Meanwhile, their twentysomething colleagues look on and aren’t shy about weighing in.\n\nSmart, topical, and wickedly witty, this is a workplace comedy about generational change and the risky business of revisiting the past.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"Fcu46jHUFdGt1qpYFrx14A","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s","tickets":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s"},{"id":"b23fded6-6265-4ce1-9549-ffac22c2a3ca","name":"Sex in the '80s","dates":[1800145800000,1800212400000,1800405000000,1800491400000,1800577800000,1800664200000,1800750600000,1800817200000,1801009800000,1801096200000,1801182600000,1801269000000,1801355400000,1801422000000,1801614600000,1801701000000,1801787400000,1801873800000,1801960200000,1802026800000],"start":"2027-01-16T19:30:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-07T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":115,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Old history. New rules.\n\nThey haven’t seen each other since the 1980s. Now two accomplished architects are reunited in a glass-walled Toronto office tower on the eve of a high-stakes competition. Both intend to keep things strictly professional. That proves harder than expected.\n\nAs a long-buried chapter of their shared history resurfaces, a polite reunion turns into a pointed, funny sparring match about memory, ambition, and how much the rules have changed. Meanwhile, their twentysomething colleagues look on and aren’t shy about weighing in.\n\nSmart, topical, and wickedly witty, this is a workplace comedy about generational change and the risky business of revisiting the past.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"Fcu46jHUFdGt1qpYFrx14A","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s","tickets":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s"},{"id":"1c450fd7-566b-4adc-aa53-e547f43800a9","name":"Sex in the '80s","dates":[1800145800000,1800212400000,1800405000000,1800491400000,1800577800000,1800664200000,1800750600000,1800817200000,1801009800000,1801096200000,1801182600000,1801269000000,1801355400000,1801422000000,1801614600000,1801701000000,1801787400000,1801873800000,1801960200000,1802026800000],"start":"2027-01-16T19:30:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-07T14:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Berkeley Street Theatre","address":"26 Berkeley St, Toronto, ON, M5A 2W3","lat":43.650577241,"lng":-79.36426063},"free":false,"low":35,"high":115,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Old history. New rules.\n\nThey haven’t seen each other since the 1980s. Now two accomplished architects are reunited in a glass-walled Toronto office tower on the eve of a high-stakes competition. Both intend to keep things strictly professional. That proves harder than expected.\n\nAs a long-buried chapter of their shared history resurfaces, a polite reunion turns into a pointed, funny sparring match about memory, ambition, and how much the rules have changed. Meanwhile, their twentysomething colleagues look on and aren’t shy about weighing in.\n\nSmart, topical, and wickedly witty, this is a workplace comedy about generational change and the risky business of revisiting the past.","categories":["Comedy","Theatre"],"presenter":null,"image":"Fcu46jHUFdGt1qpYFrx14A","website":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s","tickets":"https://www.canadianstage.com/shows-events/season/sex-in-the-80s"},{"id":"0a9f9964-94ed-4fb3-81d0-4e0354331136","name":"Grand Soft Day","dates":[1808577000000,1808591400000,1808672400000,1808679600000,1809181800000,1809196200000,1809268200000,1809282600000],"start":"2027-04-24T10:30:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-02T14:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":27,"high":33,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Splash in puddles, wind whipping your hair and the satisfying crunch of frost underfoot. Now that sounds like a perfect day for play! \n\nThis charming production invites children to step into the wilderness and experience the joy of adapting to whatever the sky brings.\n\nThe story is mostly non-verbal, unfolding through live music, physical storytelling, and a sprinkle of English, Irish, and Italian words. Co-created by the award-winning teams of Branar (Ireland) and NIE (UK/Norway), this sensory-filled performance shows that mustering the bravery to face the unexpected is what makes every day an adventure.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":null,"image":"WMRwMsEXupzeYf4mjPBcCg","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/grand-soft-day/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/grand-soft-day/"},{"id":"9dba3132-b616-48d5-8d1a-3754f79a770a","name":"Grand Soft Day","dates":[1808577000000,1808591400000,1808672400000,1808679600000,1809181800000,1809196200000,1809268200000,1809282600000],"start":"2027-04-24T10:30:00-04:00","end":"2027-05-02T14:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Young People's Theatre","address":"165 Front St E, Toronto, ON, M5A 3Z4","lat":43.6499984416,"lng":-79.3687420725},"free":false,"low":27,"high":33,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Splash in puddles, wind whipping your hair and the satisfying crunch of frost underfoot. Now that sounds like a perfect day for play! \n\nThis charming production invites children to step into the wilderness and experience the joy of adapting to whatever the sky brings.\n\nThe story is mostly non-verbal, unfolding through live music, physical storytelling, and a sprinkle of English, Irish, and Italian words. Co-created by the award-winning teams of Branar (Ireland) and NIE (UK/Norway), this sensory-filled performance shows that mustering the bravery to face the unexpected is what makes every day an adventure.\n","categories":["Family/Children","Live Performances"],"presenter":null,"image":"WMRwMsEXupzeYf4mjPBcCg","website":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/grand-soft-day/","tickets":"https://www.youngpeoplestheatre.org/shows-tickets/grand-soft-day/"},{"id":"6a06498d-1997-4bc9-afc8-16e4ef736aa5","name":"Duende International Flamenco Festival: Flamenco and the World","dates":[1795042800000,1795136400000,1795222800000,1795309200000,1795395600000],"start":"2026-11-18T18:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-11-22T20:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Aga Khan Museum","address":"77 Wynford Dr, North York, ON M3C 1K1","lat":43.725278,"lng":-79.332045},"free":false,"low":45,"high":150,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Celebrate flamenco’s global transformation!\n\nExperience the vibrant evolution of flamenco, from its regional roots in Andalusia to a dynamic global art form shaped by cross-cultural exchange. \n\nThis year’s lineup spans both traditional flamenco from Andalusia and innovative collaborations at the crossroads of qawwali and Persian muqam, tracing the art form’s evolution from its regional roots to a global practice.","categories":["Dance","Live Performances","Museum"],"presenter":"Aga Khan Museum","image":"qp_RMmWPShlY0lOpIswCKQ","website":"https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/duende-2026/?utm_source=city+of+toronto&utm_medium=event+listing&utm_campaign=duende+26","tickets":"https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/duende-2026/?utm_source=city+of+toronto&utm_medium=event+listing&utm_campaign=duende+26"},{"id":"9bc09cca-65ca-4759-9136-928ef2a2949d","name":"Duende International Flamenco Festival: Flamenco and the World","dates":[1795042800000,1795136400000,1795222800000,1795309200000,1795395600000],"start":"2026-11-18T18:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-11-22T20:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Aga Khan Museum","address":"77 Wynford Dr, North York, ON M3C 1K1","lat":43.725278,"lng":-79.332045},"free":false,"low":45,"high":150,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Celebrate flamenco’s global transformation!\n\nExperience the vibrant evolution of flamenco, from its regional roots in Andalusia to a dynamic global art form shaped by cross-cultural exchange. \n\nThis year’s lineup spans both traditional flamenco from Andalusia and innovative collaborations at the crossroads of qawwali and Persian muqam, tracing the art form’s evolution from its regional roots to a global practice.","categories":["Dance","Live Performances","Museum"],"presenter":"Aga Khan Museum","image":"qp_RMmWPShlY0lOpIswCKQ","website":"https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/duende-2026/?utm_source=city+of+toronto&utm_medium=event+listing&utm_campaign=duende+26","tickets":"https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/duende-2026/?utm_source=city+of+toronto&utm_medium=event+listing&utm_campaign=duende+26"},{"id":"481602f1-88ba-4257-a990-cb4c45f60601","name":"Sala-Manca Group: Like a Bird’s Nest","dates":[1790204400000,1790269200000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790524800000,1790787600000,1790874000000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791129600000,1791392400000,1791478800000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791734400000,1791997200000,1792083600000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792339200000,1792602000000,1792688400000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792944000000,1793206800000,1793293200000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793552400000,1793815200000,1793901600000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794157200000,1794420000000,1794506400000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1794762000000,1795024800000,1795111200000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795366800000,1795629600000,1795716000000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1795971600000],"start":"2026-09-23T19:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-11-29T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"PIX FILM Gallery","address":"1411 Dufferin St, Toronto, ON, M6H 4C7","lat":43.670941,"lng":-79.439848},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Enjoy a landmark retrospective from the international artist collective, the Sala-Manca Group.\n\nInstallation, video and photography are exhibited together for the first time, all connected to the ritual object of the sukkah, a temporary hut traditionally erected during the Jewish festival of Sukkot.\n\nOver the last twenty years, Sala-Manca has explored the symbolism and function of the sukkah and related themes of shelter, impermanence, displacement, and liberation. In their hands, the sukkah is interchangeably a ritual structure, an ethnographic object, a work of art, an ephemeral monument, a site of protest, and a performative arena. \n\nThis exhibition traverses unlikely geographies, travelling through time and place, from a small town in Germany where no Jews remain to a Jahalin Bedouin community in Khan al-Ahmar; from the contested streets of Jerusalem to the fraught landscapes of Ontario. ","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural","Talks"],"presenter":"Fentster Gallery","image":"T7PtQvwfAsgTqCPeW8LzYw","website":"https://fentster.org/birds-nest","tickets":null},{"id":"8044c315-ab2c-4670-8a6d-c8512c2b3c8f","name":"Sala-Manca Group: Like a Bird’s Nest","dates":[1790204400000,1790269200000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790524800000,1790787600000,1790874000000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791129600000,1791392400000,1791478800000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791734400000,1791997200000,1792083600000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792339200000,1792602000000,1792688400000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792