sts Forum ","image":null,"website":"https://www.icaaf.ca/competition","tickets":"https://www.icaaf.ca/competition"},{"id":"8e67bf6c-d3a5-4044-bcfd-5b479ffb90ea","name":"Lantern Tours: Macabre Tales at Todmorden Mills","dates":[1793226600000,1793313000000,1793399400000,1793485800000],"start":"2026-10-28T18:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T18:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Night Event","venue":{"name":"Todmorden Mills Heritage Site","address":"67 Pottery Rd, East York, ON, M4K 2B9","lat":43.686361228,"lng":-79.36033401},"free":false,"low":22,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Join us for an unforgettable evening of creepy stories spanning the 1890s, 1940s and present. Explore the historic Helliwell House and the Cottage, where local legends and chilling tales come to life. After your enhanced tour, warm up with a cozy drink in the Brewery Building.","categories":["History","Museum","Tour","Halloween"],"presenter":null,"image":"NX5CLZgv1sVhCnb3c1A40w","website":null,"tickets":"https://secure.toronto.ca/webapps/feps_edc-ticketing/#events/fa1ecb23-0130-4fb4-bf32-86c11590d459"},{"id":"3023f97b-6473-4055-a689-930747fe2e6c","name":"Steeles Library Tree Tour","dates":[1792173600000],"start":"2026-10-16T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-16T14:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Steeles Library","address":"375 Bamburgh Crcl, Scarborough, ON, M1W 3Y1","lat":43.815681245,"lng":-79.322382371},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"The Steeles branch and its neighbourhood is home to a variety of trees. Join the City of Toronto to explore the natural world on a local neighbourhood tour. Learn how to recognize different species and fun facts about their cultural and ecological importance.\n\nThe tour will start and end at the Steeles Branch side entrance and will be guided by City of Toronto staff. There may be uneven, unpaved surfaces along the route. Please dress and prepare accordingly for this outdoor program (e.g. gloves/mittens, hats, sunscreen, water, comfortable shoes). This program takes place rain or shine. In the event of severe inclement weather, registrants will be notified of an alternative date.\n\nChildren under 12 must be accompanied by a parent/caregiver. Registration is required.\n\n","categories":["Environmental","Tour"],"presenter":null,"image":"-x4VeRICU-WrF7Mbxdvq3g","website":"https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a972cec1c197d11325c7611","tickets":"https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a972cec1c197d11325c7611"},{"id":"9359c63f-0460-4824-9ffb-c623c8fbbdc7","name":"50 Years of Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery Exhibition - 50th Anniversary","dates":[1788264000000,1788350400000,1788436800000,1788523200000,1788616800000,1788782400000,1788868800000,1788955200000,1789041600000,1789128000000,1789221600000,1789387200000,1789473600000,1789560000000,1789646400000,1789732800000,1789826400000,1789992000000,1790078400000,1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790431200000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791036000000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791640800000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792245600000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000,1792670400000,1792756800000,1792850400000,1793016000000,1793102400000,1793188800000,1793275200000,1793361600000,1793455200000,1793624400000,1793710800000,1793797200000,1793883600000,1793970000000,1794063600000,1794229200000,1794315600000,1794402000000,1794488400000,1794574800000,1794668400000,1794834000000,1794920400000,1795006800000,1795093200000,1795179600000,1795273200000,1795438800000,1795525200000,1795611600000,1795698000000,1795784400000,1795878000000,1796043600000,1796130000000,1796216400000,1796302800000,1796389200000,1796482800000,1796648400000,1796734800000,1796821200000,1796907600000,1796994000000,1797087600000,1797253200000,1797339600000],"start":"2026-09-01T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-15T08:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery","address":"399 The West Mall, Etobicoke, ON, M9C 2Y2","lat":43.643772026,"lng":-79.565452785},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Discover the history of art at the Etobicoke Civic Centre with artifacts, prints, images and paintings from City of Toronto’s Fine Art, Artifact and Archival collections. Celebrate the present by witnessing a commissioned piece by early career artist Lise Round. Envision the future with new designs of the updated Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"A6-VIKDNvgJfy1_SuU-UqA","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/etobicoke-civic-centre-art-gallery/?WT.rd_id=%2Feccartgallery","tickets":null},{"id":"434f7570-37c1-41c1-9015-1d28a4b98713","name":"Rebellion Talks: The Rebellion's Teenage Spies","dates":[1792864800000],"start":"2026-10-24T14:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-24T14:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Zion Schoolhouse","address":"1091 Finch Ave E, North York, ON, M2J 2X3","lat":43.790365148,"lng":-79.363407399},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Delve into stories of young people who were caught up in the violence of the Rebellion of 1837. Teenagers risked their lives on secret missions for their cause, volunteering on both sides of the rebellion. Some supported the revolutionaries while others defended the government of the day. Meet the young spies and secret agents, including the real life De Grassi kids and a mysterious rebel messenger who captured the attention of one of the world's most famous authors.\n\nFrom October 2026 to April 2027, historian Adam Bunch brings Toronto’s history to life in a series of talks exploring the Upper Canada Rebellion and its lasting impact on the city. From spies and taverns to political reform, rural rebels and the Patriot War, each talk reveals a different story connected to the museum where it takes place.","categories":["History","Museum","Talks"],"presenter":"Toronto History Museums","image":"FVDuLRALN0QiBwnWccgvvg","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/museums/zion-schoolhouse/","tickets":"https://secure.toronto.ca/webapps/feps_edc-ticketing/#events/7eb02aaf-94e3-4a92-8e5a-998b0db8d447"},{"id":"d879e469-8757-4be1-82ff-342276a15f70","name":"Agency & Defiance: Exhibit at Montgomery's Inn","dates":[1793980800000,1794067200000,1794153600000,1794412800000,1794499200000,1794585600000,1794672000000,1794758400000,1795017600000,1795104000000,1795190400000,1795276800000,1795363200000,1795622400000,1795708800000,1795795200000,1795881600000,1795968000000,1796227200000,1796313600000,1796400000000,1796486400000,1796572800000,1796832000000,1796918400000,1797004800000,1797091200000,1797177600000,1797436800000,1797523200000,1797609600000,1797696000000,1797782400000,1798041600000,1798128000000,1798214400000,1798300800000,1798387200000,1798646400000,1798732800000,1798819200000,1798905600000,1798992000000,1799251200000,1799337600000,1799424000000,1799510400000,1799596800000,1799856000000,1799942400000,1800028800000,1800115200000,1800201600000,1800460800000,1800547200000,1800633600000,1800720000000,1800806400000,1801065600000,1801152000000,1801238400000,1801324800000,1801411200000,1801670400000,1801756800000,1801843200000,1801929600000,1802016000000,1802275200000,1802361600000,1802448000000,1802534400000,1802620800000,1802880000000,1802966400000,1803052800000,1803139200000,1803225600000,1803484800000,1803571200000,1803657600000,1803744000000,1803830400000],"start":"2026-11-06T11:00:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-28T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Montgomery's Inn","address":"4709 Dundas St W, Etobicoke, ON, M9A 1A8","lat":43.651679,"lng":-79.525659},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Experience Agency and Defiance, featuring never-before-seen works by Toronto-based artist Frantz Brent-Harris inspired by Jamaican Junkanoo. Through these figures, the artist shares the enduring legacy of agency, defiance, resilience, joy, love, and cultural expression that sustained enslaved peoples and their descendants, even under inhumane conditions. ","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","History","Museum","Black History Month"],"presenter":null,"image":"qZyjxxbPBbXkbmhYN7I9Sg","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/montgomerysinn","tickets":null},{"id":"a0a7a2dc-285e-4a03-b956-0b02b6ade529","name":"Agency & Defiance: Exhibit at Montgomery's Inn","dates":[1793980800000,1794067200000,1794153600000,1794412800000,1794499200000,1794585600000,1794672000000,1794758400000,1795017600000,1795104000000,1795190400000,1795276800000,1795363200000,1795622400000,1795708800000,1795795200000,1795881600000,1795968000000,1796227200000,1796313600000,1796400000000,1796486400000,1796572800000,1796832000000,1796918400000,1797004800000,1797091200000,1797177600000,1797436800000,1797523200000,1797609600000,1797696000000,1797782400000,1798041600000,1798128000000,1798214400000,1798300800000,1798387200000,1798646400000,1798732800000,1798819200000,1798905600000,1798992000000,1799251200000,1799337600000,1799424000000,1799510400000,1799596800000,1799856000000,1799942400000,1800028800000,1800115200000,1800201600000,1800460800000,1800547200000,1800633600000,1800720000000,1800806400000,1801065600000,1801152000000,1801238400000,1801324800000,1801411200000,1801670400000,1801756800000,1801843200000,1801929600000,1802016000000,1802275200000,1802361600000,1802448000000,1802534400000,1802620800000,1802880000000,1802966400000,1803052800000,1803139200000,1803225600000,1803484800000,1803571200000,1803657600000,1803744000000,1803830400000],"start":"2026-11-06T11:00:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-28T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Montgomery's Inn","address":"4709 Dundas St W, Etobicoke, ON, M9A 1A8","lat"