3600000,1797570000000,1797656400000,1797742800000],"start":"2026-09-15T00:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-12-20T00:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Toronto (virtual)","address":"","lat":null,"lng":null},"free":false,"low":10,"high":30,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"This international architectural competition invites participants to design a Persian Garden Suite pavilion in Toronto. \n\nThe initiative explores cultural heritage, urban design, and innovative architecture. Detailed competition guidelines, submission criteria and timelines are available for participants.","categories":["Cultural","Other"],"presenter":"Iranian-Canadian Architects and Artists Forum ","image":null,"website":"https://www.icaaf.ca/competition","tickets":"https://www.icaaf.ca/competition"},{"id":"f6a50eff-c0b2-4c6b-a6c9-4f2ae8ab78c9","name":"Taste of Downtown Yonge Fall Flavours: Walking Food Tour","dates":[1789659000000,1790263800000,1790868600000,1791473400000,1792078200000,1792683000000,1793287800000,1793896200000,1794501000000,1795105800000,1795710600000],"start":"2026-09-17T11:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-11-26T11:30:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Meeting point: Fusettes","address":"407 Yonge St, Toronto, ON, M5B 1S9","lat":43.659499524,"lng":-79.382002835},"free":false,"low":20,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Fall Flavours is a seasonal one-hour food tour designed especially for people who work in and around the neighbourhood. \n\nDiscover the flavours of the season while visiting local restaurants, cafés and food spots, with tasting-sized bites and stories from the streets of Downtown Yonge. \n\nIt’s a quick, delicious way to make your lunch hour feel like a little adventure! Find some new local favourites along the way.\n\nOne hour. Multiple food stops. A taste of the season and of the city!  Come hungry and discover somewhere new.","categories":["Food/Culinary","Run/Walk","Tour"],"presenter":"Downtown Yonge BIA","image":nu