,"lat":43.70439955,"lng":-79.410511225},"free":false,"low":25,"high":49,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Step into the opulent Eglinton Grand for an unforgettable show this Halloween season. \n\nLon Chaney’s 1925 horror film The Phantom of the Opera gets a thrilling new soundtrack by Juno Award-winning composer and jazz bassist Andrew Downing, performed live by the Amadeus Choir with the composer and his all-star band. \n\nBlending a choral textures, jazz improv, and classic cinema, you won’t want to miss this elegant night out! \n","categories":["Film","Live Performances","Music","Halloween"],"presenter":null,"image":"aOyYJ7DkcnZ91Ptb--iAdg","website":"https://amadeuschoir.com/phantom-live/","tickets":"https://amadeuschoir.com/phantom-live/"},{"id":"3c89fbbe-f686-42cc-9076-d91a913176e1","name":"Retracing Tatreez: Palestinian Thobes through the Twentieth Century","dates":[1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790524800000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791129600000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791734400000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792339200000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792944000000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793552400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794157200000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1794762000000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795366800000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1795971600000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000,1796576400000,1796835600000,1796922000000,1797008400000,1797094800000,1797181200000,1797440400000,1797526800000,1797613200000,1797699600000,1797786000000,1798045200000,1798131600000,1798218000000,1798304400000,1798390800000,1798650000000,1798736400000,1798822800000,1798909200000,1798995600000,1799254800000,1799341200000,1799427600000,1799514000000,179960040000