t W, Toronto, ON, M5S 1K5","lat":43.666951,"lng":-79.392113},"free":false,"low":15,"high":159,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\n5-Day, 2-Day, and Single Day Passes available. Masterclasses require separate registration. Box office also available on site during Festival hours.","description":"Welcome to Canada’s largest and longest-running literary festival.! \n\nThis fall, TIFA 2026 brings the world’s most compelling writers into conversation with one another and with you. Join us for over 100 events with some of the world’s most beloved authors.\n\nFrom author conversations to electric readings and intimate masterclasses, the Festival is where stories cross borders, ideas find each other, and readers discover that literature is very much alive. \n\nThis year’s guestlist includes Barbara Kingsolver, Dave Eggers, Marie Ndiaye, Ann-Marie MacDonald, Andrew Sean Greer, Patrick deWitt, David Szalay, Vivek Shraya, Canisia Lubrin and Téa Mutonji.","categories":["Literary","Live Performances"],"presenter":null,"image":"xo8dfCMetGe-UyXKAAVoiA","website":"https://festivalofauthors.ca/festival/?utm_source=eventlisting&utm_medium=eventlisting&utm_campaign=fallfestival","tickets":"https://festivalofauthors.ca/festival/?utm_source=eventlisting&utm_medium=eventlisting&utm_campaign=fallfestival"},{"id":"139e6a3f-9813-489d-ba56-b58b4f58058b","name":"International Architectural Design Competition 2026-2027: Persian Garden Suite","dates":[1789444800000,1789531200000,1789617600000,1789704000000,1789790400000,1789876800000,1789963200000,1790049600000,1790136000000,1790222400000,1790308800000,1790395200000,1790481600000,1790568000000,1790654400000,1790740800000,1790827200000,1790913600000,1791000000000,1791086400000,1791172800000,1791259200000,1791345600000,1791432000000,1791518400000,1791604800000,1791691200000,1791777600000,1791864000000,1791950400000,1792036800000,1792123200000,1792209600000,1792296000000,1792382400000,1792468800000,1792555200000,1792641600000,1792728000000,1792814400000,179