 Tatreez highlights what these belongings can tell us about the relationship between Palestinians and their homelands in the twentieth century and beyond.\n\nIn this exhibition, curator Nina Rafique showcases these pieces with restored historical context and invites visitors to re-engage with their ways of storytelling. \n\nIn doing so, Retracing Tatreez highlights what these embroideries can tell us about the unique regional connections between Palestinians and their homelands, as well as the journeys of these objects from the hands of their original creators to today.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural","Museum"],"presenter":null,"image":"j37-eBOZLJMeQ8B7zUJpJg","website":"https://textilemuseum.ca/event/retracing-tatreez-palestinian-thobes-through-the-20th-century/","tickets":"https://textilemuseumcanada.ticketing.veevartapp.com/tickets/view/calendar"},{"id":"8d3c12b7-5082-424d-8301-8b297f674864","name":"International Architectural Design Competition 2026-2027: Persian Garden Suite","dates":[1789444800000,1789531200000,1789617600000,1789704000000,1789790400000,1789876800000,1789963200000,1790049600000,1790136000000,1790222400000,1790308800000,1790395200000,1790481600000,1790568000000,1790654400000,1790740800000,1790827200000,1790913600000,1791000000000,1791086400000,1791172800000,1791259200000,1791345600000,1791432000000,1791518400000,1791604800000,1791691200000,1791777600000,1791864000000,1791950400000,1792036800000,1792123200000,1792209600000,1792296000000,1792382400000,1792468800000,1792555200000,1792641600000,1792728000000,1792814400000,1792900800000,1792987200000,1793073600000,1793160000000,1793246400000,1793332800000,1793419200000,1793505600000,1793595600000,1793682000000,1793768400000,1793854800000,1793941200000,1794027600000,1794114000000,1794200400000,1794286800000,1794373200000,1794459600000,1794546000000,1794632400000,1794718800000,1794805200000,1794891600000,1794978000000,1795064400000,1795150800000,1795237200000,1795323600000,1795410000000,17954