00,1794150000000],"start":"2026-11-07T10:00:00-05:00","end":"2026-11-08T10:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Centennial Recreation Centre: Scarborough","address":"1967 Ellesmere Rd, Scarborough, ON, M1H 2W5","lat":43.774594,"lng":-79.237411},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\nRefreshments included.","description":"Featuring over 400 original, juried works of art by member artists, many of whom will be in attendance. \n\nWorks include watercolour, pastel, oil, acrylic, ink, sculpture and mixed media. \n\nThe Art Guild of Scarborough is a non-profit organization. Since 1962, it has brought together artists to promote and celebrate the creation of original art. Members range in experience from novice to professional. The Art Guild of Scarborough holds weekly member meetings featuring both demonstrations by notable artists and hands-on art activities.  ","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"_rtt0R_qDYfVA3ssRZJBMg","website":"http://theartguildofscarborough.com/upcoming-shows","tickets":null},{"id":"d0a47579-4809-4e0c-a0ac-d36302095868","name":"Canvas Chronicles","dates":[1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790431200000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791036000000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791640800000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792245600000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000],"start":"2026-09-23T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-21T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery","address":"399 The West Mall, Etobicoke, ON, M9C 2Y2","lat":43.643772026,"lng":-79.565452785},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Every brushstroke tells a story in the Federation of Canadian Artists Toronto exhibit. This collection captures the artist’s thoughts, emotions, and moments in time, weaving technical skill and personality into complex visual narratives. The adventurous members invite you to engage with their inspired works—art that stirs imagination, reveals process, and celebrates the stories behind each creation.\n\nReception: September 27, 2–4 p.m.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"4-Cfo3Q5_lOCyFEhvqYtpQ","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/etobicoke-civic-centre-art-gallery/","tickets":null},{"id":"f4967b51-e1be-4d7d-a26d-2411ddd56d20","name":"Canvas Chronicles","dates":[1790164800000,1790251200000,1790337600000,1790431200000,1790596800000,1790683200000,1790769600000,1790856000000,1790942400000,1791036000000,1791201600000,1791288000000,1791374400000,1791460800000,1791547200000,1791640800000,1791806400000,1791892800000,1791979200000,1792065600000,1792152000000,1792245600000,1792411200000,1792497600000,1792584000000],"start":"2026-09-23T08:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-21T08:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Etobicoke Civic Centre Art Gallery","address":"399 The West Mall, Etobicoke, ON, M9C 2Y2","lat":43.643772026,"lng":-79.565452785},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Every brushstroke tells a story in the Federation of Canadian Artists Toronto exhibit. This collection captures the artist’s thoughts, emotions, and moments in time, weaving technical skill and personality into complex visual narratives. The adventurous members invite you to engage with their inspired works—art that stirs imagination, reveals process, and celebrates the stories behind each creation.\n\nReception: September 27, 2–4 p.m.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits"],"presenter":null,"image":"4-Cfo3Q5_lOCyFEhvqYtpQ","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/cultural-centres-galleries/etobicoke-civic-centre-art-gallery/","tickets":null},{"id":"e48deba8-8276-4a81-81a5-5b7381c0ca9d","name":"Agency & Defiance: Exhibit at Montgomery's Inn","dates":[1793980800000,1794067200000,1794153600000,1794412800000,1794499200000,1794585600000,1794672000000,1794758400000,1795017600000,1795104000000,1795190400000,1795276800000,1795363200000,1795622400000,1795708800000,1795795200000,1795881600000,1795968000000,1796227200000,1796313600000,1796400000000,1796486400000,1796572800000,1796832000000,1796918400000,1797004800000,1797091200000,1797177600000,1797436800000,1797523200000,1797609600000,1797696000000,1797782400000,1798041600000,1798128000000,1798214400000,1798300800000,1798387200000,1798646400000,1798732800000,1798819200000,1798905600000,1798992000000,1799251200000,1799337600000,1799424000000,1799510400000,1799596800000,1799856000000,1799942400000,1800028800000,1800115200000,1800201600000,1800460800000,1800547200000,1800633600000,1800720000000,1800806400000,1801065600000,1801152000000,1801238400000,1801324800000,1801411200000,1801670400000,1801756800000,1801843200000,1801929600000,1802016000000,1802275200000,1802361600000,1802448000000,1802534400000,1802620800000,1802880000000,1802966400000,1803052800000,1803139200000,1803225600000,1803484800000,1803571200000,1803657600000,1803744000000,1803830400000],"start":"2026-11-06T11:00:00-05:00","end":"2027-02-28T11:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Montgomery's Inn","address":"4709 Dundas St W, Etobicoke, ON, M9A 1A8","lat":43.651679,"lng":-79.525659},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Experience Agency and Defiance, featuring never-before-seen works by Toronto-based artist Frantz Brent-Harris inspired by Jamaican Junkanoo. Through these figures, the artist shares the enduring legacy of agency, defiance, resilience, joy, love, and cultural expression that sustained enslaved peoples and their descendants, even under inhumane conditions. ","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","History","Museum","Black History Month"],"presenter":null,"image":"qZyjxxbPBbXkbmhYN7I9Sg","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/montgomerysinn"