7d8341d-fe12-4574-bc67-d4b29cf1a9b4","name":"Retracing Tatreez: Palestinian Thobes through the Twentieth Century","dates":[1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790524800000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791129600000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791734400000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792339200000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792944000000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793552400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794157200000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1794762000000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795366800000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1795971600000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000,1796576400000,1796835600000,1796922000000,1797008400000,1797094800000,1797181200000,1797440400000,1797526800000,1797613200000,1797699600000,1797786000000,1798045200000,1798131600000,1798218000000,1798304400000,1798390800000,1798650000000,1798736400000,1798822800000,1798909200000,1798995600000,1799254800000,1799341200000,1799427600000,1799514000000,1799600400000,1799859600000,1799946000000,1800032400000,1800118800000,1800205200000,1800464400000,1800550800000,1800637200000,1800723600000,1800810000000,1801069200000,1801155600000,1801242000000,1801328400000,1801414800000,1801674000000,1801760400000,1801846800000,1801933200000,1802019600000],"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-02-07T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Textile Museum of Canada","address":"55 Centre Ave, Toronto, ON, M5G 2H5","lat":43.654578756,"lng":-79.386652476},"free":false,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\nChildren 5 and under visit for free.","description":"Featuring several examples of Palestinian tatreez (embroidery) from the Textile Museum’s collection, most of which will be exhibited for the first time! \n\nRetracing Tatreez highlights what these belongings can tell us about the relationship between Palestinians and their homelands in the twentieth century and beyond.\n\nIn this exhibition, curator Nina Rafique showcases these pieces with restored historical context and invites visitors to re-engage with their ways of storytelling. \n\nIn doing so, Retracing Tatreez highlights what these embroideries can tell us about the unique regional connections between Palestinians and their homelands, as well as the journeys of these objects from the hands of their original creators to today.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural","Museum"],"presenter":null,"image":"j37-eBOZLJMeQ8B7zUJpJg","website":"https://textilemuseum.ca/event/retracing-tatreez-palestinian-thobes-through-the-20th-century/","tickets":"https://textilemuseumcanada.ticketing.veevartapp.com/tickets/view/calendar"},{"id":"3c80663a-15f6-4284-8c63-293dccd58b2b","name":"Retracing Tatreez: Palestinian Thobes through the Twentieth Century","dates":[1790265600000,1790352000000,1790438400000,1790524800000,1790784000000,1790870400000,1790956800000,1791043200000,1791129600000,1791388800000,1791475200000,1791561600000,1791648000000,1791734400000,1791993600000,1792080000000,1792166400000,1792252800000,1792339200000,1792598400000,1792684800000,1792771200000,1792857600000,1792944000000,1793203200000,1793289600000,1793376000000,1793462400000,1793552400000,1793811600000,1793898000000,1793984400000,1794070800000,1794157200000,1794416400000,1794502800000,1794589200000,1794675600000,1794762000000,1795021200000,1795107600000,1795194000000,1795280400000,1795366800000,1795626000000,1795712400000,1795798800000,1795885200000,1795971600000,1796230800000,1796317200000,1796403600000,1796490000000,1796576400000,1796835600000,1796922000000,1797008400000,1797094800000,1797181200000,1797440400000,1797526800000,1797613200000,1797699600000,1797786000000,1798045200000,1798131600000,1798218000000,1798304400000,1798390800000,1798650000000,1798736400000,1798822800000,1798909200000,1798995600000,1799254800000,1799341200000,1799427600000,1799514000000,1799600400000,1799859600000,1799946000000,1800032400000,1800118800000,1800205200000,1800464400000,1800550800000,1800637200000,1800723600000,1800810000000,1801069200000,1801155600000,1801242000000,1801328400000,1801414800000,1801674000000,1801760400000,1801846800000,1801933200000,1802019600000],"start":"2026-09-24T12:00:00-04:00","end":"2027-02-07T12:00:00-05:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Textile Museum of Canada","address":"55 Centre Ave, Toronto, ON, M5G 2H5","lat":43.654578756,"lng":-79.386652476},"free":false,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":"\nChildren 5 and under visit for free.","description":"Featuring several examples of Palestinian tatreez (embroidery) from the Textile Museum’s collection, most of which will be exhibited for the first time! \n\nRetracing Tatreez highlights what these belongings can tell us about the relationship between Palestinians and their homelands in the twentieth century and beyond.\n\nIn this exhibition, curator Nina Rafique showcases these pieces with restored historical context and invites visitors to re-engage with their ways of storytelling. \n\nIn doing so, Retracing Tatreez highlights what these embroideries can tell us about the unique regional connections between Palestinians and their homelands, as well as the journeys of these objects from the hands of their original creators to today.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","Cultural","Museum"],"presenter":null,"image":"j37-eBOZLJMeQ8B7zUJpJg","website":"https://textilemuseum.ca/event/retracing-tatreez-palestinian-thobes-through-the-20th-century/","tickets":"https://textilemuseumcanada.ticketing.veevartapp.com/tickets/view/calendar"},{"id":"90132724-7395-40bb-aa9c-afd20d1ac2df","name":"Joseph Bannon Park - 11 a.m .to 1 p.m.","dates":[1791644400000],"start":"2026-10-10T11:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-10T11:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Joseph Bannon Park","address":"65 Mary Chapman Blvd, North York","lat":43.732362305,"lng":-79.53494893},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Try something new, get moving and connect through sport, Play Mobile is a free touring sports program for all ages and skill levels.\n\nWith a variety of sports equipment on board, vibrant vans tour neighbourhoods, transforming parks and outdoor spaces into pop-up sport hubs, bringing energy and excitement directly to communities around the city. Proudly powered in partnership with Nike, Play Mobile is committed to the future of youth sport, creating more equitable and inclusive access to play – with a focus on encouraging girls to participate and stay involved in sport.","categories":["Sports"],"presenter":null,"image":"JY5NZWRAS6Lt1TXJKw_GWw","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/parks-recreation/places-spaces/parks-and-recreation-facilities/parks-and-community-recreation-centres-map/#location=790%20Queen%20St%20W&lat=43.647889&lng=-79.414226&zoom=17","tickets":null},{"id":"0b829443-205a-42ed-a868-5f2c2f6419a6","name":"The Elms - 2:30 to 4:30 p.m.","dates":[1791657000000],"start":"2026-10-10T14:30:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-10T14:30:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"The Elms","address":"45 Golfdown Dr, Etobicoke, ON, M9W 2H8","lat":43.7222273,"lng":-79.552113787},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Try something new, get moving and connect through sport, Play Mobile is a free touring sports program for all ages and skill levels.\n\nWith a variety of sports equipment on board, vibrant vans tour neighbourhoods, transforming parks and outdoor spaces into pop-up sport hubs, bringing energy and excitement directly to communities around the city. Proudly powered in partnership with Nike, Play Mobile is committed to the future of youth sport, creating more equitable and inclusive access to play – with a focus on encourag