n facts about their cultural and ecological importance. \n\nThe tour will start and end at the Downsview branch and will be guided by City of Toronto staff. There may be uneven, unpaved surfaces along the route. Please dress and prepare accordingly for this outdoor program (e.g. gloves/mittens, hats, sunscreen, water, comfortable shoes). This program takes place rain or shine. In the event of severe inclement weather, registrants will be notified of an alternative date. Children under 12 must be accompanied by a parent/caregiver.\n\nThis free program requires registration.","categories":["Environmental","Tour"],"presenter":null,"image":"GhrR-HvM1zCiEkUq6kajpg","website":"https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a96e0a34cb69d003e24df9c","tickets":"https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a96e0a34cb69d003e24df9c"},{"id":"bc7460b5-c263-4d94-bb4d-5e6f9a981be7","name":"Rebirth: The Quiet Becoming Installation at Fort York","dates":[1785938400000,1786024800000,1786111200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786543200000,1786629600000,1786716000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787148000000,1787234400000,1787320800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1787752800000,1787839200000,1787925600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788357600000,1788444000000,1788530400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1788962400000,1789048800000,1789135200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789567200000,1789653600000,1789740000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790172000000,1790258400000,1790344800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1790776800000,1790863200000,1790949600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791381600000,1791468000000,1791554400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1791986400000,1792072800000,1792159200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792591200000,1792677600000,1792764000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793196000000,1793282400000,1793368800000,1793455200000],"start":"2026-08-05T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Fort York National Historic Site","address":"250 Fort York Blvd, Toronto, ON, M5V 3K9","lat":43.637864096,"lng":-79.406314887},"free":true,"low":null,"high":null,"pwyc":null,"costNotes":null,"description":"Experience a bold new outdoor installation on the Gardiner Expressway beside Fort York Visitor Centre. Created by artists Delali Cofie and Yuma Dean Hester, it reimagines the site’s layered histories through contemporary art. An accompanying exhibition inside the Visitor Centre deepens the experience, inviting visitors to encounter the Fort as a living cultural landscape shaped by reflection, dialogue and collaboration.","categories":["Arts/Exhibits","History","Museum"],"presenter":null,"image":"_QHlUAQMVyNc88AaSDfQ8A","website":"https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/history-art-culture/museums/fort-york-national-historic-site/","tickets":null},{"id":"7e72516d-9322-409d-a44f-421458288de9","name":"Rebirth: The Quiet Becoming Installation at Fort York","dates":[1785938400000,1786024800000,1786111200000,1786197600000,1786284000000,1786543200000,1786629600000,1786716000000,1786802400000,1786888800000,1787148000000,1787234400000,1787320800000,1787407200000,1787493600000,1787752800000,1787839200000,1787925600000,1788012000000,1788098400000,1788357600000,1788444000000,1788530400000,1788616800000,1788703200000,1788962400000,1789048800000,1789135200000,1789221600000,1789308000000,1789567200000,1789653600000,1789740000000,1789826400000,1789912800000,1790172000000,1790258400000,1790344800000,1790431200000,1790517600000,1790776800000,1790863200000,1790949600000,1791036000000,1791122400000,1791381600000,1791468000000,1791554400000,1791640800000,1791727200000,1791986400000,1792072800000,1792159200000,1792245600000,1792332000000,1792591200000,1792677600000,1792764000000,1792850400000,1792936800000,1793196000000,1793282400000,1793368800000,1793455200000],"start":"2026-08-05T10:00:00-04:00","end":"2026-10-31T10:00:00-04:00","allDay":"Day Event","venue":{"name":"Fort York National Historic Site","address":"250 Fort York Blvd, Toronto, 